ios,ph,,14559851587,Thu Sep 17 2026 10:33:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Why do you guys always cancel my orders?!,"Tbh this is the second time this has happened to me and I’m honestly fed up with it, medjo bastos lang sa part na they make you wait for 30 mins to nearly 1hr meanwhile the customer is already hungry at home waiting for the order only for them to CANCEL it last second because apparently there are no riders accepting??? Like you guys literally have thousands of riders but not one can make my delivery??? And i even experienced waiting for food for nearly 1hr kasi pinagpasa-pasahan ako ng mga epal niyong rider na para ba walang value order ko, some of us order kasi pagod kami from work and school kay gusto nalang namin kumain but ganto pa services niyo, nakaka-disappoint! GRAB DO BETTER JUSKO",Elysiannnnn,,,,
