ios,ph,,14557127628,Wed Sep 16 2026 16:19:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,HIGH DELIVERY FEE ON NEARBY RESTO COMPARED TO FARTHER ONES,I CANNOT SEEM TO COMPREHEND HOW THE DELIVERY RATE OF A FAST FOOD CHAIN THAT IS LITERALLY JUST ON OUR BLOCK IS 3x HIGHER COMPARED TO RESTAURANTS THAT ARE WAY FARTHER TO OUR LOCATION! THERE'S NO RAIN OR TRAFFIC FOR THE RATE TO SPIKE THAT HIGH!!!!,krabbypattyy,,,,
ios,ph,,14556216950,Wed Sep 16 2026 11:54:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Make your standard higher - Give penalty to Shops that accepts order and cancel,"Overpriced taxes, food, and delivery fees, plus waiting over an hour only for the order to be cancelled—sometimes because the shop is already closed. This wastes customers’ time and causes unnecessary inconvenience.

Penalize shops that accept orders but cancel after a long wait, and provide vouchers or compensation to customers affected by merchant-related cancellations and delays. Customers shouldn’t have to bear the inconvenience for something beyond their control.

Do something that can fix this kind of inconvenience",Chickendinnerzp,,,,
ios,ph,,14556060612,Wed Sep 16 2026 11:03:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Has Grab’s Service Declined?,"I’ve been a Grab VIP user for years, but lately I’ve noticed a significant decline in the overall service and experience.

Delivery fees and transportation fares seem noticeably higher, while waiting times have become much longer. There have been several instances where I had to wait for hours just to get a food delivery or a ride. On top of that, I’ve experienced more riders and drivers who are rude or difficult to deal with.

As a long-time VIP customer, it’s really disappointing to see the service deteriorate despite my continued loyalty to Grab. At this point, I’m honestly reconsidering whether keeping my Grab VIP membership is still worth it if I’m paying for the membership but experiencing higher costs, longer waiting times, and poorer service.

I hope Grab takes this feedback seriously and looks into these issues, particularly the increasing fees, excessive wait times, and service quality. Long-time customers should feel that their loyalty is valued, not that the overall experience is getting worse.",kimchii0409,,,,
