ios,ph,,14548892303,Mon Sep 14 2026 13:17:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Unwilling drivers,"Don’t know if you’ll see this, Grab. But you’re accepting unwilling drivers here in Baguio city. Been siting here for one and a half hour, not able to beg drivers to accept our booking. One problem is they’ll accept and they’re 0.3km away, then cancel it midway. At least track those drivers what they’re doing and fire them for doing that. And add more control for the bookers. Grab food is better than Grab taxi EVEN IF IT’S RAINING. Fix your system. Been struggling here for 9 months. Goodness",2pillows2,,,,
