ios,ph,,14543053080,Sun Sep 13 2026 00:42:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Unauthorized hidden charges,"I was surprised that there was unauthorized additional fee when you book grab and pay through gcash. When I booked the grab trike, it wasn’t there. This is a form of hidden charges.

Under Department of Trade and Industry (DTI) rules, hidden charges, unannounced fees, and extra surcharges added at checkout are illegal and violate Republic Act No. 7394 (the Consumer Act of the Philippines) and the Price Tag Law.",Micojjjjj,,,,
