ios,ph,,14542604720,Sat Sep 12 2026 21:41:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Overcharged By Their Rider And 4 days Help Desk No Response,"⭐️ 1 STAR


I had a payment issue where I ended up paying twice because of a QR payment problem and the rider cancelling the Grab payment. I have proof of the successful BPI transaction AND the separate payment made to the rider.

I reported this to Grab Support 3 DAYS AGO and still haven’t received an actual resolution. Just waiting, waiting, waiting.

How can a company handle payments but make it this difficult to resolve a basic payment dispute? If you take someone’s money, you should at least have a support team capable of explaining where that money went.

Horrible customer support when you actually need help.

1 star until this gets properly resolved.",BIRCHFRAB,,,,
