ios,ph,,14489063739,Sun Aug 30 2026 08:18:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,GARBAGE,"This app is absolute trash. The food is marked up so high compared to what you’d pay if you just went to the actual restaurant; and the ride-hailing service is completely atrocious. They dangle a ₱50 voucher for delayed pickups, but the app quietly manipulates the ETA behind your back jumping from 7 minutes to 6, then right back to 9 like some absurd game. To top it all off, there is zero human customer support, leaving you stuck arguing with a thoroughly useless AI bot. 

And don't even get me started on trying to use a PWD discount. It takes them forever to validate or add it to your account, and they don't even end up applying it. To top it all off, none of their promo codes ever work either. It’s giving scam. Save yourself the headache and skip this app entirely.

Absolute waste of storage space. DO NOT BOTHER.",nikobanana,,"Hi there, we sincerely apologize that your recent experience with Grab did not meet your expectations. We truly appreciate you taking the time to share your thoughts with us, as your feedback is incredibly valuable in helping us identify areas where we can improve our service quality.

We would love the opportunity to look into this for you and make things right. To help us support you better, please reach out to our dedicated team via our social media channels (Facebook, Instagram, X, etc.) with more details about your experience. We are always here to listen and assist you promptly.

Thank you for your patience and for being a part of the Grab community.

Warm regards,

