ios,ph,,14488720321,Sun Aug 30 2026 05:49:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"Lots of bugs pertaining to topping up, consistent failed purchases on legitimate transactions.","This company and app are full of bugs lots of restrictions on topping up and purchasing as well as bugs. Most frustrating are declined transactions even from credit cards you have used countless times and they keep on blaming that it was the card. Then you go directly to the grocery online store which is absurdly more cheaper, your cards work and has more vouchers that actually works without playing with customers time and with their minds like playing a game of is the voucher live or is it your imagination and it is gone whoops. Your evil demonic company restricts customers from buying food which is a basic need? If you do not want the business of your customers then let your business d i e in hell!!!!",Metacool,,"So sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take appropriate actions. Thank you 🙏️",Tue Jan 10 2023 07:28:27 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14488569713,Sun Aug 30 2026 04:42:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Poor customer service - dumb as doornails,"Updated review:
I have increasingly relied on this app due to my chronic pain. Until recently they used to be able to review incorrect postings and refunded the difference without too much prodding. The contact form was easier to the Beta Support Bot they now employ. It hangs and sends the same script. Asks for screenshots but does not have an attachment button.
A support agent I managed to contact was lazy despite having to repeatedly explain the issue and just checked the updated amount posted by the merchant when I was complaining about the paper receipts not matching the updated digital receipt. Grab owes me 700pesos for the money they are refusing to refund.

Old review:
I have been using this app for food and mart purchases for over a year now. I have had mishaps with poor communication with merchants’ incomplete orders and customer service was able to resolve it. Until last month when my usual merchant incorrectly posted a couple of items on my order that was out of stock. I was deducted for them and after so many attempts so explain the issue with 4 CSRs, supplied sms, paper and electronic receipts — they tell me there was no error and I will not get a refund. They only need to compare the items breakdown on the  paper and electronic receipts to understand. Yet they have not yet grasped it. Are the CSRs just dumb and rely on scripts or are they not bothering to do their work properly because no one audits their efficiency?",functionb4form,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Allow us to make it up to you.  Please reach out to us through our social media channels so we can assist you and take appropriate actions 🙏️ ,Thu Jan 26 2023 00:40:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14488505319,Sun Aug 30 2026 04:13:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,1 star.,"I would like to raise a serious concern regarding the current state of your “Priority” delivery service. Previously, paying for Priority meant getting my orders fast, usually around 30 - 50 minutes, and never taking over an hour unlike the Standard or Saver options. 

