ios,ph,,14395478044,Thu Aug 06 2026 15:52:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Best Food Delivery Rider,"Hello, Grab!

I would like to express my sincere appreciation for one of your drivers (Mr. Richard De Leon from Cavite - Parañaque). His professionalism, dedication, and commitment to his work are truly outstanding.

I am beyond grateful that he accepted and completed my order despite the continuous heavy rain across Metro Manila. The delivery location was about 17 km away, yet he still did his best to deliver my order as quickly and safely as possible. Even if there had been delays because of the weather, I would have completely understood.

I honestly felt bad for placing such a long-distance order, but I really didn’t have much of a choice. I needed to buy that food for my pregnant sister. Before he accepted my order, three other drivers canceled after seeing how far the destination was and how difficult the delivery would be due to the heavy rain and flooding—which I completely understand.

However, this rider is truly one of a kind. Despite the rain and flooded roads, he remained committed and went above and beyond to complete the delivery.

If I could give him 10 out of 5 stars, I absolutely would.

Thank you, Grab, for having such a wonderful, hardworking, and dedicated driver. I also appreciate the excellent service that your platform continues to provide.",sushikath,,,,
