ios,ph,,14350312664,Sun Jul 26 2026 13:17:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Not Satisfied,"Over all, Grab Food is okay— all food cravings are available. However, I think drivers shouldn't have the option to cancel deliveries so easily after accepting them. Tonight alone, 7 drivers canceled the delivery for reasons I don't know. It's frustrating because you never know why someone is ordering food. It could be for a special occasion, a child or simply someone who's hungry and waiting. Repeated cancellation waste customer's time and create a very poor customer service. I hope Grab can improve its system and hold drivers more accountable when they accept and then cancel without valid reasons.",enzelroses,,,,
