ios,ph,,14311199793,Thu Jul 16 2026 18:22:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Marking unresolved issues as resolved,"Very disappointing for such a well-known app. The chatbot just sends you in circles, and it's incredibly difficult to reach a live agent. When you finally do, they tell you they've ""raised a case,"" only for it to be marked as resolved later without actually fixing anything.

