It's frustrating that, in 2026, customer support can still be this ineffective and opaque.",j872176,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Thu Jul 23 2026 06:36:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
