ios,ph,,14265394506,Sun Jul 05 2026 10:00:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Dishonest Rider,"Extremely disappointed with my recent GrabFood experience.

I paid for my order in full via GCash through the Grab app before the delivery. When the rider arrived, he still asked me to pay ₱927. I was busy at the time and completely forgot that I had already paid cashlessly, so I handed over the money.

What is truly unacceptable is that the rider never mentioned that the order had already been paid. Instead, he accepted the cash and left. When I later realized I had been charged twice, I immediately tried calling and messaging him through the Grab app, but he declined my calls and ignored all of my messages.

This is not just poor service—it raises serious concerns about honesty and integrity. A professional rider should have informed me that the order was already paid instead of taking advantage of an obvious mistake.

I expect Grab to investigate this incident thoroughly, refund the ₱927 that I was charged twice, and take appropriate action if the rider is found to have acted dishonestly. Incidents like this damage customers' trust and should be treated seriously.

I hope Grab prioritizes this complaint so that no other customer has to experience the same situation.",Lktmiraj,,We regret to hear about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or on our social media platforms so we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Thu Jul 23 2026 07:03:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
