ios,ph,,14257794170,Fri Jul 03 2026 12:42:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,₱50 CANCELLATION FEE,₱50 CANCELLATION FEE TWICE A ROW FOR CANCELLING FOR ONLY 3 minutes HELLO????,Joshua.09373,,"Hi! Passengers may be charged a Php50 fee for late cancellations. We understand that unforeseen events can affect your booking. You’ll be charged a Php50 cancellation fee if, 1. You cancel after 5 minutes of getting a driver for GrabCar. 2. Your driver has waited more than 5 minutes and decides to cancel your GrabCar booking, or your driver has waited more than 5 minutes for GrabShare.

The full amount will be given to your driver for their time and effort in travelling towards your pick-up point. Cancellation fees are recorded on a separate e-receipt sent to your Grab-registered email.
