ios,ph,,14245723712,Tue Jun 30 2026 16:02:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Pop up promos are scam,"I ordered food from my grab app, first time to order from a new account as I can't remember my old one. A pop up promo popped in my screen, saying about having multiple orders with second order having free delivery if ordered at the same time as the first order, or discounted delivery fee on the second order if done within 15 mins after the first order. I clicked this promo and ordered drinks to complement our first order or meal. Upon checking, the delivery fee was not discounted at all. It's just a scam. Don't believe their pop up promotions as it's just a trick to make you spend more and they will not uphold their promos. Support will even just put your complaints as resolved even though nothing was resolved. They will ask you of screenshots of a pop up promo that you won't expect to not work especially if you're new after not using the app for years",MarieIIe,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Please allow us to make this right. Kindly send us a PM on our social media channels with your Grab details so we can look into this further. Thank you!,Thu Jul 23 2026 07:17:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
