ios,ph,,14231243846,Sat Jun 27 2026 03:54:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Improvements,"Please allow rating a driver who cancelled the ride after the grace period. Sometimes drivers do not follow instructions of pickup points and/or how to get there; driver clicks arrived, 5-min timer runs but he's still not at the pickup point because of him failing to follow instructions. Passenger desperately trying to contact and tell him what to do, 5-min grace period expires and he just gets rewarded for just passively waiting there even though he could have done more to get to where he was needed. I feel that this cancellation fee is being abused at times. I have paid it in several instances and its ok if it was my fault. But sometimes, drivers just don't put in effort to understand and help the passenger enough and just passively wait knowing he'll get his P50 anyway. Would be happy if this gets implemented. thanks!",Alex :( !,,,,
