ios,ph,,14224324554,Thu Jun 25 2026 12:01:27 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Concern Regarding Incorrect Item Pickup by Express Rider,"I would like to raise a concern regarding my recent Express delivery transaction.

The pickup location I provided was at ONG Manokan, which is the same location I have been using for my previous Express deliveries without any issues. However, the rider mistakenly picked up the wrong item. Instead of collecting my package, he picked up a chicken from the location.

What saddened us was that the rider immediately blamed me for the mistake, saying that the issue was caused by the pickup location I provided. However, at no point did he clarify or confirm the specific item he was supposed to collect before picking it up. A simple verification of the item could have prevented this misunderstanding.

I have used the same pickup location many times before, and this is the first time such an incident has occurred. While we appreciate that the rider eventually paid for the wrong item he picked up, we were disappointed by the way the situation was handled, especially because the blame was placed on me despite the lack of proper confirmation on his part.

I hope this concern can be reviewed so that similar situations can be avoided in the future. Proper communication and item verification during pickup would help prevent misunderstandings and ensure a better experience for both customers and riders.

Thank you for your time and attention to this matter.",Cheska Yke,,,,
