ios,ph,,14130815293,Mon Jun 01 2026 11:22:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,scam,Grab stole my money from my bank account. They made an unauthorized transaction and stole all my money in my linked card. It stoles my money bit by bit until theres no any penny left. They wouldn’t give me a refund and until now there are no any actions taken. I would like to press charges and report a scam. I did not make any purchases and subscribe in any of their subscriptions yet they made an unauthorized transaction and stole my money. I already reported this matter to them but they did not make any actions. I hope this will reach you.,Jill2331,,We're so sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so we can assist you further with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Thu Jun 04 2026 10:21:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14130275304,Mon Jun 01 2026 07:37:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,High prives with very picky drivers,Drivers would cancel a lot and complain,Deinacyn,,"We're truly sorry to read about this booking experience. Grab strongly advises drivers to follow and honor the bookings they receive. Rest assured that all cancellations are being reviewed, and they will face reprimands for canceling without any valid reason 🙏",Thu Jun 04 2026 10:21:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14129853552,Mon Jun 01 2026 04:29:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Price Increase after YOU/YOUR driver cancelled?,"What kind of scam is this? After 20 minutes of waiting and none had pick up my booking, I have to re do it, but to my surprise the price from 228 to 265..?? Then your driver cancelled, and once again I have to do it AGAIN, then the price had once more increased!! From 265 to 289? We are experiencing INCONVENIENCE and yet you costing us too much..!!",Jeff M G.,,"So sorry for this booking experience 😔️ . You may be experiencing surge pricing due to increased demand and limited drivers/delivery partners where you are. To ensure that there is an ample supply of drivers/delivery-partners, the fee gets adjusted to compensate them for driving into the area. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this. Thank you! 💚️",Thu Jun 04 2026 10:22:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14128427168,Sun May 31 2026 19:16:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Confusing Vehicle Type Information and Unnecessary Cancellation Fee,"I booked a Grab ride, but I realized too late that I wasn't sure if I had booked a 6-seater or a 4-seater. I had difficulty checking in the app if it was really a 6-seater. I asked the driver what type of vehicle I booked, and he said it was a 4-seater. Since I needed a 6-seater, I told the driver I would just cancel the booking. After canceling, the app still did not clearly show what type of vehicle I had booked. I ended up being charged, and I'm still not sure what type of vehicle I actually booked. My cancellation fee was wasted if my original booking was correct.

My booking id is A-9CM3G5SGWTEIAV


Update June 1, 2026 after I received an email from the developer.

Grab Developer:
Hi! So sorry to hear about this. It looks like you booked a Multi Ride Type Range, which means both the 6-seater and 4-seater options were enabled. To get a 6-seater, choose the 6-seater vehicle and make sure the 4-seater option is switched off.



My response 

What they did not address:
1. Why the app did not clearly show which vehicle type was assigned to my booking.
2. Why you were unable to confirm the vehicle type before canceling.
3. Whether the cancellation fee can be refunded given the confusion caused by the booking setup.
4. Whether the assigned vehicle was actually a 4-seater or a 6-seater.

Thank you for the explanation regarding Multi Ride Type Range. However, my concern was not how to select a 6-seater. My concern is that after booking, I could not clearly verify in the app whether the assigned vehicle was a 4-seater or a 6-seater. Even after canceling, I was still unable to determine what vehicle type had actually been assigned to my booking. Because of this confusion, I incurred a cancellation fee. Could you please confirm whether the assigned vehicle was a 4-seater or a 6-seater and review my cancellation fee for a possible refund?

Lastly, I would like to understand why I was charged a cancellation fee despite the confusion regarding the vehicle type assigned to my booking.

I would also like to ask whether Grab issues an official receipt for cancellation fees. My understanding is that fees collected by businesses are typically supported by an official receipt or similar proof of payment. If a receipt is available, please advise how I can obtain a copy.

Thank you, and I look forward to your clarification on both the cancellation fee and the receipt.",Jude Crisostomo,,"Hello! So sorry to hear about this. Upon checking the booking ID, you have booked a Multi Ride Type Range, which means both the 6-seater and 4-seater options were enabled. To get a 6-seater, choose the 6-seater vehicle and make sure the 4-seater option is switched off. For more information, you may visit https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/4405849449753-What-are-the-available-GrabCar-service-types-and-operating-areas
",Thu Jun 04 2026 10:24:04 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14127033044,Sun May 31 2026 12:11:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab is less trustworthy and reliable,"Very disappointing experience. I left my company ID and immediately used the post-rude chat feature, but the driver never responded despite multiple attempts. Support said they also couldn’t reach the driver, which raise concerns about driver accountability and how effective Grabs lost-item process really is.
This is let even my first unresolved incident with Grab. For a platform that charges premium fares, customers expect better support, reliability, and faster resolution. The experiences like these make Grab feel less trustworthy and push customers to consider alternatives.",Survey respondent,,We're so sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so we can assist you further with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Thu Jun 04 2026 10:24:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14126941294,Sun May 31 2026 11:39:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Good,"Grab is an absolute lifesaver for anyone living in or traveling across Southeast Asia, seamlessly combining ride-hailing, food delivery, and digital payments into one smooth interface. The ride-booking service is incredibly reliable, offering clear upfront pricing and multiple vehicle tiers from budget cars to premium rides. Combined with its GrabFood delivery ecosystem and the secure GrabPay wallet, it eliminates the daily friction of commuting, eating, and handling cash.",Dehlnory,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Thu Jun 04 2026 10:35:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14126880010,Sun May 31 2026 11:16:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Stacked or multiple deliveries causing DELAYS,"GrabFood needs to seriously reconsider its practice of assigning multiple deliveries to a single rider.

The issue is not the drivers. The problem is a system that prioritizes order batching over food quality, resulting in longer delivery times, cold meals, melted desserts, and watered-down drinks.

While this may increase sales and commissions for Grab and partner merchants, customers pay full price for food that arrives in poor condition, and riders are left dealing with complaints for delays they did not create.

If customers are paying delivery and service fees, they should receive food as intended not after it has spent excessive time in transit because of stacked deliveries.

The current system benefits the platform, but customers and riders pay the price.

My recent experience waiting for 55 mins to deliver my food, this is not counting the preparation time, and the merchant is within 3km is crazy!!!!

Do better, Grab.",Evypanda,,We're so sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so we can assist you further with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Thu Jun 04 2026 10:34:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
