ios,ph,,14125803055,Sun May 31 2026 03:36:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,.,Ang hirap mag pin ng loc nakailang ulit ako mag pin sa bagong pwesto ayaw pa din dun pa ren nag pipin sa lumabg pwesto ayusin niyo nga system niyo. Tsaka isa pa kapag nag review location hindi ma pindot yung map di kagaya nung food panda na parang flexible yung app nila pwede pindutin yung map para ayusin yung pin. Tas ang aarte pa nag submit ako ng pic sa shop ayaw tanggapin.,Ms. Maddie R,,We're so sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so we can assist you further with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Thu Jun 04 2026 10:43:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14123619210,Sat May 30 2026 14:40:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Very poor delivery experience and customer service,"I’m very disappointed with this experience. I ordered before 9 PM, but it took a very long time before a rider was assigned. My food arrived very late, already cold, and my drink was completely melted. I also tried to get help through customer support, but I only received unhelpful responses and was told to just wait without proper assistance. This experience caused a lot of inconvenience, especially since this was supposed to be for my kids’ meal. I hope this issue is improved. I am very disappointed and will think twice before using Grab again.",Aishwbjsbube,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Please allow us to make this right. Kindly send us a PM on our social media channels with your Grab details so we can look into this further. Thank you!,Thu Jun 04 2026 10:41:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
