This time, I had a legitimate problem where the product was possibly poisonous but Judy and Aileen refused to help me!",AnonVader,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Please allow us to make this right. Kindly send us a PM on our social media channels with your Grab details so we can look into this further. Thank you!,Thu Jun 04 2026 10:37:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14121532091,Sat May 30 2026 01:16:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Refund for canceled order,"Very frustrating experience. I placed a grocery order before the store’s 8 PM cutoff, but it was later cancelled because the store was already closed. Grab said I wouldn’t be charged, yet I still was and now have to wait days for a refund. This is very inconvenient. I won’t be using my cards on this app again.",yuriisantos,,"We're so sorry for this booking experience 😔 If no booking was confirmed or canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Posting returned funds normally takes 2-3 business days. Don't hesitate to get in touch with your bank up to 30 banking days, as it depends on your card issuer's posting process on their charge reversal policy.",Thu Jun 04 2026 10:36:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14116871892,Thu May 28 2026 19:59:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,UNRELIABLE SERVICE,"Very disappointed with the Grab app. There are a lot of notification bugs that confuse both riders and customers. The app keeps notifying that the booking is delayed or still “out for delivery” even when the rider has already arrived. I only found out the driver was already outside waiting after I personally messaged him.

People pay for convenience and reliable delivery service, but the notifications don’t work properly. Customers should not have to constantly check the app or message the rider just to know the real status of their order. The whole point of paying for the service becomes pointless if the features are unreliable.",GrabUserK,,"We're so sorry for this experience. If your Grab app is not responding or frozen, we suggest checking your internet connection. For more information, you may visit https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115002123007-App-issues",Sun May 31 2026 05:23:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14115569574,Thu May 28 2026 13:07:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Its taking so long,Ang tagal nameng nag hihintay nag order kame 7:00pm tapos hangang ngayon wala pang driver9:30 na and I payed extra para mabiles dumating sabe 30 minutes or less,alamade,,"Apologies for this. It may become a bit more challenging to book due to the high demand for rides/orders. For any issues with Priority delivery, kindly submit a report here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/900005077643-How-to-report-a-Priority-Delivery-issue. Thank you ",Sun May 31 2026 05:25:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14115333135,Thu May 28 2026 11:52:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,ALWAYS CANCELING,DRIVERS ALWAYS CANCEL OUR BOOKINGS LALO NA KAPAG MALAPIT NA TSAKA ICACANCEL!!!,Mnetrotinhell,,"We're truly sorry to read about this booking experience. Grab strongly advises drivers to follow and honor the bookings they receive. Rest assured that all cancellations are being reviewed, and they will face reprimands for canceling without any valid reason 🙏",Sun May 31 2026 05:26:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
