ios,ph,,14107617620,Tue May 26 2026 10:34:15 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,PRIORITY DELIVERY IS 100% A SCAM,"Ordered from  a restaurant. Standard is 35mins, I chose priority with on time promise. Their ""on-time"" promise moves to whatever is convenient. A standard order takes 35mins, chose PRIORITY and it took MORE THAN AN HOUR. How the heck is that priority and on-time promise.",YepJustDont,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations. It could get a bit harder to book because of the high demand for orders. For any issues with Priority Delivery, you may submit a report here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/900005077643-How-to-report-a-Priority-Delivery-issue and this will be investigated. Thank you. ",Sun May 31 2026 06:04:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14107208118,Tue May 26 2026 07:26:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Refund,"I really love how fast to get a refund in grab. Cause there was one time, my gcash (online wallet) was attached on the app, then I book a ride, I accidentally double payed the ride. Cause I didn’t know that gcash would automatically pay for my ride, so I payed it with cash. Then on the next morning I realized that something minus on my money, then I checked the receipt, that’s when I realized that I double payed the ride. Then I sent a refund to the support grab, after like 30 mins, I got my money back.",secretparabibo67,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Sun May 31 2026 06:05:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
