ios,ph,,14003993269,Mon Apr 27 2026 23:24:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,My Go-To App for Rides and Eats: Grab Review,"As someone living in the province who only heads to Metro Manila occasionally, Grab has become my absolute lifesaver for car services and food deliveries. The ease of booking a ride right when I land or take off from the airport is unbeatable—no more stressing over taxis or waiting in long lines. I just open the app, punch in my details, and boom, a comfortable GrabCar pulls up within minutes, even during peak hours.
What I love most is the reliability. Drivers are professional, vehicles are clean, and real-time tracking keeps me updated. For food deliveries, it’s just as seamless—hot meals from my favorite spots arrive quickly, perfect for those late-night cravings after a long trip. Living outside the city means options can be limited, but Grab bridges that gap effortlessly, saving me time and hassle every visit.
If you’re a occasional traveler like me, Grab gets a solid 5 stars for convenience and peace of mind!",SuperJaime08,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Sat May 02 2026 07:33:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,14003528165,Mon Apr 27 2026 20:05:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Poor Experience,"An elderly grab driver picked us up. It was a quick 5 min ride. We were quiet the entire duration and this driver kept hissing the entire ride about the ride cost. He was muttering things like Grab not considering gas prices for the fares. It was very uncomfortable. It’s as if he expects us to add money or tip to make up for the gas. Mind you this is a 1km trip and it was 11pm. The fare is already expensive for the very short ride. Ofc we didn’t tip after the awful experience we had. And because we didn’t tip, he literally retaliated by rating the ride poorly. And there’s no way to complain to grab about this driver’s actions. Grab should look into this more. Very awful experience. Will not choose grab anymore in the future. Grab should brief their drivers about proper ride etiquette. The drivers shouldn’t be airing their frustrations with the platform on the passengers. And we shouldn’t be guilted into tipping when obviously who would want to after being made so uncomfortable during an already very expensive ride.",Bacopamoniera,,We regret to hear about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or on our social media platforms so we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Sat May 02 2026 07:26:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
