ios,ph,,13952468866,Mon Apr 13 2026 04:52:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Do not use this app,"The driver cancelled my booking, yet I was still charged a no-show fee despite the driver never arriving. Instead of refunding the amount back to my credit card, I was only offered a voucher. When I attempted to rebook the same trip using that voucher, I found that the fare had doubled—meaning I would still end up paying more even after applying the voucher. This resolution is unfair and does not adequately address the issue.",Chimps163,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Tue Apr 21 2026 05:10:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
