ios,ph,,13903340426,Mon Mar 30 2026 13:05:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Untimely resolution,"Had an issue with an order, requested for a refund and customer service provided 5x small denomination vouchers instead of 1 transaction. Requested to get a voucher for the total instead and ticket was parked for another 2 days again after waiting a week for a response. Very frustrating and disappointing!",Saltybutniice,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Tue Apr 07 2026 07:13:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
