ios,ph,,13902063178,Mon Mar 30 2026 03:01:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Payment issue,"I hate you grab you making me depressed…. 
I am currently experiencing an issue where my cashless payment options have suddenly been disabled without a clear reason. My GCash account is working perfectly fine, and I have sufficient balance, but Grab is showing that it is not supported.

