ios,ph,,13900240637,Sun Mar 29 2026 15:20:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Such a waste of money,"Worst customer service ever. Grab made a mistake (even their rider messed up) and instead of properly refunding me, I am forced to deal with their broken system. They want to return my money to GrabPay, which I don’t use, just so it benefits them. I have to go through extra hassle for their errors, for a small amount that is rightfully mine. Completely nonsense, irresponsible, and frustrating. Avoid if you value your time and money",pttxsouo,,,,
ios,ph,,13899079103,Sun Mar 29 2026 08:05:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,They choose where you should ride,"For context I am living in a condo, and the condo has a drop off area, the app would not let me choose the drop off area of my condo as a pick up point, they wanted me to walk to a different area, which is very inconvenient, the reason I am booking a grab for convenience. If you would still let me walk, I would have just ride a jeep. Booked at GSM instead they are much more convenient than this app.",lazadaworseonlineshop,,,,
ios,ph,,13897924352,Sat Mar 28 2026 23:20:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Disappontment,"I've been using grab for years and suddenly, my account is suspended. No explanations. No notifications. I still have their annual subscription but i couldn't use it since my account is suspended. Is this how you treat your paying customers????And now, I couldn't even cancel my subscription from the suspended account!!! This is frustrating!",N-xxi,,We're so sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so we can assist you further with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Sun Feb 15 2026 10:11:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
