ios,ph,,13891118332,Fri Mar 27 2026 02:36:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Price Manipulation,"I put voucher then transfer money to my grabpay account, then mawawala bigla yung vouchers. It’s happened twice to me akala ko nung una glitch lang. This time I made sure that I’m lurking on the app for almost 30 minutes, checking the time to make sure na hindi sya lunch or dinner time para “maubos bigla” kung yan man ang panakip butas nila, yet the voucher was there. PERO the moment they confim na mag-oorder ako kasi nag-cash in na ako, biglang wala ng voucher. This is price manipulation. Masaktuhan ko lang kayo, DTI kayo saken. Ang laki nyong company di kayo lumaban ng patas para 50 lang naman vouchers nyo kadalasan pero you really have to manipulate to that extent? For 50 pesos? My gosh. Kaya ko naman bumili with or without voucher like what I did twice (yes pinush ko parin), but for sure hindi lang ako naka experince nito, at kung walanh magsasalita walang mangyayari.",ginriebie,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Tue Jan 30 2024 09:50:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
