ios,ph,,13878238992,Mon Mar 23 2026 11:49:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Scam App: Full of Modus Riders,"This is not a recommended app based on my experience. Their delivery system is prone to scammer riders. This app is not advisable for online payment because many riders take advantage of it. The Grab system seems to tolerate this kind of modus from riders.

If you do not receive your order within the maximum 20 minutes, the app automatically marks it as “delivered,” and the rider keeps the order.

To make this modus successful, the riders do not call the customer so that the customer will not notice that they have already arrived.",Nadz0711,,,,
ios,ph,,13874445529,Sun Mar 22 2026 09:14:06 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Delayed order and Rude Driver,"I had a very disappointing experience with Grab. The service was extremely unprofessional, and the driver was rude throughout the trip. Instead of providing a smooth and respectful ride, the driver showed poor attitude and lack of courtesy, which made the entire experience uncomfortable. As a customer, I expect basic professionalism and respect, but this was definitely not the case. Because of this experience, I would not recommend their service to others. I hope the company takes this feedback seriously and ensures better training and accountability for their drivers moving forward.",JaVillam0626,,"We're sorry to hear about this, and we know that it could have been a better experience. We would like to inform you that we don't tolerate such behavior from drivers. You may rate your Driver as soon as the transaction is completed. Once you’ve given the driver your rating, you may also provide the reasons for your rating. Such feedback is crucial for us to keep getting better 🙏️
",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:17:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13874350539,Sun Mar 22 2026 08:29:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,grab,"My go-to tor everything. From reliable rides to GrabFood and the integrated Wallet, the convenience is unmatched in Southeast Asia.",Kangkong26,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:18:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13873600025,Sun Mar 22 2026 02:24:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Never again will book,"I only ask for the receipt with the toll fee, but they can’t even provide it",EllieBlaire,,"So sorry for the trouble. The receipt you received is our standard receipt used across Southeast Asia. Our system generates these receipts automatically, and due to current system limitations, we cannot edit a receipt after the trip is completed, especially if the driver did not encode the required details before ending the trip. Rest assured, we continuously work to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to check for updates to use our app's features! 💚",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:25:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13872487292,Sat Mar 21 2026 18:47:04 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,WORSE APP EVER!!,"slow everything, eta keeps on changing!!",gugueh,,"Hi there! So sorry for the booking experience. The system automatically allocates our bookings. The exact arrival time of our driver-partner may vary due to unforeseen circumstances, including traffic and weather. In these cases, we will update you on the change in the estimated time of arrival in the app 🙏️",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:40:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
