ios,ph,,13869937767,Sat Mar 21 2026 01:52:03 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Excessive Price Surge at 3:00am,"I tried to book Grab car for a 7.6km ride at 3:00 am. I was surprised that it’s charging P444, even without traffic, the fare was a significantly higher than other ride hailing apps. How is such high surge justified during off-peak hours?? The pricing feels more focused on profit rather than providing a fair service to commuters. Please look into making your rates more competitive ans realistic.
Note tht this experienced occurred before petrol crisis, making the price feel even more absurd.",Pastry217,,"Hi there! You may be experiencing surge pricing due to increased demand and limited drivers/delivery partners where you are. To ensure that there is an ample supply of drivers/delivery-partners, the fee gets adjusted to compensate them for driving into the area. You may also check the promos available to your account. ",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:51:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13868663519,Fri Mar 20 2026 17:18:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Outstanding balances even if you paid.,Hey Grab you have to clearly fixed the billing part of your system because it makes people anxious. I ordered food on the app using credit card and got billed. But then GRAB says I have outstanding balance. So I click settle outstanding balance and boom got billed again. I was double charged and you can’t even answer my report. Im sick of talking with AI. REFUND MY MONEY!,meowxxsiigh,,"So sorry to hear about this. To further assist you, please submit a report here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115005941667-I-can't-make-cashless-payment and a specialist will look into the charges and will get in touch with you. Thank you ",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:55:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13867515125,Fri Mar 20 2026 10:41:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Overpricing,Food will be delivered 2hrs later if you don’t pay more than what your food costs if you want it to be delivered on-time.,Kenny Rogers girl,,"Apologies for this. It could get a bit harder to book because of the high demand for orders. As we work hard to improve our processes, you may want to try other GrabFood delivery options, such as Priority Delivery, which puts your order ahead in the queue 🙏️",Tue Feb 17 2026 05:40:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
