ios,ph,,13867082333,Fri Mar 20 2026 07:04:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Fix your app,"Grab food is not working, im just 10 kilometers from the city yet I am unable go get food and the app is not opening any food store. I have been ordering in this same location yet now i am unable to order.",M erno,,"So sorry for the trouble. The GrabFood tile will only appear if you are within the area where GrabFood is available. GrabFood is available in the majority of Metro Manila as well as select areas in Bulacan, Rizal, Cavite, Laguna, Pampanga, Cebu, Bacolod, and Davao. We continue to add restaurants and expand our coverage areas to serve as many customers as possible.",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:59:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13867031666,Fri Mar 20 2026 06:37:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Best app ever,Very cheap on booking rides and for getting food,"Nanami,K.",,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Tue Mar 24 2026 06:59:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13860347284,Wed Mar 18 2026 08:11:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,So hard to put the address if you are not in the actual place,So hard to put the address if you are not in the actual place,charles12335,,"We’re sorry for the inconvenience with your booking. If Location (GPS) on your mobile is turned on, the Grab app may automatically detect your current address and use it as the delivery/pick‑up reference. If the correct address is nearby, you can ask the delivery partner to deliver to the updated address using the Call or GrabChat feature in the Grab app.

For steps on saving addresses, please visit: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360020645352-How-to-save-a-favorite-place-in-the-app",Tue Mar 24 2026 07:10:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
