ios,ph,,13849821514,Sun Mar 15 2026 06:45:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Make Nutrition Information the Standard,"I really appreciate stores that take the extra step to include the calories and macronutrients for each item. It’s a small detail, but it makes a big difference. I hope this becomes a standard practice rather than just an option for store owners. It doesn’t only help people who are already health-conscious, it can also spark curiosity in others and help them better understand what they’re eating and why it matters.",snailmucin,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Tue Mar 24 2026 07:13:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13849671593,Sun Mar 15 2026 05:27:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Not Pet Friendly,"I have booked rides through Grab multiple times and always make sure to indicate that I am traveling with a pet. Despite clearly tagging the ride as ‘with pet,’ drivers repeatedly refuse to proceed once they arrive and see my dog. This defeats the purpose of having the pet option available in the app and causes unnecessary inconvenience and delays. I hope Grab can address this issue and ensure that drivers who accept pet-tagged bookings are actually willing to complete the ride.",Sophia Gelbolingo,,"We're truly sorry to read about this booking experience 😔 Grab strongly advises drivers to follow and honor the bookings they receive. Rest assured that all cancellations are being reviewed, and they will face reprimands for canceling without any valid reason 🙏",Tue Mar 24 2026 07:14:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13849544158,Sun Mar 15 2026 04:24:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Can’t chat with agent.,Difficult to have issues resolved when ai is powering chat support. No pwd discount on certain stores even when I’m identified as a PWD on my account. THE CUSTOMER SERVICE CHAT ON MESSENGER IS USELESS.,Anger299,,"So sorry for this experience 😞 Please PM us here on FB m.me/GrabPh with your Grab-registered details so we can look into this further. Thank you!
",Tue Mar 24 2026 07:15:29 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13849513890,Sun Mar 15 2026 04:09:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Waiting time was way too long.,"Waiting time was way too long. The rider was handling multiple orders at the same time, which caused a big delay before my food finally arrived, some took more than 1 hr after the food was picked up. I understand riders are working hard, but the system of assigning several deliveries at once really affects the service and the customer’s experience. Hoping this can be improved so orders arrive on time.",Catcscscs,,"We regret to hear about this 😞 We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we continuously work to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to check for updates to use our app's features! 💚",Tue Mar 24 2026 07:18:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
