ios,ph,,13811765589,Wed Mar 04 2026 05:14:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,THIEF!!!,"I have filed a complaint against grab for charging my Gcash account for an order that did not push through. First, I talk to customer service telling them that my order did not go through but why did they charge my gcash. Then Lian (customer support) told me that it will be refunded back automatically for cancelled orders and gave me a 50 pesos voucher. I didn’t ask for a voucher. They charged me 516 pesos. The following day I received notification that 516 pesos was successfully deducted on my account. I then contacted again customer service and now he told me the money will be refunded back after 24 hours as he asked proof that I was charged. I gave him the proof now after 24 hrs (exactly!) my account is suspended!!! So funny. I understand why Philippines is at its lowest compared to other countries. So poor customer service and the corruption and thieves lurking behind this is the worst!!! 

It might be a small amount but shame on these people stealing our hard earned money!",Concershopper,,"So sorry for this booking experience. 😞 If the booking has been canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and will be reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this 🙏️ ",Sat Mar 07 2026 06:52:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
