ios,ph,,13757671758,Tue Feb 17 2026 03:15:02 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,PAYMENT SCAMS!,Be careful with this app. Always check your card billings if you use credit card. They charge for cancelled booking - not just a cancellation fee but also for the whole ride that didn’t happen. Their support center is no help- would direct you to their app and their bot will not help just mark issues as resolved or would not give you any choice to select what the problem is. Better use InDrive or GSM!,quiapogirl,,"So sorry for this booking experience. 😞 If the booking has been canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and will be reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this 🙏️ ",Sat Feb 21 2026 05:43:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13755132401,Mon Feb 16 2026 11:41:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,CHARGING INSANELY HIGH,"We were just hit by a typhoon called basyang and since most of the road were ruined it had caused traffic jam but we are now back to normal. Unfortunately grab is taking advantage of people instead of helping people who were victim of typhoon basyang. Instead, they charge insanely HIGH, like thrice the normal charge. Thankfully, Joyride is a savior for us. They're fair in terms of charge rate.",RashAnime,,"Hi there! You may be experiencing surge pricing due to increased demand and limited drivers/delivery partners where you are. To ensure an ample supply of drivers/delivery-partners, the fee is adjusted to compensate them for driving into the area. Thank you! 💚️",Sat Feb 21 2026 05:45:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
