ios,ph,,13585343149,Fri Jan 02 2026 14:10:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,GRAB is not a good service/app and is often unethical to their merchants and riders,"I have been using Grab for a while now, but I have encountered a recurring issue that is both frustrating and costly. On multiple occasions, I have placed orders from shops that were marked as open on the Grab app, only for the drivers to arrive and find them closed. This has happened to me at least twice, and each time, my money was wasted. Despite the deliveries never arriving, I was still charged for the orders, which is completely unacceptable. When I tried to contact Grab for assistance, I found that my concern did not fit into any of the provided options. I have repeatedly requested to speak with a real person, but due to the app's limited support options, l have never been able to do so.",NKKQ,,"So sorry for this booking experience. 😞 If the booking has been canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and will be reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this 🙏️ ",Tue Jan 06 2026 07:23:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
