ios,ph,,13555883860,Fri Dec 26 2025 06:11:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Deceptive ETA Times Are Unacceptable and Dangerous for Customers,"This morning I booked a Grab ride from my guesthouse to Pattaya Bus Station. The app showed cars nearby and an estimated arrival of about 4 minutes after an initial wait. But that 4 minutes turned into nearly an hour of waiting! This is ridiculously deceptive and a complete waste of time.

I had the exact same frustrating experience at Suvarnabhumi International Airport recently where I waited almost 2 hours for a ride despite the app showing short arrival times. It is unacceptable especially in hot and humid conditions. I actually got sick with the flu the next day from standing outside for so long.

Grab as a multibillion dollar company must fix this serious issue with inaccurate and misleading estimated arrival times immediately. Customers expect reliability and convenience not false information that leaves us stranded and frustrated. This needs urgent attention from your team to prevent harming users health and trust. Do better now!",e565zn,,,,
