ios,ph,,13549808852,Wed Dec 24 2025 13:57:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Nonexistent Customer Support,"I’ve had multiple issues ordering food, mainly due to the lack of proper customer support. Last time, my order was marked as delivered even though I never received the food. There was no way to request a refund, only an AI chatbot with fixed replies, and I never got my money back.

And now, I placed an order from a store in a mall, but the rider later said the mall was already closed and asked for the order to be cancelled. The app wouldn’t let me cancel because the store had accepted the order, and the rider refused to cancel as it would affect his booking rate. Once again, support was just an AI bot with no real help. Very frustrating experience overall. For a platform this big, it’s extremely disappointing that there’s no accessible and effective customer service when real issues happen. I’ve lost both time and money due to these unresolved problems.",Sighwah,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Allow us to make it up to you. Please reach out to us through our social media channels so we can assist you and take appropriate actions 🙏️ ,Sun Jan 04 2026 07:07:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
