ios,ph,,13539497469,Sun Dec 21 2025 17:59:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,App likes to blame riders for system issues,I had a small delivery of sanitary napkins in the middle of the night for an emergency. I was told by the app it would arrive in 20-30 mins. The rider picked up the item already but I could not track him on the app. 30 mins pass and I still can’t see my rider. I contact customer support and their conclusion is that they will “educate their rider” when the problem was their app did not show me the tracking of the rider AND didn’t inform me that the order was batched with other orders (much like it would mentioned on grab car or grab food) It’s not fair to the riders that they are blamed for a problem that’s clearly the app’s fault.,maisdsantiago,,"We apologise for this inconvenience 😔 Please try uninstalling and reinstalling the app. If the problem persists, kindly submit a report on this link: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115006437907-How-do-I-fix-issues-with-the-Grab-app  so we can address your concern accordingly 💚",Wed Dec 24 2025 06:33:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
