ios,ph,,13527520029,Thu Dec 18 2025 14:04:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Disappointed,"Grab has been operating in Cebu for several years, yet it continues to fail in providing a basic, reliable transportation service. Despite the consistently high demand, ride bookings frequently go unaccepted, even in major commercial areas. This is a clear and ongoing failure to balance supply with demand, indicating serious operational incompetence rather than a temporary issue 🤦‍♂️

Imagine, the stark contrast with Grab’s efficient service in countries same as Thailand highlights the deficiency of Grab Philippines, particularly here in Cebu. This long-standing inability to deliver dependable service not only inconveniences users but also reflects POORLY on the country’s transportation system, particularly in the presence of FOREIGN visitors. After years of operation, this level of service failure is unacceptable. NAKAKAHIYA ANG ATING TRANSPORTATION SYSTEM ESP. TO FOREIGNERS.",MJ25**,,"So sorry for this booking experience. During this holiday season, demand for rides increases which might result in longer wait times. To make it easier to get a ride, try Grab Group Ride, a convenient way to share your trip with others heading in the same direction.  More information here: https://grb.to/GroupRides
