ios,ph,,13515074274,Mon Dec 15 2025 03:30:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Diabolical delivery fee,Their calculation for delivery fee is DIABOLICAL because the calculation is WRONG! I went to google map to see my distance from a shop and it is literally 1.1km only! But on Grab it is 11km. YOU ALL ARE EVIL AND STUPID. Your riders are gaining money from DISHONESTY.,FunKin!,,"Hello! So sorry for the trouble. Updates address any known issues or bugs, improving the app's performance and stability for a smoother user experience. By keeping your Grab app up to date, you ensure that you have access to the latest features, security measures, and improvements. Thank you for staying updated and choosing Grab! ",Mon Dec 15 2025 06:00:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13512803674,Sun Dec 14 2025 14:16:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Booooooooo,Where are your drivers?,Relalalalalalallalala,,"So sorry for this booking experience. We’re receiving a high volume of booking requests this holiday season, which may cause longer wait times. Help us by trying Grab Group Ride, a convenient option to share your trip with friends or loved ones heading in the same direction. It’s a great way to reduce wait times and get a ride easier. More details here: https://grb.to/GroupRides",Wed Dec 24 2025 07:50:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
