ios,ph,,13512305015,Sun Dec 14 2025 11:31:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Unauthorized Driver Caused Injury,"Today, I experienced a very alarming and unsafe incident while using Grab.
The driver assigned to my booking called me, but when the vehicle arrived, it was a different person with a completely different license plate number. When I questioned this and realized the mismatch, the person suddenly drove off at high speed. As a result, I fell to the ground and sustained bruises and scratches on my right leg.
I immediately contacted customer service, but I was shocked by the response. I was told that Grab cannot identify who this person was. This raises a very serious safety concern. If this individual was not an authorized Grab driver, how were they able to access my booking details and location?
What if my injuries had been more severe? Who would be held accountable?
I am deeply disappointed by the lack of empathy and urgency shown by customer support. This incident shows a serious gap in passenger safety and driver verification. At this point, I do not feel safe using Grab if unauthorized individuals can pose as drivers and no accountability is taken.",Jer-zar,,,,
ios,ph,,13511334321,Sun Dec 14 2025 04:43:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,GrabCar Drivers,"GrabFood riders are superb, but the entitled drivers na mga car grabe napakasusungit, konting traffic nagpaparinig at nagrereklamo na, its not entitlement na at least treat the people who booked you with respect, pabalang sumagot at ang aarte! Grab should do some seminar kung pano hindi maging rude, kahit wag na friendly or winning customer service, basta hindi lang bastos!",Your Update is STUP-ID,,,,
