ios,ph,,13508649787,Sat Dec 13 2025 13:27:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Favoritism over online than cash payments,"I don’t normally use online payment because I rarely have cash inside my bank or even my grab app, due to cash inside kiosks or store unavailability. 

If we don’t pay using online payment, drivers rarely take the bookings and sometimes we have to wait hours before someone even decides to pick it up. 

I understand grab is just protecting their drivers, but what about the consumers? We don’t deserve to wait for hours especially night times just to wait for drivers to accept the bookings and just be declined hours after on pending for drivers. 

Make a list of those consumers who are always buying through cash with good records, and tag them as good payers, and tag those who have a bad record, and tag those newly created accounts as well!!!",weblattan,,"Hi there! So sorry for the trouble. For a more seamless ordering experience, GrabFood will only accept cashless payment methods (GrabPay Wallet, credit/debit card or e-wallet) for orders above ₱1,000. If you wish to continue using cash, please reduce the number of items in your basket and ensure the order value is below ₱1,000. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Mon Dec 15 2025 05:12:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13507172784,Sat Dec 13 2025 03:43:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Disappointed,"Been using grab for so long, at some point it is unreasonable already. More than an hour waiting time that leads fo delayed and will asked you to wait more and more and when you cancel the booking. It will restric your account like it was your fault. That is bullsht.",Stoopidlalamove,,"We’re so sorry about this booking experience. We’re receiving a high volume of booking requests this holiday season, so it may take longer than usual to book a ride. You may try Grab Group Ride instead to share a ride with friends or loved ones heading in the same direction—making it easier to get around. Learn more here: grb.to/GroupRides",Mon Dec 15 2025 05:16:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
