ios,ph,,13496000761,Wed Dec 10 2025 03:48:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Had me waiting forever,"The driver who picked up my booking have passengers and he has to go around quite a far. It’s not nice to wait for 15 minutes. I’d rather took a taxi, which is much more cheaper.",Dcptan1226,,"When using Grab services, you might notice temporary holds on your payment method in two main situations: when adding a new payment method and when making bookings. For more information about the pre-authorization charges, you may visit this link here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360002010168",Wed Dec 10 2025 06:38:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
