ios,ph,,13495006911,Tue Dec 09 2025 21:12:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,"5/5 – Convenient, Reliable, and User-Friendly","Grab is one of the most convenient apps for transportation, food delivery, and everyday services. Whether I’m booking a ride, ordering food, or sending a package, the app always provides a smooth and hassle-free experience.",Luvixly,,Thank you for your kind words! 😊 We are grateful that you took the time to leave us a 5-Star review. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚,Mon Dec 15 2025 05:34:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13493267823,Tue Dec 09 2025 11:40:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Long waiting time,Takes too long to process orders. Limited to no vouchers.,Salierii1994,,"So sorry for this booking experience 🙏 We're asking for your patience as some merchants might be busy today due to high demand. As we work hard to improve our processes, you may want to try other GrabFood delivery options, such as Priority Delivery, which puts your order ahead in the queue💚",Mon Dec 15 2025 05:42:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13493080962,Tue Dec 09 2025 10:26:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Punctuality,In time and friendly,Onang25,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Mon Dec 15 2025 05:42:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13492899291,Tue Dec 09 2025 09:03:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Hidden booking fee,"My recent experience with Grab PH has been disappointing, especially when it comes to transparency with GrabTaxi fees. The app does not show the booking fee upfront, and this caused a huge inconsistency in my recent trip.

When I booked a GrabTaxi going to my destination, I was charged only ₱30 for the booking fee. But on my way back using the same service, the booking fee suddenly jumped to ₱100—even though it was a Sunday and not traffic at all. There was still no visible breakdown before confirming the ride.

This lack of transparency makes it hard for passengers to trust the pricing. Without showing the booking fee ahead of time, we’re left guessing and hoping we don’t get unexpected charges. For a service that aims to provide convenience, this is a major inconvenience.

Grab should clearly display all fees—including the booking fee before a ride is confirmed. Passengers deserve honest and consistent pricing, not surprises.

Additionally, the customer representative named Joshua was rude, responding with only “Yes” and giving no further explanation.

For now, I will not use Grab unless they fix this issue and improve the quality of their customer service representatives.",Jane_hh,,Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so we can assist you further with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Mon Dec 15 2025 05:44:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
