ios,ph,,13481331148,Sat Dec 06 2025 11:05:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Infested with RUDE FOOD RIDERS,"I’ve had it with GrabFood. Once again, I had a terrible experience when using the app to have food picked up from another location. The rider assigned to my order was unbelievably rude,no basic courtesy, zero professionalism, and this isn't even the first time this has happened. It’s becoming a pattern every time I use GrabFood.

I honestly try to give the benefit of the doubt, but the level of disrespect and attitude from their riders is ridiculous. Meanwhile, whenever I use Foodpanda, it’s a completely different experience — smoother, more polite, more reliable. The only reason I haven’t deleted Grab yet is because Foodpanda doesn’t have enough merchant options in the evening. But the moment they expand their evening options, I’m done. Grab is infested with toxic, rude riders, and I’m sick of paying for this kind of service.",dragin fruit,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed Dec 10 2025 06:51:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
