ios,ph,,13468890179,Wed Dec 03 2025 04:11:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,🙃,"Gave them 1 star kasi hindi nila inuupdate ang store or stocks nila dto sa grab, nung una nagorder ako ng bread pan then wala, at knina lang magorder ulit ako kasi nakalagay naman na may stocks so i added it again on my cart, kaso nagchat sila wala palang stocks. Halos lahat walang stocks. Sana inuupdate ninyo dto sa grab para hndi kami add ng add tapos in the end, wala pala.",Bahdhfnjeieblapaue,,"We're so sorry for this experience 😞 Our merchant partner is in charge of their menu, so they decide which products they can upload to the app. We also asked them to keep their information updated at all times, from their menu to operating hours, so that both riders and consumers are informed. Thank you!",Wed Dec 10 2025 07:06:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
