ios,ph,,13457526360,Sun Nov 30 2025 06:20:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Expensive Pricing somewhat parang corrupt na,Grab you’re doing it again. Rigging prices of services for this upcoming month of holiday. I always book on the same time at the same day and the difference in price for a Grab Car is a ridiculous added amount of ₱200. What a joke. Wala namang traffic. It is sunny. And it is a Sunday.,Nutello9x,,"Hi there! You may be experiencing surge pricing due to increased demand and limited drivers/delivery partners where you are. To ensure that there is an ample supply of drivers/delivery-partners, the fee gets adjusted to compensate them for driving into the area. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Wed Dec 03 2025 08:18:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
