ios,ph,,13431144102,Sun Nov 23 2025 10:23:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Frustrating,"I tried to verify my account multiple times, and it always shows unsuccessful, and it’s frustrating because I submit clear documents and IDs. Is this a scam? Because I do have money that I need to be transferred to another bank, but your app would not approve the verification of my account. Additionally, why your loads in GrabBay don't work is ordering food only works on your app. What’s the use of the other selection if it would not work? Please don’t make it difficult for your customer to use the app, and please verify our account!",1’fyikt,,We apologize if we are unable to verify your wallet. Please note that the BSP mandates the following requirements: You may refer to this link: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360001517648-Why-cant-I-get-verified for more information on why your application is not accepted. Thank you ,Tue Nov 25 2025 06:01:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
