ios,ph,,13425075672,Fri Nov 21 2025 19:40:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Very reliable app,"I’ve been using Grab for around 6 years, and it has become a major part of my daily routine. Whether I’m rushing to class, heading to work, or doing last-minute errands, booking a ride through Grab always feels fast and dependable. I’ve had days when transportation was difficult to find, but Grab consistently gave me quick responses and reliable drivers. GrabFood also became a lifesaver during busy workdays when I didn’t have time to cook or leave the house. I love how transparent the pricing is, how friendly the drivers are, and how smoothly everything is tracked inside the app. The rewards program makes me feel valued as a loyal user, and I’ve enjoyed redeeming perks and discounts. Using Grab feels like having an all-in-one travel and delivery assistant right in my pocket. This will make your life easier. Trust me.",msatty2025,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Tue Nov 25 2025 06:08:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
