ios,ph,,13424696041,Fri Nov 21 2025 17:29:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Fraud Report,"Your driver (Ronnie Vasquez) is a scammer. He ran off with our food (which was already paid for) and said he gave it to some bystanders. He also claimed that he waited for more than 15 minutes, which is why he supposedly gave our order away. He should have handed it to the guards at the entrance of our building since it was already paid for.",mjplazacustomer,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Tue Nov 25 2025 06:11:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
