ios,ph,,13414859606,Wed Nov 19 2025 01:42:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Will waste your time,"Will give you a driver 20 minutes away when your drop off is approx 10 to 12 mins out. From here, will shadow ban your account for wanting a closer driver. 

