Talk about lack of care and malasakit to your loyal customers. 

I’ll be using a different app now.",APVph,,"Hi there! Our bookings are automatically allocated by the system. The actual time of our driver-partner's arrival may differ due to sudden and unforeseen circumstances such as traffic and weather conditions. In these cases, we will update you on the change in the estimated time of arrival in the app. ",Tue Nov 25 2025 06:22:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
