ios,ph,,13404673931,Sun Nov 16 2025 11:46:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Trashy system,"They punish you for booking drivers and cancelling it after knowing you’re not a priority booking (e.g. 15-20mins away). While you also suffer their trashy system of waiting for multiple bookings (ranging from 30mins to 1 hr booking), waiting for the driver to make that 1 stop, will tag the ride as arrived even though they’re not at the location yet and then tag it as cancelled. How can grab ensure to prevent these trashy bookings with drivers to which you cant even rate/report since they cancelled iy in the first place? Endless pattern, until you realized you wasted your time waiting for the booking and should’ve opted for other alternatives. 

