ios,ph,,13374393238,Sun Nov 09 2025 01:29:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Critical App Failure,"After hundreds of successful orders, this single experience demonstrated a critical flaw in both the Grab system and its customer service.
I placed a GrabFood order (pre-paid via GCash) while commuting and close to my final address, expecting the food to arrive shortly after me. I had correctly entered my fixed home address. However, the app failed to prioritize this entered address, instead locking the delivery pin to my current, incorrect, and moving GPS location.
When I called the driver to correct the minor pin issue, he refused to deliver to my actual house address, stating he had another booking. I was left embarrassed, hungry, and forced to cancel a pre-paid meal.

The driver advised me to request a refund through the app, which I immediately did. I have followed up twice on the refund request and have received NO confirmation email, NO follow-up, and NO REFUND to date. This is an unacceptable level of neglect. Grab's system failed, customer support is completely non-existent when you need a refund.",kalii12_,,We're so sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so we can assist you further with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Mon Nov 17 2025 08:04:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
