ios,ph,,13347952262,Sun Nov 02 2025 18:38:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Wasted my money on this app,"I am very disappointed with your service. I used the “Order for Later” feature and chose the time 12:30–1:00 PM. But the rider arrived early at 12:27 PM. He also did not call my phone number. He said he called me through the app, but I did not receive any call. The rider’s contact number on the app was a telephone number, so I could not call him. This is not fair. The problem is not from me, it is from your system and the rider. But you only offered half refund. I can accept that if the issue was my fault, but it was not. This was a very bad experience. I used this app many times before, but after this I will not use it again. I do not recommend this app to anyone because the policy only favors them, not the customers. Please fix your system and customer service.",Hikun01,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Mon Nov 17 2025 08:39:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
