ios,ph,,13345294222,Sun Nov 02 2025 05:14:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Cash payment cncern,"It’s so convenient to order here at grab but my only concern is about the limit of P800 pesos only for cash payment, i hardly load on gcash, paymaya and grabpay wallet so i prefer to pay in cash.",JacV.,,"Hi there! For a more seamless ordering experience, GrabFood will only accept cashless payment methods (GrabPay Wallet, credit/debit card, or e-wallet) for orders above ₱500. If you wish to continue using cash, please reduce the number of items in your basket and ensure the order value is below ₱500. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Mon Nov 17 2025 08:41:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
