ios,ph,,13343170105,Sat Nov 01 2025 17:16:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Last Minute Order Cancellation,I have been using grab for a while now and this is the first time I’ve had this major inconvenience. My order was delayed multiple times because it was taking so long for the restaurant to prepare the food however when the driver got there IT WAS ALREADY CLOSED. If restaurants cannot finish preparing orders before they close they should not be available for customers to choose when ordering. The reason people use grab is for convenience so for it to be causing people inconvenience is counterintuitive.,ak bhsjsh,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Mon Nov 17 2025 08:41:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13340950087,Sat Nov 01 2025 06:43:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Perfect!,"Grab has truly made daily commuting and food delivery so much easier! The app is easy to navigate, and I love how it combines transport, food, and parcel delivery in one platform. Drivers are generally polite, and delivery times are consistent. I also appreciate the real-time tracking and clear pricing before booking. There are occasional bugs or slow loading moments, but overall, the convenience and reliability make Grab worth five stars!",Landosarap 1500,,Thank you for your kind words! 😊 We are grateful that you took the time to leave us a 5-Star review. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚,Mon Nov 17 2025 08:42:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
