ios,ph,,13305474574,Thu Oct 23 2025 22:39:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Trashy app,"I am severely disappointed with Grab's operational reliability and customer support. I have repeatedly been charged for food orders that were never fulfilled because the partnered shops, despite being listed as open on the app, were actually closed upon the driver's arrival. This recurring issue results in customers being billed for services they do not receive, which is unacceptable and constitutes a system failure on Grab's part.

Furthermore, attempting to resolve this matter is impossible due to the app's deficient support system. The provided options do not cover this specific scenario, and I have been unable to bypass automated processes to speak with a human representative.

I demand that Grab immediately addresses two critical issues:

Ensure the accuracy of partner shop operating hours to prevent orders from closed businesses.

Provide immediate refunds for all unfulfilled, yet charged, orders.

Overhaul the customer support options to allow users to easily connect with a representative for financial or systemic issues.",Amandasaragoza12,,"So sorry for this booking experience. 😞 If the booking has been canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and will be reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this 🙏️ ",Wed Oct 29 2025 05:48:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
