ios,ph,,13286662438,Sun Oct 19 2025 13:09:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Order cancellation without notice,"I’m seriously getting fed up with Grab lately. My orders keep getting cancelled over and over again without any notice or explanation! What’s worse is that the app keeps changing the arrival time even though I already PAID the delivery fee!

It takes forever just to find a driver, and after waiting so long, the order suddenly gets cancelled without warning. No message, no update, nothing. What kind of service is that?!

This keeps happening again and again, and it’s honestly unacceptable. If Grab can’t handle deliveries properly, then don’t let people place orders and waste our time and money. Do better, Grab.

Grab’s chat system is completely useless! Every time I try to get help, all I get are automated replies that don’t solve anything. It feels like I’m talking to a robot instead of getting real assistance.

When there’s a problem—like cancellations, delays, or missing drivers—the chat just keeps repeating the same canned messages. No real agent, no actual help, and no updates on what’s going on. It’s so frustrating!

What’s the point of having a support chat if it doesn’t actually support customers? Grab needs to fix this immediately and put real people who can actually respond and do something.",Reasonable basher,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️ ",Wed Oct 22 2025 04:46:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
