ios,ph,,13181047267,Thu Sep 25 2025 02:16:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Not Happy,"I have been using Grab for quite some time, but I have encountered several disappointing experiences.

For ride bookings, it often takes 20 to 30 minutes before a driver arrives because the system assigns bookings to drivers who are far from my location. For food delivery, orders are usually batched, which results in a waiting time of 1 to 1.5 hours. By the time the food arrives, it is often already cold.

