ios,ph,,13135002901,Sun Sep 14 2025 03:56:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Charged 50 Pesos for cancellation,"I appreciate that your platform charges customers for canceling bookings, especially when there's a long waiting time. However, I believe it's essential to consider the customer's perspective as well. In situations where the driver fails to stop at the designated pickup point, doesn't respond to the customer, or creates an unreasonable wait in unfavorable conditions (like rain), I think it would be fair to waive the cancellation fee. After all, both parties are waiting, and it's not always the customer's fault. For instance, I recently experienced a situation where the driver didn't stop at the pickup point and wasn't responsive, making it challenging for me to proceed with the booking. Considering the inconvenience and the amount of 50 pesos, which isn't negligible, I hope we can revisit the cancellation policy to account for such scenarios. I believe this would promote a more balanced and customer-centric approach.",RJ Barbz,,So sorry for this booking experience. Allow us to review this. Kindly submit a dispute here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115005276987-Why-am-I-charged-a-cancellation-fee and our dedicated team will get in touch with you 🙏️,Wed Sep 17 2025 05:28:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
