ios,ph,,13134801032,Sun Sep 14 2025 02:36:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Drivers cancelling 5-10 mins after waiting,Your grab drivers keep on making us wait far too long before finally cancelling. They usually drop off their current passenger first before cancelling on us. This is very time consuming,binsent P,,"We're truly sorry to read about this booking experience 😔 Grab strongly advises drivers to follow and honor the bookings they receive. Rest assured that all cancellations are being reviewed, and they will face reprimands for canceling without any valid reason 🙏",Wed Sep 17 2025 05:30:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13133418315,Sat Sep 13 2025 17:51:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Sad that their “Promos” gives False Hopes,"Been noticing that there would be special promo but wouldn’t apply for unknown reasons when you know your order qualify. Didn’t mind it at first because I understand there are mechanics but lately, It’s kind of baity, scammy. Last order definitely gave me the biggest ick because the promo popped up and it applied then it switched to an error on a yellow banner. Tried a couple of times until the promo wouldn’t apply anymore. Call me cheap but that was it. As a loyal user, it really wouldn’t hurt to be more felxible with your offers. But oh well, will be laying off using Grab.",Sinigeng,,"Hi! So sorry for the trouble. You can view the full Terms & Conditions in the Grab app by going to Offers and selecting the promo to check if you meet all the promo’s Terms & Conditions (e.g., validity dates, eligible services/locations, minimum spend, payment method, and account eligibility). 

To stay updated on future promos, follow our official Facebook page.

If you’ve confirmed eligibility but still can’t apply the promo, share the promo code and a brief description of what you’re seeing so we can help further.",Wed Sep 17 2025 05:37:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13132751866,Sat Sep 13 2025 14:43:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Expense and time,"During lunch meal peak hours. Riders tend to deliver it delayed food always not that fresh almost cold. Grab riders tend to make more orders in one go then your food gets cold. Hence, You paying orders with extra price and extra for the delivery fee. All items has raise of prices very far from the store price yet the service is a joke at these times",Foodpandaisb3tter,,"Apologies for this. It may become a bit more challenging to book due to the high demand for orders. As we work hard to improve our processes, you may want to try other GrabFood delivery options, such as Priority Delivery, which puts your order ahead in the queue 🙏️",Wed Sep 17 2025 05:39:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
