ios,ph,,13127777703,Fri Sep 12 2025 09:40:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab gift,I just purchased a grab gift food voucher but is not working. The voucher is not useable. Spent 1k for the voucher. useless af!,Shikima Shikizizika Vvvvv,,"We regret hearing about this 😞 Kindly submit a report here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360033165912-I-have-a-GrabGift-issue, and our dedicated team will check on the voucher you bought. Thank you ",Wed Sep 17 2025 05:53:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13124328313,Thu Sep 11 2025 11:32:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"High fares, low to mid standards - Grab needs to do better","I really don’t understand how Grab pairs cars with passengers. During the day, when the heat is unbearable, I often get cars with no proper air-conditioning in the back. This leaves passengers either suffering in the heat or having to argue with the driver just to turn the AC up. But at night, when the AC isn’t as needed, that’s when we get properly cooled cars.

Considering how high the fares are, I expect a more comfortable experience, but most of the time, it’s not the case. I don’t blame the drivers entirely, because it’s Grab that allows these kinds of vehicles on the platform. Grab should take responsibility for its customers and the quality of service.

Another concern: there should be an option in the app for passengers to decide whether we want to use tollways or not. With already expensive fares, many of us prefer to avoid additional costs. But even if we tell drivers not to use tollways, some still take them, leaving us cornered in the middle of the ride. Again, this is something Grab should manage, instead of putting all the blame on the drivers.

If Grab keeps allowing these issues to persist, they will just keep happening again and again. As a paying customer, I’m tired of it. Grab, please do better.",Promenando,,"So sorry for the booking experience, Promenando. Our main goal is to provide a clean, safe, and comfortable ride for everyone using Grab. If you think your driver's vehicle doesn't meet the standard, please rate the driver. Your feedback helps us improve and create a better experience for all Grab users 💚️",Wed Sep 17 2025 05:57:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13123304563,Thu Sep 11 2025 03:56:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Victoria Bites,"Ang sarap ng food and malinis. We will definitely order again. I guarantee you, masarap pa sa Jowa mo.",Juherto,,"Hi there, thank you for your feedback! We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with us 💚",Wed Sep 17 2025 05:58:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13123181318,Thu Sep 11 2025 02:58:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Let cash be available above 900 too,Let cash be available above 900 too,Jovic Trinidad,,"Hi there! For a more seamless ordering experience, GrabFood will only accept cashless payment methods (GrabPay Wallet, credit/debit card, or e-wallet) for orders above ₱1,000. If you wish to continue using cash, please reduce the number of items in your basket and ensure the order value is below ₱1,000. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Wed Sep 17 2025 05:59:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
