ios,ph,,13121393596,Wed Sep 10 2025 15:29:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,This nee update is makingbit hard for people.,I sent money to grabpay from my cousins account since grab will nit let my gcash send money to it. And it asked me to verify AGAIN! Then it made it worst since it has been nearly a week since I sent the money to grab pay to pay for movie tickets last saturday so we won’t have to go through the line. Instead of it being so convenient it has become a HUGE INCONVENIENCE! I’ve been made to verify my account for the 5th time now since saturday. I think grab is just trying to steal money from people.,inspector ice,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed Sep 17 2025 06:11:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13121391752,Wed Sep 10 2025 15:28:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Ordering for someone from the province,"Okay yung app. Pero may one issue lang ako.

I use the app pag napapadpad ako cities, which is great. It does what it has to.

Pero I’m from the province kung saan hindi available ang grab. Yung issue ko is when I have to order food for someone (who doesn’t have time to order kasi busy) pero nawawala yung food option kasi naka auto sa’kin yung gps.

When food option disappears, there isn’t an option to select a location sana kung san ako oorder ng food or baka nakatago lang (UI issue?). 

It would be nice if the food option stays and may pop up nalang to select a different location kung hindi siya available sa lugar namin.

I’ve tried using the search bar, selected a different address, tapped on the food tab, pero walang resto suggestions na lumalabas, and kung tinatry ko magsearch mag a-uto shift siya sa grab car.

Food panda has the option to select an address sa taas ng searchbar sa mismong home UI ng app. Not sure why grab doesn’t do the same.",ALP_2,,"Sorry for the booking experience. GrabFood is available in the majority of Metro Manila as well as select areas in Bulacan, Rizal, Cavite, Laguna, Pampanga, Cebu, Bacolod, and Davao. We continue to add restaurants and expand our coverage areas to serve as many customers as possible. 

Rest assured, we continuously work to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚


",Wed Sep 17 2025 06:09:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
