ios,ph,,13105088073,Sat Sep 06 2025 10:33:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Deliveries take too long if cash payment,"I’ve been waiting for almost 2 hours for a delivery. It keeps in saying “delivery delayed.” Grab should ask the merchant for live updates. After 2 hours of wasted time. Please fix this. Other than this, the OFFERS that I used for that order, when Grab cancels my order, CANNOT be redemmed anymore. So much wasted.",LabGabB.,,Hi! So sorry for this booking experience 🙏 We're asking for your patience as some merchants might be busy due to high demand. Hope you'll be able to book your order soon 💚,Wed Sep 17 2025 06:52:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13104970730,Sat Sep 06 2025 09:49:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,SUPER HIGH MARK UP,Super high mark up,Austin Barron,,"Hi there! You may be experiencing surge pricing due to increased demand and limited drivers/delivery partners where you are. To ensure that there is an ample supply of drivers/delivery-partners, the fee gets adjusted to compensate them for driving into the area. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Wed Sep 17 2025 06:57:04 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13104219910,Sat Sep 06 2025 04:38:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"Driver not communicative, Slow report progress, Not updated location pins","PLEASE READ. Don't skip ahead.
Hello, Grab. Writing this review after a bad experience with our delivery today.

Ordered 3 portions of 1 pc. Chicken here in Jolibee Kaytikling Branch that was supposed to arrive at a specific location. This specific location is not even detected by the Grab Maps, but it was detected in other applications, like Google Maps.
So I resorted in finding the nearest landmark instead.

Here comes the delivery, the driver had arrived at the exact landmark I pinned. And instructed him thru chat that he needs to go further inside, as the exact location is NOT available on Grab Maps.

The driver was communicative on our first few minutes of interaction, but became unresponsive AFTER ""completing"" the order.

We did NOT receive the order, nor it was received by the right person.

I reported it today, and the driver only responded after 1 hour and 30 minutes after the order has been allegedly ""completed"". Despite my clear instructions on where he needs to go, we received negative attitude from him.

The driver allegedly mentioned that the order has been deducted on his end (from which I don't know if I can fully trust) and we will be able to receive a refund.
Until then, this review will remain 1 star.",Gab-Jeremy,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed Sep 17 2025 07:00:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13101245104,Fri Sep 05 2025 11:18:29 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Bataan Area 👎👎👎,"I’m getting disappointed with this app. Drivers are rarely available, and when they are, deliveries are always late. It wastes a lot of time waiting, only to end up with the order being canceled after a few hours. This makes the service completely unreliable. I expected a convenient food delivery experience, but instead it’s been frustrating and time-consuming. Definitely not worth it until they fix these serious issues.",EEMMSSIII,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed Sep 17 2025 06:58:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13101156273,Fri Sep 05 2025 10:48:15 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,GrabFood Customer Service,"I've only used Grab recently; this afternoon, I ordered food from a restaurant and albeit me requesting cutleries, I did not receive cutleries with my order. I then contacted Grab regarding my order, hoping that they will advise the restaurant for future orders regarding order accuracy—I did not expect to actually get a full refund! The refund was also very fast that I was taken aback. Definitely a 10/10 Customer service. The deliveries are also very quick so that's a plus.",OsirisEnvy,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Kindly send us a PM with the booking ID so we can review the refund that was mistakenly processed. We encourage you to use the Grab app to rate and share feedback. Your input helps improve service quality for delivery-partners and merchant-partners. Grab ensures partners follow strict service standards. ,Wed Sep 17 2025 07:04:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,13100903591,Fri Sep 05 2025 09:10:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Annoying Cancellation,"After 1hr of waiting, they just cancelled my order without reasons. Uninstalling this app and switching to its competitors.",Renzu@9399,,,,
ios,ph,,13099837997,Fri Sep 05 2025 01:15:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Overpriced,Konti ang Grab Taxi before 9 AM. Masyado na mataas prices sa grab tapos ang tagal pa dumating,Bea Bai.,,"Hi there! You may be experiencing surge pricing due to increased demand and limited drivers/delivery partners where you are. To ensure that there is an ample supply of drivers/delivery-partners, the fee gets adjusted to compensate them for driving into the area. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Wed Sep 17 2025 07:14:29 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
