ios,ph,,13094901991,Wed Sep 03 2025 18:11:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Garbage App and Problematics Drivers,"Grab has become absolute garbage. Drivers accept a booking, make passengers wait forever, then cancel just because they took the wrong direction. This has happened multiple times, and every time I reported it to Grab support, nothing improved the system remains broken. If passengers can’t cancel freely without penalties, then drivers shouldn’t have the privilege to waste our time like this. It’s unfair, unreliable, and abusive. At this point, it feels pointless to complain to Grab because support does nothing. This deserves escalation to the LTFRB since the service clearly fails to protect passengers.",urITGuy,,"We're truly sorry to read about this booking experience 😔 Grab strongly advises drivers to follow and honor the bookings they receive. Rest assured that all cancellations are being reviewed, and they will face reprimands for canceling without any valid reason 🙏",Wed Sep 17 2025 07:14:03 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
