ios,ph,,13019391619,Fri Aug 15 2025 14:26:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Very Disappointed — App is Almost Useless Lately,"I’ve been a loyal Grab user for years, but lately the app has become almost useless. It’s extremely difficult to get a driver. Most of the time there’s no driver available, and when there is, the one assigned is 30 minutes away and the ETA isn’t even accurate. Many drivers ask me to cancel, and some don’t even bother notifying — they just make me wait for a long time then cancel last minute, wasting my time.
Drivers also often complain about my pin location, telling me to walk far to another street so they won’t have to make a U-turn — even if that distance is part of what I’m paying for. Some are outright rude. Others are too lazy to take a trip even if they’re just 10 minutes away, insisting I cancel because “it’s far,” even when I’m willing to wait.
There are also cases where the driver “arrives” but doesn’t pick me up at all, which is incredibly frustrating. I even have a Grab Unlimited subscription for the 8% discount, but it’s useless because many drivers cancel when they see the fare. Sometimes it’s impossible to get a ride with the voucher on, but when I remove it, suddenly there’s a driver.
The past few weeks have been extremely challenging — either there’s no driver, or the rare one who accepts will cancel due to distance or fare. Very disappointing for an app I used to rely on daily.",Keep up Grab!,,Grab strongly advise drivers to follow and honor the bookings. Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms so we can further assist you with this. Thank you! ,Sun Aug 17 2025 07:04:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
