ios,ph,,13019001947,Fri Aug 15 2025 12:40:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,POOR CUSTOMER SERVICE,"My grab account was suspended a month ago for no reason. I don't cancel bookings because I really need to use it. Now, I filed for an appeal but got no response for a month then you suddenly charge me my subscription even my account is cancelled? Ridiculous!",elyqt13,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can further assist you with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Sun Aug 17 2025 07:07:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
