They gave ₱50 only for raising a concern about my food. RIDICULOUS! 😌",ShouldNotBeNamed,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Sun Aug 17 2025 09:48:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
