ios,ph,,12944362085,Sun Jul 27 2025 23:14:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Great but sometimes…,"Grab’s absolute go-to when it comes to travel and I also love that the app provides other services. For context, I am a PWD card holder so even if traveling via a car hailing app is on the more expensive side as compared to the normal commute scheme, I prefer using this for my own safety and comfort during the commute. However I’ve noticed that whenever I try to book using my discount privileges, it takes forever to be able to book a driver or my booking gets cancelled without any thought whilst booking a normal ride takes less than a few minutes— only ever taking longer in periods of bad weather or during the rush hour. I understand that our driver partners need to earn a living but the obvious preference to regular bookings over discounted ones are a little bit unnerving. The same situation also goes for my nieces or nephews that travel to school through a booking via this app. In the same vein, I allot about 3 hours for every single time I need to travel— be it to the hospital or some place else. First, of course is to cater to traffic but another reason is because of the long time it takes to get my booking accepted. I am aware that drivers are notified if their passengers are those with these special privileges, but if I may suggest to only have them informed through the app when they have already arrived at the pick up point. This is mostly to avoid bias and obvious preferences against discount holders.",Kind of Hopeful,,Apologies for this. It could get a bit harder to book because of the high demand for rides/orders. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so that we can take appropriate action. Thank you 🙏️,Sat Aug 23 2025 08:08:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
