ios,ph,,12892657096,Tue Jul 15 2025 01:11:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,"For scheduled bookings, some drivers are not aware of the scheduled time","This happens quite frequently already so driver is rushing me when they arrived more than 15 mins to the pickup location. When scheduled driver accepted the booking and suddenly cancels, the driver who gets to accept the booking don’t know it’s a scheduled booking. They’ll tell me Grab didn’t inform them, only I know it’s a scheduled booking and suddenly they are getting mad for it and the experience is very poor already!",softwareQAengr,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Mon Jul 21 2025 14:31:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
