ios,ph,,12870649595,Wed Jul 09 2025 10:25:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,No Real Support – Riders Are Rude Because There’s No Accountability,"I’ve been a loyal Grab user for years. I tip riders generously, I use the platform regularly, and I try to make every order smooth, even though my address can’t be pinned properly.

But recently, I had a terrible experience with a rude and unprofessional delivery rider who kept complaining even before completing the delivery. I explained the pin issue clearly and even showed proof, but instead of cooperating, he just kept making remarks and was also disrespectful to my aunt who tried to help.

What’s worse is that when I tried to report it, I found out there’s no way to speak to a real person. The Help Center is just a bot that loops you around. I messaged Grab on every channel, Facebook, Twitter, email, and I still got either no reply or only automated messages.

As a paying customer who tips riders generously and uses the platform regularly, I expect at least a basic level of human support when something goes wrong. Instead, I was left feeling helpless and unheard, while the rider was allowed to behave badly with zero accountability.

This is probably why some riders feel bold enough to be rude because they know nothing will happen. There’s no proper reporting system, and no one to hold them accountable.

Grab needs to seriously fix their customer support system. If you’re going to run such a huge platform, you should have real, accessible human agents to handle serious complaints not just bots that go in circles.

I’m very disappointed. This is not the kind of service loyal users deserve.",Pashneya! Warka!,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Mon Jul 14 2025 06:55:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
