ios,ph,,12740351554,Thu Jun 05 2025 22:06:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Accepted but unresponsive,"I generally love Grab as it’s easy and convenient to use most of the time. Unfortunately, drivers who accept bookings but suddenly become unresponsive leaves a bad taste in my mouth. This has happened multiple times already, so I have to put up a review. They won’t even bother to send a message that they’re no longer pushing through with the booking, nor answer my calls through the app. Gaano ba kahirap gawin yan? I hope Grab will do something about those drivers, you can’t even rate them since mapipilitan kang icancel ang ride.",AcceptedButIgnored,,"We're truly sorry to read about this booking experience 😔 Grab strongly advises drivers to follow and honor the bookings they receive. Rest assured that all cancellations are being reviewed, and they will face reprimands for canceling without any valid reason 🙏
",Tue Jun 10 2025 15:07:27 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
