ios,ph,,12707850413,Wed May 28 2025 13:46:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Repeated Order Cancellations & Unresolved Service Issues,"Dear GrabFood PH,

 We are extremely frustrated and disappointed with the repeated poor service we've been experiencing with your platform. This is not the first, second, or even third time this has happened — we place an order, pay in advance, wait for over an hour, only to have the order delayed and then ultimately cancelled. There seems to be no effective system or accountability in place to prevent this from happening. To make matters worse, we receive no compensation — not even a voucher or discount — and the refund process is so slow, it becomes impossible to place a replacement order right away. We’re left hungry, inconvenienced, and completely dissatisfied. It is unacceptable for a company of your scale to repeatedly fail at such a basic service without offering any real solutions or customer support. If these issues are not addressed immediately, you risk losing your loyal customer base. We expect a proper explanation, quicker refund resolutions, and actual compensation for the inconvenience and repeated failures on your end.",Elaine Vee,,"Apologies for this. It could get a bit harder to book because of the high demand for orders. As we work hard to improve our processes, you may want to try other GrabFood delivery options, such as Priority Delivery, which puts your order ahead in the queue. 🙏️",Wed Jun 04 2025 15:52:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
