ios,ph,,12704011016,Tue May 27 2025 13:19:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,five hour waiting time,"i ordered a sushi bake at 4 pm. i paid for priority delivery cause i was hungry and i wanted my food FAST— like the app promised. i told me it would arrive by 5 pm. reasonable right? WRONG

i sat at my dining table like an absolute clown for five hours watching the time tick by as my stomach devoured itself and my patience evaporated. and what happened at 5 pm? they CANCELLED the order. no warning, no compensation, no apology, just a notification like “oops! guess ur not eating tonight”

and when i tried to contact support i didnt even get a real human being. like hello?? just the most infuriating bot ive ever had to deal with. it felt like being at a date with an uninterested man. it just kept giving me EXCUSES like “heres why ur order isnt arriving… peak hours, less drivers” like that was supposed to help. i didnt want an excuse i wanted a SOLUTION. i wanted to speak to the restaurant and i wanted ANYTHING that made me feel like an actual person and not just a number in your broken system

so THANKS for wasting my time, ruining my night, and leaving me hangry, furious, and betrayed you smooth headed PHILISTINES",kingderpdaddy,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed Jun 04 2025 15:56:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
