ios,ph,,12690974272,Sat May 24 2025 03:39:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Cash only up to 1000Php when delivering food,"This app is so annoying. When my order exceeds to 1000 pesos, it will automatically change into the mobile paying option. In other words, cash on delivery is not available unless you order below 1000 pesos. It's just inconvenient to the part where im not really an online paying person and having this problem is just making things harder. At the end of the day, food panda is much more better because I won't encounter situations like this and has much more offer to give.",CheiLuwi,,"Hi there! For a more seamless ordering experience, GrabFood will only accept cashless payment methods (GrabPay Wallet, credit/debit card, or e-wallet) for orders above ₱1,000. If you wish to continue using cash, please reduce the number of items in your basket and ensure the order value is below ₱1,000. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Wed May 28 2025 15:43:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
