ios,ph,,12680147538,Wed May 21 2025 08:51:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Confusing Voucher Usage Experience,"I'm annoyed at how Grab lists all these vouchers but all of them are unusable during check-out. And they don't show the reason why your order is ineligible. I'm starting to think if it's just a marketing scheme to get you to order more, but upon check-out you won't get a discount after all. For an app that's been available for years, I don't understand why they couldn't improve this part of their customer's experience.

