I hope the Grab's devs would consider this for the next update.",chor1989,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we continuously work to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Wed May 28 2025 15:50:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,12679040535,Wed May 21 2025 00:32:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Getting worse and worse,"Used to love grab for its convenience, but now they’ve really started to go downhill in terms of customer experience. I’ve been waiting for longer and longer periods of time for my food without the option of cancelling even when it’s taking too long. If they can be strict on customers who take too long to arrive at pickup points etc, they should also impose the same standards on partners or offer compensation to customers for the extended wait times.",j h_08,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we continuously work to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Wed May 28 2025 15:51:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
