ios,ph,,12657835478,Thu May 15 2025 07:29:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Long waiting,"Either it’s Grab Car or Food, the waiting always takes too long. It always say “no driver, add tip” like it’s already a fake notification or a strategy among riders when I know there are always standby riders outside our compound. You should put in your system to automatically accept whoever is the nearest. It’s their job to take orders when they signed up to be hail or delivery riders.",iseldomwritereviews,,,,
