ios,ph,,12657182710,Thu May 15 2025 02:15:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Poor Customer Service,"They suspended my account due to fraudulent activity when I just ordered grabfood that time and then suddenly my account shut down. I made tons of submissions on their Appeal Form. No one responded to me… Why can’t I talk to an agent or even email??? This is so unfair.

Now even with creating a new account I can’t use my cc or my gcash because it’s associated with my suspended account. This is very inconvient grab. please fix this. 

