ios,ph,,12655081898,Wed May 14 2025 13:13:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,NOT RECOMMENDED,Laging galit yung driver tapos may mga kulang kulang pa sa order. Tapos customer pa ang mag aasikaso.,Dasdrake,,,,
ios,ph,,12655044439,Wed May 14 2025 13:01:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab won’t return my money after not getting my food!!!,"Absolutely terrible experience with Grab. I ordered food and didn’t receive one of the items (mac and cheese). Grab support admitted I didn’t receive it but still refunded the wrong amount—they only refunded the part I paid with my card, and completely ignored the value I paid using BPI credit card points, which are just as valid as cash.

What’s worse, the agent handling my case was rude and dismissive. After I calmly explained everything in two short, clear emails, she simply stopped replying and closed the case without solving the issue. I even had to send multiple follow-ups just to be ignored.

They told me they wouldn’t refund the rest because there was a “similar incident” in the past. How is that my fault? It’s always either the store or the rider making mistakes. I use Grab frequently, and the number of issues I’ve had is less than 1% of my total transactions. But now they’re punishing me for repeatedly being the one affected?

This is completely unfair. The accountability is nonexistent. I will be reporting this to DTI for the undelivered item and BSP for the misuse of credit card points. Just because it was a voucher doesn’t mean it’s worthless. Grab, do better. Your loyal users deserve respect and fairness—not silence and blame.",Poleng14,,,,
