ios,ph,,12653202990,Tue May 13 2025 23:29:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Poor driver training,"My booking was cancelled. Please refere to this booking number A-7SAQ2QNWWIEAAV we waited 10 mins for the driver, but we cannot do anything to report the driver.",Bernadeth Rebulanan,,,,
ios,ph,,12651917349,Tue May 13 2025 15:26:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Quality of Service Decline,"Disappointed with Grab for the past few months. There’s a decline in the quality of cars and the service. Subscriptions are very greedy. You can have two grab subscriptions that give 8% discount for rides but it cannot stack. What’s the value of the grab unlimited car then? Why is possible the two subscriptions? Shouldnt grab notify you that you’re already subscribed to Grab unlimited and therefore Grab Unlimited Car should be unsubscribed? It even auto renews monthly without notifying you. Another issue is the quality of cars. Most cars have weak air conditioning. You’d think that good vehicle conditions should separate the Grab Car from Grab Car Saver option, but no. Both are old and smelly vehicles most of the time. It’s like a lottery. Make it make sense.",Mabe0918,,,,
ios,ph,,12651845137,Tue May 13 2025 15:03:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,I’ve always been using Grab—not until earlier!,It’s my dad’s birthday today and we have some guests over. I ordered pizza at 9pm and it said the estimated time was about 50mins. About an hour later notification appeared saying that my order would be delayed for about 10 more minutes since there aren’t any drivers/riders available. It delayed about 2 times until the app cancelled the order without notice. My parents went to the physical store to sort it out and we were told to report the order. There must be something wrong with the app. It isn’t usually like this. I am so disappointed—our time had been wasted!!!,iyannaaa_,,,,
ios,ph,,12651665512,Tue May 13 2025 14:06:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,👎👎,"Sana may option na customer can cancel if 30 minutes na wala pa din rider na nag aaccept ng order. I’ve experienced a lot of times na almost 2 hours wala pa din rider, and ending cancel. Kung na cancel agad yun e di sana naka order na agad ng iba!😡😡😡",MRGM2,,,,
ios,ph,,12651185725,Tue May 13 2025 11:28:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Appreciation Post,"Hello Grab! I don’t usually leave reviews here in app store, but I just want to leave this review while updating the app. I just want to say how amazing this app has been. I use this everyday for grabfood & mostly grabmart. For reference, I’m a mom of a newborn baby, and that explains why I don’t have time to take care of myself because of the billion things I have to do at home. But because of Grab, I can order my foods conveniently with just a few taps. You do not know how many times this app saved my time. I already used all of your features and I have not been disappointed for once. So thank you so much to whoever made this app possible.",Ms. Eka,,Thank you for your kind words! 😊 We are grateful that you took the time to leave us a 5-Star review. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚,Tue May 07 2024 01:48:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
