ios,ph,,12478702946,Sat Mar 29 2025 14:15:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Payment transaction Fails,"This app is so disappointing, payment and orders always fail and having issue on food order and ride, instead of using the app try to use other riding app and food delivery app! They also don’t have a customer service to call on to",Evan Marou Lopez,,"We apologize for this inconvenience 😔 Please try uninstalling and reinstalling the app. If the problem persists, kindly submit a report on this link: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/articles/115006437907 so we can address your concern accordingly 💚",Tue Apr 01 2025 06:30:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,12478675219,Sat Mar 29 2025 14:07:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Frustrating Delays & Payment Pressure,"I was really counting on Grab to deliver some drinks and food to keep me energized while studying, but the experience ended up being more stressful than helpful. I waited 30-40 minutes, and there was still no assigned rider. Given that we have a curfew, this delay wasn’t just inconvenient—it added unnecessary pressure.

On top of that, the app seems to subtly push cashless payments, which is frustrating when I prefer (or only have) cash on hand. After waiting too long with no updates, I had no choice but to cancel my order—a complete waste of time.

Overall, this was a disappointing experience. Grab is supposed to be a convenience, but tonight, it just added to my stress.",cjam10,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Tue Apr 01 2025 06:31:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
