ios,ph,,12441681281,Thu Mar 20 2025 07:28:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Nonexistent customer service,"Do not use this app unless you’re okay with having no customer service. They will find every way to NEVER let u talk to an actual person. In fact, someone scammed my mother and they were able to get grab money using her CC details but grab would NOT help us. The only number they have that actually answered was from grab singapore but they can’t help w our problem. Grab Philippines needs to be taken down a notch. They charge their riders drivers and customers way too much for a platform that’s full of ads and a nonexistent customer service.",pauiwrites,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Allow us to make it up to you. Please reach out to us through our social media channels so we can assist you and take appropriate actions 🙏️ ,Wed Mar 26 2025 14:33:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,12436739310,Tue Mar 18 2025 23:05:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,More benefits for loyal users,"I’ve been using this application as my main form of commute for nearly a year. You would think being a loyal user would warrant more benefits, but I’ve hardly seen any discounts in both food and transport. I’ve observed there are more discounts available to new users.

Additionally, I’ve been assigned to new drivers who I assume are unfamiliar to the road and have few ratings. Although I try to understand where they are coming from, it is frustrating to sit and watch them drive so slowly while they navigate the road with the laggy gps system. I take grab (for the main purpose of quicker travel time) nearly the same time everyday. To arrive at a significantly later time due to a new driver is annoying. I presume the matchmaking system is dependent on proximity of drivers to the user. I’d appreciate being assigned to more trusted drivers instead.",eyehy,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we are continuously working to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Wed Mar 26 2025 14:35:03 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
