ios,ph,,12300930015,Wed Feb 12 2025 06:00:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Wasted money and no support from Grab,"I have been using Grab for a while now, but I have encountered a recurring issue that is both frustrating and costly. On multiple occasions, I have placed orders from shops that were marked as open on the Grab app, only for the drivers to arrive and find them closed. This has happened to me at least twice, and each time, my money was wasted. Despite the deliveries never arriving, I was still charged for the orders, which is completely unacceptable. When I tried to contact Grab for assistance, I found that my concern did not fit into any of the provided options. I have repeatedly requested to speak with a real person, but due to the app’s limited support options, I have never been able to do so. It is incredibly frustrating to lose money over an issue that is entirely Grab’s responsibility. If a shop is closed, it should not appear as open on the app, and customers should not be charged for undelivered orders. The lack of proper customer support only makes matters worse, leaving me feeling ignored and unheard. I expect Grab to address this issue immediately and ensure that customers are not being charged for services that are never fulfilled.",Albert_Jr39,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed Feb 19 2025 07:12:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,12300509729,Wed Feb 12 2025 03:02:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Philippines is bad,"Grab philippines is by far the worst version. It lacks proper standard operation. Is it me or is the Filipino culture just lazy enough that could impact the beauty of food delivery apps? How come in Hongkong and Taiwan, especially Thailand their services are a lot efficient and better? Do better Philippines",dmitriv1,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed Feb 19 2025 07:19:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,12300233195,Wed Feb 12 2025 01:17:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Grab Car Tracking,"Grab Car’s ETA is very inaccurate! This has beem an issue for so long. Hope they fix. It’s understandable that Metro Manila always has the worst traffic jam, but why not be transparent in the driver’s ETA. 5 mins away almost means 20 mins away.

Edit: I wrote this again few months later and Grab still haven’t improve on the time tracking for GrabCar! How can you say its 9 minutes away when I’ e been waiting for more than 17 minutes now!!",Karenina Legsp,,"We're truly sorry to read about this booking experience 😔 Our bookings are automatically allocated by the system. The actual time of our driver-partner's arrival may differ due to sudden and unforeseen circumstances such as traffic and weather conditions. In these cases, we will update you on the change in the estimated time of arrival in the app 🙏️",Wed Feb 19 2025 07:20:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
