ios,ph,,12256532830,Sat Feb 01 2025 10:19:29 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,PANGIT,your app is so ugly. nag mi-minus kayo sa card kahit kinancelled niyo ang order. BOBO,WAG NIYO E DL ANG APP NA TO,,"Hi! If no booking was confirmed, unallocated, or canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Posting returned funds normally takes 2-3 business days, up to 30 banking days depending on your card issuer's posting process on their charge reversal policy. If you still have not received the amount after some time, please contact your bank directly.",Thu Feb 06 2025 06:24:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
