ios,ph,,12255572197,Sat Feb 01 2025 04:09:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Promo Scams,"When you use promo codes, like you use two or more, the store will automatically cancel your order, saying no drivers available but for obvious reasons its only to avoid the cut. And the next time you order, promo codes are not anymore available. You bet its a scam.",pinoy_believer,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can further assist you with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Thu Feb 06 2025 06:26:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
