ios,ph,,12244380130,Wed Jan 29 2025 10:33:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Inconvenience — Twice,"1) booked grab car, driver was late and app prompted I would receive a fee for the delay. The driver updated on her app that I have been picked up but I wasn’t even in the ride! Could no longer cancel as supposedly I have already been picked up! She even asked me to cancel! How incompetent and deceitful! Reported her, i was refunded but the said “delayed fee” was never given to me.
2) order grab pick up. App prompted to pick up my order as it was ready but when I arrived the restaurant said it’s going to be ready in 30mins! The restaurant personnel told me that’s what’s showing on their app! Such an inconvenience. Hurried to the restaurant just to wait for another 30mins, the purpose for ordering through pick up has been defeated when I just have to go and wait in the restaurant for my food!",ggggaaaaaaaa,,"We are sorry we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or our Social Media platforms, so we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Sat Feb 01 2025 05:56:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
