ios,ph,,12243796215,Wed Jan 29 2025 06:16:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Recommendation,"I'm really fine with the app and I like it, but the thing I really wanna add to this app is letting the buyers see the current money the grab drivers have for change or barya. The reason why is that I had this one situation where I only had 500 pesos for food but they told me that they needed me to give the exact money for the food since they didn't have change, so I had to adjust and borrow money from my neighbor.",Hot Rad,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we continuously work to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Sat Feb 01 2025 06:00:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
