ios,ph,,12229768516,Sat Jan 25 2025 17:21:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Bad Experience,"I placed an order for Jollibee through your platform, but despite multiple attempts, none of your drivers accepted my order because they seemingly preferred cashless payments. I only had cash at the time and no balance in my GrabPay wallet. I tried to cancel the booking, but I couldn’t find a cancellation button. Since no driver was accepting the order, I assumed it wouldn’t push through. Frustrated, I decided to order food through Lalamove instead, and the delivery was successfully completed.

To my surprise, one of your drivers later contacted me, claiming he had just arrived with my order. At the same time, the Lalamove driver also arrived. I ended up having to pay for both orders, costing me over PHP 400 in duplicate charges. This could have been avoided if there had been a clear cancellation option or if your drivers had been more willing to accept cash payments.

This experience has been incredibly frustrating, inconvenient, and costly. Your chat support also failed to assist me in resolving the issue, adding to my disappointment.",nonfndhfctbdegbfdddfgggf,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Sat Feb 01 2025 07:54:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,12228509968,Sat Jan 25 2025 11:15:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Issue on latest update,"After the recent update, I got logged out so I logged in, but couldn’t get through. The OTP was being sent to an old mobile number from 5 years ago that’s no longer in use. I tried logging in using my current number and I got in. However, my profile details, transaction history and Grab wallet credits are all gone. Either my account details got mixed up after the update or my account is being hacked. Created a ticket  in-app under “can’t log in”, but I think there should be a button for “suspected fraud” with a faster turnaround time.",Shaw_K,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Sat Feb 01 2025 08:00:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,12228273916,Sat Jan 25 2025 09:47:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Not convenient anymore,"Once I place our orders, Grab doesn’t allow me to cancel them even within just 30 seconds, even though it’s still searching for a driver. What’s worse is that drivers can cancel the orders. This happens to me almost every time, drivers frequently cancel my orders, and I have to reorder and wait another 30mins to 1 hour.",win125125,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we are continuously working to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Sat Feb 01 2025 08:05:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
