ios,ph,,12211545320,Tue Jan 21 2025 12:47:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Update your App,"I use grab quite often, and I understand that riders are picky when it comes to accepting orders (could be due to proximity of delivery address). However, most times it takes soooo long to get a rider. It even reaches to 30mins waiting time (JUST TO GET A RIDER). This would’ve been okay if we could cancel our order. BUT your app doesn’t allow it when you’re looking for a rider. It only allows it when a rider has been found AND by that time it took too long ++ the merchant won’t accept the cancellation. This really pisses me off because 1) it wastes so much of your customers’ time & 2) your app is food-related. People use it so they can EAT something; not to simply wait for food that you aren’t sure is gonna arrive or not. I hope you can improve your app & add this feature.",Dhucma,,"So sorry for the booking experience. We receive many booking requests, especially during peak hours, and have limited riders to meet the demand. We ask for your patience in the meantime, as we try to serve everyone 🙏",Thu Jan 23 2025 06:06:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
