ios,ph,,12194756299,Fri Jan 17 2025 11:26:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,The riders hired by grab are not considerate of customers time,"This has already happened multiple times in where I order food around 3 kilometers away from my home. I ordered my food around 6pm and it was cancelled by a rider at 7:20pm. Even though the place where I bought food was nearby. I was really hungry and was depending on the driver, but the place I called contacted me and said that the driver cancelled the order even though the food was prepared. I had problems placing my order again because it didnt punch through the place where I ordered. I got to order finally at around 7:40pm, but my food arrived at 9pm, even though the place is less than 3 kilometers from my home. Please hire drivers who are considerate of other customers time, and drivers who are NOT lazy, because it is already obvious that the driver is being lazy, because why would he cancel the order if it was already made quickly and if it was literally less than 3km from my home. Fix all this because this has happened alot and wasted alot of my time.",.bbbr,,"So sorry for the booking experience. We receive many booking requests, especially during peak hours, and have limited riders to meet the demand. We ask for your patience in the meantime, as we try to serve everyone 🙏
