ios,ph,,12174864653,Sun Jan 12 2025 10:34:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Very Sus.,"""Order is delayed because drivers are busy"". It would have been understood if it stopped there. But it said [based on what I remembered] ""Order is delayed because drivers are busy and could not accept cash. Go cashless and we'll find you a driver quickly."" 

What does having cash as payment have to do with availability of drivers or delay of orders?

But wait, there's more:
I tried shifting to cashless, tried clicking Gcash as payment, they wouldn't allow me because I had to reset Gcash again?!

And now that I have Grab Wallet instead, the order is still delayed and no drivers accepted the delivery!

Imagine doing all this on a SUNDAY, not even on weekdays at rush hour! Traffic is not even that busy even at 5-6pm on this day!

After this order, I will be leaving Grab. This is just a step too far.

I recommend others doing the same. Not worth this kind of BS.",High Stakes Review,,,,
