ios,ph,,12151121690,Mon Jan 06 2025 09:23:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Worst App Ever - it’s honestly a scam!,"Grab is not only the most expensive transportation booking app, it’s also the absolute WORST. And I say this as someone who has not only been victimized by the awfully unclear UX / UI, but also as someone who has experienced the worsening development of the Grab app. 

Before, you could cancel your order as soon as possible and cite your reason (driver asked to cancel, placed the wrong order, etc.) 

Now, you can no longer be eligible for canceling your order EVEN IF YOU MADE A MISTAKE, and EVEN IF THERE IS NO RIDER YET, because they are “working hard to find a rider.” ????? I accidentally duplicated my order and NOW I can no longer cancel BOTH orders. 

Why did Grab change their policy like this? I understand other customers may have canceled abruptly before but PLEASE ALLOW US TO CANCEL AT THE FIRST FEW MINUTES (maximum 3-4 minutes), because I swear I tried to cancel the moment I accidentally booked another order. But I wasn’t eligible anymore. 

Grab is useless, expensive, inaccessible. Please do not use this app anymore – more and more alternatives are coming out.",masterswaggy666,,,,
