ios,ph,,12139085135,Fri Jan 03 2025 10:19:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab should improve services for both Food and Car,"I’ve been using Grab for a few years, mostly for food deliveries, and most of the time, drivers have been canceling orders through the app. If it relates to the fake-booking issues arising, then it should be addressed properly, but not in a way of disadvantaging those customers who are using the app itself. It shouldn’t be the drivers’ choice whether to accept or decline an order depending on the delivery address’s location or the mode of payment, or to even cancel an order if the customer’s/user’s account is verified and/or well rated. Grab Food has been an advantage for ordering food online and getting them delivered to specific addresses but not in this way where our orders can’t be delivered with drivers who choose to decline, cancel, or have specifications on modes of payment.",nonevenersoncanow,,,,
