ios,ph,,12120954910,Sun Dec 29 2024 20:20:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Frustration Over Poor Customer Service and Unresolved Issues,"Grab’s customer service has become frustrating! I frequently use the Grab app for various transactions, such as car rides, GrabMart, and food delivery, but I often receive incorrect or missing items. Initially, their customer service was very helpful, responding quickly and investigating issues within minutes. However, since the app was updated, the help service has become complicated and unhelpful.

Whenever I dispute a wrong transaction, they always respond with, “We will investigate and get back to you within 24 hours.” Unfortunately, this isn’t true, as I often wait beyond the stated timeframe without any resolution. While I persist in disputing these issues because I need refunds, I can’t help but feel that Grab might be engaging in questionable practices with these repeated problems.

If there were an option to give a negative rating instead of one star, I would choose to do so to reflect my disappointing experience.",126366373,,,,
