ios,ph,,12118887926,Sun Dec 29 2024 08:45:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Unsatisfactory,"The volume of drivers cannot meet the demand of the ever growing population in Iloilo, to handle this, grab decides to raise the prices instead of looking for more drivers. Some drivers are rude and cancel after A MINUTE of waiting and ONE missed call. Some drivers do not want to bother dropping you off to the location you chose to be dropped off to, even if it is clearly pinned and they have the map, some still stop at a walking distance from your pinned location pretending to be gullible. But still no choice since this is the only company offering this kind of service within the vicinity. Hope you do better, if not possible, hope there’d be another company competent enough to fulfill what grab lacks, which would be A LOT.",Jessa33367,,,,
