ios,ph,,12080548218,Thu Dec 19 2024 10:03:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Food is taking longer to arrive than expected,"I have read a similar post in Reddit wherein a customer waited for more than 2 hours to receive her order via grab. I just experienced the same where I placed my order and expected to receive it in standard 35-40mins, but I waited 2 hours. I would understand if the kitchen is busy but because my order was grouped with other orders, I had to wait longer than expected. I really don’t like that Grab does this to “make the delivery efficient” while sacrificing the convenience of customers. A typical food delivery would cater to only 1 per rider and the very reason why people order food delivery instead of going out themselves is for convenience. But this is no longer prioritized by Grab! What a disappointment.",pmvdee,,,,
