ios,ph,,12046603288,Tue Dec 10 2024 09:39:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,No way to reach support,"Their “AI” chat bot (really just an idiotic script with zero intelligence) will claim it’s going to transfer you to an agent if you just write out your issue again for the 50th time. ### SPOILER ALERT ### It never does. Instead it asks you over and over and over again to typr out the issue so it can provide a list of completely unrelated solutions. 
