ios,ph,,12033327950,Fri Dec 06 2024 20:05:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Lousy customer service,"Dear Grab Support Team,

I am writing to report a recurring issue with the Grab app, which has been incorrectly notifying me of an outstanding balance, despite my paying all transactions in full and with exact amounts.

Attached are screenshots of a transaction on November 27, during my trip from NAIA Terminal to Santa Rosa, Laguna. I paid the full fare of PHP 1,490 via GCash to the driver, Michael Joe Ventura. This amount included the PHP 254 toll fee. However, the app only registered PHP 1,236, failing to account for the toll fee payment.

It seems the driver either did not know how to input the toll fee correctly into the system or deliberately avoided doing so. To continue using the app’s cashless transaction feature, I was forced to settle the PHP 254 amount again on December 3. This experience has caused significant inconvenience and raises serious concerns about transparency and the app’s reliability.

Unfortunately, this is not an isolated incident. I have encountered similar issues before with both GrabCar and GrabFood services. Despite reporting this problem through the app, it remains unresolved.

If these recurring issues are not addressed promptly, I may be compelled to take legal action to ensure fair treatment of customers. I urge your team to investigate this matter thoroughly and implement immediate corrective measures.

I look forward to your swift response.",Anonymoose555,,,,
