ios,ph,,12015513573,Mon Dec 02 2024 01:58:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Not Customer-Centric and does not think about their riders.,"The cancellation button is never available which causes hassle on both the customer and the driver's side. A couple seconds after placing an order, the cancellation button should still be available and I should not even be here explaining why; Change of mind, accidental clicks, forgotten orders, etc.
