ios,ph,,11993422427,Tue Nov 26 2024 10:18:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Advance Booking for the Airport,"There should be an option where the passengers can pick the size of the car when using the advance airport booking. I booked 2days in advanced with the assurance that the car that would be assigned can fit 3passengers and 3 large baggages/23kg (as shown in the app) however, on the scheduled car pick up day, the driver arrived 10minutes late, and he refused to take us to the airport because he said he couldnt fit the 2large bags and 2small boxes(both less than 23kg). We had to do the regular booking and was charged anyway of the cancellation fee(equal to the booking fee). And we should be able to communicate with the driver once assigned instead of waiting for the last 45minutes of the pick up time(as indicated in the app too) so we could communicate with them about the pick up day and maybe cancel the booking if we cant agree about it and be allowed to book another ahead of time too.",Iriri120,,,,
