ios,ph,,11954812831,Sat Nov 16 2024 02:34:04 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Stomach pain,"I ordered 2 Shawarmas and 1 noodle dish from this place last night. While the food looked okay initially, I only ate one of the Shawarmas, and the next morning, I started experiencing stomach pain. It makes me concerned that some of the ingredients might not have been prepared as cleanly as expected. Plus it was the only food I ate last night nothing else. I hope the management can look into their food handling practices to ensure better quality for future customers.",Cebu PH,,,,
ios,ph,,11952834993,Fri Nov 15 2024 14:36:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Long pick up and frequent cancellation,"In the PH, on some days grab drivers repeatedly cancel on my booking after making me wait. On other days it takes so long for drivers to arrive. Today I waited for 1hr for my driver to arrive even if we were both just in the same city. He kept getting lost and missing turns for some reason. Also had a handful of experinces where driverd accept my booking and do not move - they seem to wait for me to cancel the booking so i get penalized. Most days i wait for 20-30 min for drivers to arrive in the morning going to work and it is almost impossible to book after work. Wish we had more riders in the Philippines.  As much as i want to rate this app 1 star, i do admit this is better than taxis. But i wish Uber were still here to provide some competition and force Grab to improve its services.",esp2496,,,,
