ios,ph,,11941749895,Tue Nov 12 2024 14:17:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Worst support ever,"I’m not even going into the insane surge prices. A few months ago,  I changed my phone and upon trying to log in, I discovered my old number is inactive. I couldn’t receive my OTP. I have sent numerous reports and no one has been able to resolve or help me. On top of that, I still have balance left in my account, and a monthly plan subscription that automatically charges my linked account. I haven’t been able to use my Grab account for 2 months now. Grab IS STEALING MY MONEY. There’s no way to call or talk to a human being. Everything is through emails that get replied to after DAYS if not WEEKS. WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE. A friend of mine said she’s friends with the head of Operations but NOTHING happened after I’ve sent my email exchanges to her.",Enitsas,,,,
ios,ph,,11941513446,Tue Nov 12 2024 13:03:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Multiple Orders Handling,"I always choose Standard delivery so that i can receive the food that i ordered in a much faster time frame given on the app. Then the Grab driver that took my order eventually waited for another order for him to add as multiple order handling. Now here comes the problem, first I paid for a standard deliver y rate but still getting the food  on a longer time. Secondly since my order was not given first ended up going at the bottom of the drivers food box, upon receiving my order late despit of the standard rate I paid, the food is now cold and soggy due to moist affecting the quality of freshness. I hope Grab will think about this!!!",MikeDLuy,,,,
ios,ph,,11941219578,Tue Nov 12 2024 11:22:02 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Lady Drivers for Lady Passengers,"I always use Grab on my way to work. It’s very convenient, but sometimes I feel unsafe when the driver is a man. This doesn’t happen all the time, but there were multiple instances when the driver made me feel uncomfortable and I would feel uneasy during the entire ride. I recently booked a Grab that had a lady driver and it was the first time I actually felt safe going to work. It was also my first time booking a Grab Car with a lady driver. I just wanted to suggest maybe adding an option in the Grab app for us ladies to be able to filter our bookings with lady drivers only for us to feel a bit safer. This may not apply to all, but maybe there are some women who would agree to this ☺️",heejakeu,,,,
