ios,ph,,11940859007,Tue Nov 12 2024 08:45:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Food Support!!,"I use grab all the time. All the time!!!

I recently ordered a coffee to Krispy Kreme, while it was on the way, the rider messaged me thru the app and said. “Sorry and he spilled the entire cup, asking for my number and that he will just pay me.” I declined, since it’s normal that rider goes through rough days. I told him I’ll just report it sa grab and have them refund it. 

Well. It has been 3 days and no one has even responded. Imagine? I reported and followed up more than 10x and no one. Absolutely no one responded back, up until now that case is still open and I haven’t got my refund. 

I sent them all the photos the rider sent me, surely they also have access sa messages ng rider to me. But, yeah! I believe they don’t have customer support with food service that they offer and has been overcharging us the whole tike for every order.

Churos in Krispy Kreme 6 pieces a box is 390 and in your app it’s 449 if I’m not mistaken. At least have the audacity to provide support to your customers. 

Disappointed? No. Disgusted 

So here’s a 1 star for you.",joeylynbernardosantos,,,,
