ios,ph,,11857248029,Mon Oct 21 2024 03:36:03 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Lots of problems,"Irritating that sometimes, their merchants are not updated (closed stores) and when you order, they do not have the immediate option for you to cancel unless there is a delay. So, HOW WILL WE BE UPDATED OF THE SUPPOSEDLY “DELAY” WHEN THEY CAN’T REACH THE MERCHANT MISMO??
