ios,ph,,11806623126,Mon Oct 07 2024 07:24:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Inefficient Customer Service,"Whenever i use gcash or paymaya as my method of payment, they are returned to me within an hour or so if the booking didn’t pushed through because of lack of drivers. So last October 2, 2024, my Maya was charged even if there were no drivers. I was expecting it to be returned to me before noon. So i made another booking and chose cash as my payment. The booking went through after several tries. But the refund from the 1st booking never happened that day so i tried reaching out with CS. There were no live agents and the FAQs are of no good with my case. Leaving with no other choice, i left a message with their help centre that same day. I made several followups but no one has ever reached out. It’s very frustrating having no one to contact to. You are on your own if you encounter an issue with their service.  TAPOS SASABIHIN NG DEV TEM TO REACH OUT WITH THEIR HELP CENTRE EH WALA NAMAN KAYO LIVE AGENTS. INVEST ON YOUR HELP DESK.",Bhibbey,,,,
