ios,ph,,11781220997,Mon Sep 30 2024 12:22:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Poor Delivery Service Time,"We've recently observed that our orders are taking nearly two hours for delivery. It’s crucial that food is delivered right away to ensure the best experience for our customers. We believe that allowing multiple bookings for riders may be contributing to these delays. 

With the holiday season approaching, timely delivery will be even more critical. We recommend reconsidering the multiple booking option for riders to prioritize immediate delivery.",N.A.-,,"Hi!

So sorry for this 😔 Nakakatanggap kami ng maraming booking requests during peak hours like this at limited lang ang aming mga rider-partners to meet the demand.

We ask for your patience in the meantime 🙏️
",Sat Oct 05 2024 04:36:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
