ios,ph,,11779393118,Sun Sep 29 2024 22:38:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,No one is accepting for grab car booking,No one is accepting for grab car booking during rush hour and the fares are too high,Alice17119596,,"Pasensya na po kung kayo ay nahirapan makapag book 😔 We receive a lot of booking requests during rush hour and we ask for your patience as we try to serve everyone. You may be experiencing surge pricing due to increased demand and limited drivers/delivery partners where you are. To ensure that there is an ample supply of drivers/delivery partners, the fee gets adjusted to compensate them for driving into the area. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this. Thank you! 🙏️ ",Sat Oct 05 2024 04:24:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,11778870638,Sun Sep 29 2024 19:06:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Disapointing,Let us delete history of purchase easily,bwhduwis,,"Hi! We understand your concern about the booking history in our app. However, please note that it's not possible to delete this history. This is primarily due to regulatory and audit requirements.

The booking history serves as an important record of all your transactions and activities. It helps us maintain transparency and can be crucial for reference in case of any discrepancies or disputes.

Additionally, your booking history allows us to understand your preferences better, enabling us to provide a more personalized and improved service.

We want to assure you that your privacy is our top priority. All your data, including your booking history, is handled with utmost care and in strict accordance with our privacy policy.",Sat Oct 05 2024 04:20:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
