ios,ph,,11772290267,Sat Sep 28 2024 01:23:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,No refund for cancelled order by merchant,"It’s been 10 days since my order was cancelled but I haven’t got my money back. Help center isn’t working as well because it’s always the bot answering. All the responses are the same and doesn’t address the main issue. No matter how many times you try, there’s no use. I want my money back! Grab is so quick in getting your payment but when it comes to returning your money, they’re not.",Zaire P.,,"We're so sorry for this booking experience 😔 If no booking was confirmed, unallocated or canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Posting returned funds normally takes 2-3 business days up to 30 banking days as it depends on your card issuer's posting process on their charge reversal policy. If you still have not received the amount after some time, please contact your bank directly.",Sat Oct 05 2024 03:56:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
