ios,ph,,11750822187,Sun Sep 22 2024 04:25:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Food system is bad.,Grab food lets restaurants not to accept your order for a long time and eventually cancel your order after waiting. Waste of time.,Yamst,,"Apologies for the trouble. When orders are placed this is automatically queued to the merchant's system for them to be able to prepare this. During this process, the system also broadcasts the order for it to be allocated to the available riders within the area. However, if there aren't any riders available, the booking will be automatically canceled. Rest assured, we're adding more riders to meet the demand. ",Fri Sep 27 2024 06:40:02 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
