ios,ph,,11740411301,Thu Sep 19 2024 09:51:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Biases and not passenger friendly,"There are lots of scenarios that I cancelled because either the driver is not moving (after several mins!!) or too far (40mins away) and the app will block me after cancelling which is so unreasonable.

There are also lots of times that the ride is cancelled after waiting for 15 minutes and lots of times wasted from my side???

Clearly this app can’t protect passengers from those scenarios which gives me so much hassle. I hope the monopoly of car hailing here in the PH ends so I can drop this mediocre and expensive app",clarymcflurry,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Sun Sep 22 2024 14:41:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,11739939035,Thu Sep 19 2024 05:56:27 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,The 1000 cap is ridiculous,"Can you please remove the 1000php cap especially if the user isnt a Cash on Delivery basis? I wanted to order a food to a vendor, but there is a cap and I wanted to order for 20 people, I was only able to order for 10 people. No big deal, I can just repeat the order twice to accomodate 20 people right? Wrong... The app wont let me order again stating there is a duplicate order already. Can't you update the app to either: 1) remove the cap if the order is paid upfront via bank/gcash and not COD And 2) enable users to repeat order again of the same item in same vendor, maybe add a question promt if the user really wanted to order again And 3) Add a chat/hotline number of the vendor so Users can talk to them to adjust the order or have it delivered together with the initial order.",haruhi004,,"For more seamless ordering experience, GrabFood will only accept cashless payment methods (GrabPay Wallet, credit/debit card or e-wallet) for orders above ₱1000. If you wish to continue using cash, please ensure the order value is below ₱1000. Thank you! 🙏 ",Sun Sep 22 2024 14:44:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
