ios,ph,,11733301383,Tue Sep 17 2024 09:23:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,can’t wait til I don’t have to use grab so much anymore,"I think it’s IMMORAL that grab automatically opts in to book a different kind of car service when there’s no booking for the service you choose. You always end up with the higher fare (e.g. choosing grabtaxi then it automatically opts for grabcar 4 seater if no grabtaxi is booked even if you have grabcar 4 seater pwd available). The default should be opt out and you have to manually opt in every time. When you’re pressed for time booking it’s easy to overlook the indicator for the back up booking they have now. 

It’s also appalling that when you regularly book grab with from the same point A to point B, you get a higher fare compared to a person who is booking that same route for the first time. WTH?! Shows how much profit-centered and greedy grab is. Can’t wait for the day that the playing field is more equal with competitor ride sharing services.",A O _ ph,,"Our fares are dynamic and determined by the real-time Demand and Supply in your location, and could also be affected by peak hours, weather or traffic conditions.",Sun Sep 22 2024 14:51:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,11732872647,Tue Sep 17 2024 05:57:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,HelpFul App,I wish we can have the digital card back( hence the 4⭐️’s). I used it once to reserve for a hotel staycation - it just felt secured and having the peace of mind using it as a payment option,Love tjis,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we are continuously working to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Sun Sep 22 2024 14:52:03 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,11731996405,Mon Sep 16 2024 23:19:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Absolutely abysmal,"Grab will fail you, and they will offer no recourse. They'll tell you a taxi is on the way, and then suddenly cancel after you've been waiting a long time. They'll accept a food order, tell you it's on its way, and then cancel it saying no drivers are available. A real company wouldn't take an order it can't fulfill. Customer service is also non-existent. They send you down a rabbit hole of utterly useless chatbots. If you somehow manage to reach an actual human being, they don't bother to listen and understand your problem, and it's rarely solved. What an utterly horrendous company.",sdgwrt324t,,"Hi! We receive a lot of booking requests, especially during peak hours like this and we have limited riders to meet the demand. Thank you for your patience! 🙏️",Sun Sep 22 2024 14:53:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
