ios,ph,,11688467329,Wed Sep 04 2024 16:11:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Feedback on Order Cancellation Policy,"I am writing to provide feedback on a recent experience I had with your service regarding order cancellation. Specifically, I encountered a situation where I was unable to cancel an order, even though the delivery rider had not yet accepted the order and it had not been prepared.

