ios,ph,,11684554840,Tue Sep 03 2024 14:15:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,I was charged twice by grab car,"I was charged twice by Grab Car, and it's been almost a month. They can't resolve the issue and have a lot of requirements that they want me to comply with. Duh! Its your fault that you charged me twice, then you have the guts to ask for such requirements for me to refund. The hassle you gave is too much, and it is months already how lousy your customer service is that it can't even solve the issue. I do have proof that they charged me twice through history in my online banking, and I called my issuing bank, and it confirmed that they charged me twice, but they wanted to have SOA instead. Are you really serious? Grab is a theft; even if it is a small amount, they will not refund it. Pahiharapan ka mag refund. Aboloy ko nalang sa inyo yan mukhang hirap na hirap kayo. Nahiya naman ako sa pinaggagawa nyo.",Arooooooooooooon,,,,
