ios,ph,,11650215735,Sun Aug 25 2024 07:48:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Outdated Policy and Rude Drivers Make Grab Delivery Unreliable,"I’m giving this app a 1-star review due to the significant inconvenience caused by their delivery policy and rude drivers. The app enforces a so-called SOP that prevents door-to-door delivery in apartment complexes and condominiums, which is outdated and frustrating. While this may have been understandable during COVID-19, it’s no longer a valid excuse. People pay for convenience, and it’s unacceptable that drivers threaten to cancel deliveries simply because of this policy. Grab needs to address this issue by revising their delivery procedures and ensuring drivers are properly screened and trained to handle such situations professionally. Until then, the service remains unreliable and disappointing.",Magyuriie,,,,
