ios,ph,,11601242149,Mon Aug 12 2024 13:25:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,30 minutes wait,"I took 3 Grab cars before I finally got
home. I  was able to  book  at around 8:30 pm  but I observed that the car is not moving from its location so I messaged the driver and asked why Grab app says  it’s 4 mins and it will arrive to my destination and it already took me more than 10 minutes waiting and the car is still 4 min from my location…It’s not moving and the driver answered that it’s flat tire, so I messaged hin to cancel me because it’s not my fault. He told me that he is running flat… Im also a driver so I know that it’s dangerous to run flat… but he is not cancelling me. I cancelled him because I cannot ride on a flat tired car… I picked that the driver said I I cancel him.  As he is running flat… I cannot say I was the one who caused the cancellation… So I booked the next car… and this Grab Car was not
also moving.  OMG, how
come he has flat tire?  How come that one after another car are both flat tires at 8:46 pm…but they are not
cancelling me after it
took me more that 10 minutes because this one was not answering… omg.  When I booked the 3rd one,  I can see that it came
from a halt because
it was not moving too.  I messaged the driver and asked him ‘ If he is already close to where Im located”. It’s only 3 minutes according to the app. Fortunately the car moved and was able to arrive home at 9:03.  It’s not a nice experience tonight with Grab. I think I dont like the attitude of your deivers who when they are booked and they
dont like the location, leaves the passenger waiting and waiting because
they are not cancelling it if they dont like the destination we have booked.  I am so exhausted tonight and I felt that grab is tolerating the drivers  who are not doing their job of providing service to their customers. I hope you will be looking at the welfare of your customers who provide you your needed revenue.",LCirio,,"We're genuinely saddened to hear about your recent booking experience 😔. We hold our driver-partners to high standards, expecting them to honor the bookings they accept and avoid canceling jobs without a valid reason. Please be assured that we have robust policies in place to ensure fair implementation of corrective actions, and our system diligently monitors all cancellations.

Please note, that our rider partners may face suspension or penalties for non-compliance. We truly appreciate your understanding and patience in this matter.",Sun Aug 18 2024 07:51:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
