ios,ph,,11506520897,Thu Jul 18 2024 09:45:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Order Cancelled,"This is the third time of waiting for more than an hour only to be notified that my order is cancelled due to unavailability of drivers here in Koronadal City. But I can see on the app that it says ""we'll inform you when you order is inthe kitchen"" something like that. Which means that it is not due to availability of drivers. The first two was an order from KFC and now it is my order from Greenwich! This keeps on happening and it is so frustrating!!! Next time inform ahead that they will not be accepting orders instead of letting us wait for MORE THAN AN HOUR!",Dandelion2022,,Apologies for this. It could get a bit harder to book because of the high demand for orders. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so that we can take appropriate action. Thank you 🙏️,Tue Feb 20 2024 00:43:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
