ios,ph,,11504115803,Wed Jul 17 2024 17:02:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,I was SCAMMED,"Recently, I downloaded this app because it has a good review. Just now, at 12:00 am I ordered a food in this app. My payment method was cash since I only have 200 left on my Maya account, although the payment was 150 but I decided to pay using my cash since I wanted to save up the money I have in my Maya account. The order took 50 minutes which is the standard order but I didn’t received any message from this app and didn’t even bother updating me about my order. I changed my payment method through cashless because I thought it would be faster that way, but after 15 minutes of waiting my order was CANCELLED and my 200 pesos on Maya account was already charged. I was devastated and I felt disappointed because never in my life this ever happened to me. GRAB DEVELOPERS IF YOU’RE SEEING THIS, GIVE ME BACK THE MONEY I LOST. I trusted you yet you failed me, as your customer. I have screenshots as the evidence that I WAS SCAMMED.

I regretted downloading this app all LOL. NEVER AGAIN. I’M GOING BACK TO FOODPANDA WHERE EVERYTHING IS MUCH MORE CONVENIENT.

p.s kaya pala ayaw tumanggap ng cod kasi para may ma-scam sila LOL mga kawatan.",bagelsandcats,,,,
