ios,ph,,11490854516,Sun Jul 14 2024 04:52:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Lack of accountability with their partners,"I ordered food from Domino’s and the estimate time was 7:30. 8:30 the status still saying “in the kitchen” so I went to Grab support. They can’t help followup on my order or cancel my order because “Domino’s” have their own rules. I tried calling Domino’s Balestier but no one’s picking up. Before I went to bed I check the order again and it’s still in the kitchen. I woke up the next day and the status is now complete. Didn’t receive my order but my card was already charged. I contacted support again in the Grab app but no response. I contacted them at Tiktok, got a response and was given a ticket number but no movement after a week. Their merchants need to have accountability with Grab, and Grab as the platform should be able to protect their customers. 

