ios,ph,,11487457330,Sat Jul 13 2024 07:21:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,It will get worse and worse,"GrabUnlimited will not save you any money as you are misled as to what the original price was before subscription.

When you report an issue like being wrongfully overcharged or experiencing an unsafe ride you are deliberately stopped from being able to complain.

Service charges and prices will continue to inflate, the customer will pay more, costs are cut by restaurants and on delivery drivers who will not be able to earn livable wages.

Now that Grab has a stranglehold on the Philippine market, they can get away with giving you the worst experiences while gleefully taking your money.

After a year of awful services I will do the best I can to disengage as much as possible with Grab despite needing what they offer.

I hope everyone does the same",Andre Dylan,,,,
