ios,ph,,11432501877,Fri Jun 28 2024 11:19:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Long Waiting Time Only To Get Cancelled,"I recently used GrabFood to order my dinner at 6pm and its eta showed 7:05. I was willing to wait but after checking on it, it slowly kept going up until it reached 8pm. I was even willing to wait, but the worst thing of all was that at 7:07pm (an hour later), my order got cancelled. I wasted an hour waiting thinking my food was going to arrive, but it wasn’t. I had to order something again which would also make me wait for another lengthy time. I just wished that if orders were going to be cancelled, restaurants should only be allowed to cancel within a reasonable time so users can look for alternatives. I talked to my family and friends and it seems like I’m not the only one who has experienced the same thing. Please fix this as this makes me and other users unable to trust GrabFood for necessary meals again.",Ceanide,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please contact us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Tue Jul 02 2024 13:48:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
