ios,ph,,11424994531,Wed Jun 26 2024 12:13:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,"Delivery Time is always moving, ending up cancelling the order.","Wait time is already more than 1hr then after checking the status after a few minutes the delivery time moved to an additional +10-15mins wait time (and it will just keep on extending the time leaving you wondering if it has reached the restaurant at all or if a rider has been assigned to even pick it up).

This has been happening recently so we end up just cancelling and not able to order any food at all from Grab. Disappointing as Grab used to be a reliable app for ordering food, now it’s like you can’t order at all unless you subscribe or pay extra just to shorten delivery time, etc… it’s almost unusable- sooner or later more customers will just move to other apps like us to get our meals.",Chagee*,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Tue Jul 02 2024 13:55:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
