ios,ph,,11414279638,Sun Jun 23 2024 14:34:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,GRAB RATE,"PRICE/RATE: Severely overpriced Food and Service fee; Your better off using the app of the restaurant you want to order from (they’re probably using grab anyway, but paying at a corporate rate).

