ios,ph,,11387094450,Sun Jun 16 2024 08:49:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Nakakadismaya,Booked a 6-seater and Grab driver informed us that groceries and small appliances are not allowed when booking grab car. They might charge additional 50Php if that is the case but said he just let us take the trip. It was just a body-sized mirror and a couple of grocery bags. Nakakadismaya ang transpo sa Pinas and kaya nga nag-Grab kami ‘coz ang dami naming dala. He even suggested that these things should just be delivered via Lalamove. Annoying money-grabbers.,Yzuumi,,"As long as the amount you cashed in did not came from a credit card, you may transfer the funds to your bank or e-wallet. 🙂 Make sure to upgrade your GrabPay wallet to Premium first in order to use our Transfer feature. Learn more about it here: https://bit.ly/3kcHgeM. 

Once it's upgraded to Premium, just tap 'Payment', tap GrabPay credits, 'Transfer' and Send to Bank or e-wallet. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.


",Thu May 26 2022 05:45:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
