ios,ph,,11318648354,Wed May 29 2024 03:50:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Multiple Food Orders in One Driver,Multiple food orders in one driver takes so much time than usual. It took my order more than an hour (out for delivery status) to arrive because of multiple orders made by Grab. When you are paying not cheap amount of delivery fee.  The distance of the store to my house is only 2.5km. Then it took more than an hour to deliver? This is a very disappointing update on your process grab. Kindly consider the impact of this process to your customers.,concern grab consumer,,"Grab allows batched orders where one delivery partner can take two orders at a time if their location is close to each other. Rest assured that we have strict limits in place, such as placing orders at the same time, to ensure the integrity of your order and the quality of your experience 🙏 You may reach out to us via Social Media or Help Center if you have further concerns with this.",Fri May 31 2024 02:43:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
