ios,ph,,11287998972,Mon May 20 2024 16:00:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Disappointing User Experience with Grab App; Switched to FoodPanda,"The integration with GCash, a feature I was particularly interested in, simply did not work. Despite multiple attempts, I was unable to link my account, which severely limited the app's functionality for me.

Frustrated by these usability issues and technical glitches, I made the decision to uninstall the Grab app altogether. In its place, I turned to FoodPanda, and what a refreshing change it was! From the moment I opened the app, I was impressed by its sleek and user-friendly interface. Ordering my favorite meals became a breeze, with intuitive navigation and a seamless checkout process.

To the developers of Grab, I urge you to prioritize improving the user experience and addressing the technical issues that hinder the app's functionality. In contrast, I commend the team behind FoodPanda for delivering an app that truly puts the user first. Its ease of use and seamless performance have won me over, and I will be sticking with FoodPanda for all my delivery needs in the future.",wolf1564,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Fri May 24 2024 06:39:15 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,11287350153,Mon May 20 2024 12:23:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Forcing customers to use grabpay,The recent push from GRAB to force people to use Grabpay is horrible!! First the cash in option barely works and it causes a significant delay in the orders. Second they impose a minimum 500 php for the cash in hence if your bill is a little less you’re forced to use up your well earned money to just cover the minimum. Third they have a significant amount of riders butmost only camp certain spots and would not accept your order if it’s not in their spot or if you’re not going cashless.  I guess they terribly want to be the next gcash that they are willing to sacrifice customer service just to do this.,miguel0418,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Wed May 29 2024 04:33:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
