ios,ph,,11282762981,Sun May 19 2024 04:17:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"ORDER CANCELLED, NO REFUND",THEY CANCEL ORDERS AFTER LETTING YOU WAIT FOR 30MINS FOR IT!!! AND THEY WONT EVEN REFUND!!!!,Usedtobemlbblover,,"We're so sorry for this booking experience 😔 If no booking was confirmed, unallocated or canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and reflected on your account, depending on your bank's policy. Posting returned funds normally takes 2-3 business days up to 30 banking days as it depends on your card issuer's posting process on their charge reversal policy. If you still have not received the amount after some time, please contact your bank directly.",Fri May 24 2024 06:54:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
