ios,ph,,11272243957,Thu May 16 2024 05:05:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Updates,I understand updates are important for the functionality of the app but may I suggest to have an option to click ‘not now’ if it’s the first time the update came up? It’s pesky that people will have to struggle with booking especially from a place of poor internet connectivity or data signal then Grab suddenly wants an update at a very bad time. What if it’s in the middle of the night and just need to get home but you cannot yet because of the update? Maybe if the ‘not now’ has been clicked at least 2-3 times then that’s the time Grab requires you to actually update the app and become unusable in the process.,I am so mad.,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we are continuously working to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Wed May 29 2024 04:32:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,11272132646,Thu May 16 2024 04:08:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Poor Customer sedvice and No compensations for cancelled order,"A money grab. We only have 1 hour of lunch break and i ordered 1 hour before lunch. My order was cancelled because no driver was available, the restaurant is inside a big mall how can there be no drivers? And the sad part is the order is cancelled with just 30mins left in our break? I even changed payment method by using their wallet for faster booking with riders and it still got cancelled. We starved that day and even got charged by transferring back the money i topped up in their stupid wallet. Their customer service is ran by stupid ai chatbots that ends the chat after sending useless solutions. I'm cancelling all my subscriptions on this app. These days I never had a good experience with them",Ritz909,,Apologies for this. It could get a bit harder to book because of the high demand for orders. You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so that we can take appropriate action. Thank you 🙏️,Wed May 29 2024 04:31:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
