ios,ph,,11224072835,Thu May 02 2024 14:07:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Great services but grab mart needs improvement,"I use grab food and grabmart all the time and it’s been helping me alot but recently grab mart riders from a particular supermarket would complain that there’s “too many orders” (too much to load on their motorcycles) when i ordered a lot less than my usual from other supermarkets. There should be a way for customers and riders to agree on the amount of items we can buy so no rider can complain. I would edit my order if i can if that’s what they want but i would need to cancel first bec i cant edit my orders. Customers can only guess how much is too much or too less for a single delivery. It’s not fair to customers to be called just to be told “please think about the delivery riders next time, we are not grab car” - this wasn’t my intention as I’ve already ordered so many times before from different supermarkets with a bigger order but didn’t get any feedback. I have no idea why this particular supermarket has riders that complain alot for a lot less an order. I cancelled my order.  Wont order from that supermarket again bec of the riders there.",sarskiyanski,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we are continuously working to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms if you need further assistance with your concern. ",Tue May 07 2024 01:44:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
