ios,ph,,11155977180,Sun Apr 14 2024 04:14:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,VERIFICATION ERROR,"Ilang beses na akong nagresubmit ng documents para maverify yung account ko pero hindi nagmamatch yung info sa ID ko at yung sa profile account ko, how come? Need ko pa namang itransfer yung laman ng Grabpay Wallet ko kaso hindi pwede kasi ilang beses nang nitereject ni grab yung application ko. Sana naman magawan nyo ng paraan sayang yung pera ko",kiwibraey,,"We are so sorry if we are unable to verify your wallet. Please note that the requirements are being mandated by the BSP. You may refer to this link: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360001517648-Why-cant-I-get-verified for more information on why your application is not being accepted. Hope this helps 🙂",Sat Apr 20 2024 02:48:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
