ios,ph,,10917572180,Thu Feb 08 2024 23:30:06 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,My reviews of using this app,"Grab is a must-have app for anyone living in or traveling to Southeast Asia. It offers seamless ride-hailing services, food delivery, and more, all in one convenient platform. The user-friendly interface makes it easy to book rides or order food with just a few taps. Plus, the app provides real-time tracking and transparent pricing, ensuring a reliable and hassle-free experience. Whether you need a quick ride across town or a delicious meal delivered to your doorstep, Grab has you covered. Highly recommended for its convenience and reliability.",LKE00,,Thank you for your kind words! 😊 We are grateful that you took the time to leave us a 5-Star review. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚,Tue Feb 13 2024 01:52:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
