ios,ph,,10827070044,Tue Jan 16 2024 03:30:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Worst Delivery App Features for 2024,"Starting 2024 the app doesn't allow cash payments if the amount's less than 1000 pesos. Other than that, it doesn't show the actual location of the driver while it's out for delivery which makes it hard to anticipate when it's actually arriving. In lieu of that, when you fail to get your delivery immediately, they allow the drivers to leave even if it's already fully paid which results to further inconvenience because (1) the driver can tak the delivery home and go unresponsive for a delivery you fully paid for (2) have to contact and arrange a third party delivery service to retrieve your delivery from the driver to your home to which I already experienced personally. I understand these may be implemented for the drivers well being but they definitely disregard transparency and convenience  of customers.",olabec,,,,
