ios,ph,,10770169090,Mon Jan 01 2024 10:08:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Useless app since there are no drivers no riders for over a month,"Useless app since there are no drivers no riders for over a month. So this app is basically useless. If you want to cancel if ever you want to just buy yourself or use other more reliable delivery/riding app, it wont let you since the order is ""already being prepared"" but it will be cancelled 1 hr later of waiting. Which is BS. Support is hard to navigate. Imagine you're already stressed about the situation that you're not able to buy or ride, then you are faced with stupid automated support that seldoms solves your problems. I am a Platinum user but i dont feel Platinum :)",Arnikki:D,,"Hi! So sorry for this booking experience 😔 Our drivers/riders can be very busy at times, especially during the holiday rush. Rest assured we're doing our best to add more drivers on the road to meet the holiday demand 🙏",Wed Jan 03 2024 00:49:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
