ios,ph,,10757320277,Fri Dec 29 2023 04:25:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Dont use grab food,"Dont use grabfood! Specifically Cashless payments, there are mass reports of people not being refunded their unsuccessful deliveries and apparently the waiting period is 15-50 days for processing. They coerced customers to use cashless transactions by changing their cash payment limit to only ₱500. Their customer service is unhelpful as well. They will only redirect you to the help center which is controlled via bot and not get immediate assistance for the failed service.",rizyeye,,,,
ios,ph,,10754574430,Thu Dec 28 2023 12:44:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Glitchy with no viable resolution for Unlimited Promos,"I have been having an ongoing issue (close to 2 weeks) with the Grab Unlimited trial feature for this app. Every time I try to open or view the subscription, it says ""sorry try again later"". I want to cancel the trial early and am unable to do so as a result. Help Center agents will just keep saying nothing's wrong from their end and ask you to restart/reinstall. Since Grab Unlimited auto renews, this glitch or app flaw has real consequences on your Grab wallet. So far they have refused to help me cancel from their end still. Be careful with availing this feature.",TroniPS,,,,
ios,ph,,10754480330,Thu Dec 28 2023 12:14:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Lacking TIP function,There should be a way to add tip right away when ordering so the delivery guys wont be bothering me anymore pretending who to give and not knowing which house hoping to get a tip. It too much hassles to order then check if there is already a rider then add tip and if i forget the phone will be ringing even tho its obvious to just hand it over anyone in the household.,bsc1234,,,,
