ios,ph,,10754019184,Thu Dec 28 2023 09:22:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Customer Service and Pet Grab Car,"The app is good; however, it's challenging to reach customer service. Many articles are unrelated to the issues I want to report. Pet Grab car was once available, but now it's gone again. Finding a driver for transporting pets to the clinic is difficult. Some drivers are rude and demand extra fees. I've faced multiple cancellations because I have my pet dog. While I understand concerns about car damage, as users, we ensure our pets wear diapers and protective shoes. It's just disappointing at times.",Uwhxqiajiqksbdislnfukalqpskn,,,,
