ios,ph,,10672362554,Sat Dec 09 2023 01:17:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Really Good Scammer,"I ordered cake and a few sides. I received the sides but didn’t received the cake so I to help desk and reported it as missing item. 

Cake was 240PHP 
Grab refunded only 156PHP
Grab then tagged my ticket as resolved 
I tried reopening the ticket but no one is responding anymore

Now If i want to reorder the cake, not only that I have to add 86 pesos more, I have to pay for another delivery fee. Roughly around 60-70PHP. 

So now the cake that was supposedly 240PHP is now worth 384. 

Good job grab!! So much for being sorry that your services aren’t working as how it is supposed to be in the first place.",Ianvhin,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Allow us to make it up to you. Please reach out to us through our social media channels so we can assist you and take appropriate actions 🙏️ ,Wed Dec 13 2023 03:08:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
