ios,ph,,10666224879,Thu Dec 07 2023 09:54:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Suggestion for Senior Citizen parents’ sake,"Love the app and been using for so long. I also love that previously, I can book for my senior citizen parents using their discount codes. I do this because they don’t know how to use the app and also don’t have internet on their phones. But on Grab’s recent app, codes are no longer used and required every PWD/senior citizen/student to have their own account for the discount. 

Creating their account is easy, also applying for the discount. But the problem here is that for the persons who book for these PWD/senior citizen/student, provided they already have their own accounts, they need to switch accounts just to do that. And before switching, we need to clear cache. So before we get to book for them, we need how many minutes to do so, which is a hassle. Also after that, we need to clear cache and log in to our own accounts again. 

So for the suggestion, either Grab returns the discount codes or have a swift “account switch” in the app for faster process. This will be very very helpful for those PWD/senior citizen/student who can’t use the app or a phone or an internet.

For this, I’ll rate a 4/5 until there’s actually a solution for this.",Kawaiimio,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we are continuously working to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Sat Dec 09 2023 01:20:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
