ios,ph,,10512731827,Wed Oct 25 2023 05:39:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,The GrabCar service is elite but the Food Delivery side is disappointing.,"I mostly use Grab for the Ride services and I usually have no problems with it but I tried the Food Delivery today. Sad to say that I will not be using it again anytime soon. 

Waiting for almost 1 hour for the food was not a problem but cancelling my order because there apparently were no drivers around was extremely disappointing. Aside from cancelling the order, they put my payment on hold even if no service was fulfilled and I didn’t get to eat.

I talked to their support team and they took ages to reply but ok, I can understand that. After their slow responses, they told me the payment reversal would take up to 24 hours. I don’t see the point in holding payments when the delivery was not fulfilled.",Paui Chu,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Mon Oct 30 2023 08:26:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
