ios,ph,,10512013764,Tue Oct 24 2023 23:51:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Grab is great but....,"Honestly, Grab is great. But the only problem I have is that I can never book a Grab if it's rush hours (I get the circumstance but hoping we can do more about this?). The GrabShare lets you have co-passengers that are far from you. Most of the drivers I booked always ASK to cancel rides because it's too far from them. You can clearly see that the car is around 15-mins away only. Hoping this can be resolved! Thanks!",heeforshe,,We're so sorry for this booking experience 😔 We discourage our drivers from canceling without any valid reasons. Rest assured that we're doing our best to provide a better riding experience for everyone in the community 🙏️,Mon Oct 30 2023 08:27:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
