ios,ph,,10494329806,Fri Oct 20 2023 05:11:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Grab Security Enchancement,"Grab needs to add new functionality where the Grab rider for food delivery shouldn’t be able to cancel the order once it has been accepted and the order has been placed, so that they won’t be able to steal the food you have ordered.

Secondly, in the event the Grab rider wants to turn off their location so they cannot be detected once they steal your food, disable the option to turn off the location, so they can still be located.

Third, bring back the cash option even if the item costs more than 1k, if the first option cannot be implemented, so that the customer still has some assurance and security that the rider won’t be able to steal their food.

If you’re worried about customers who play pranks on our riders and don’t pay or cancel orders, don’t allow both the rider and customer to cancel their orders once they have been placed.",Beatrix24839,,,,
