ios,ph,,10452101486,Sun Oct 08 2023 12:48:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Can’t order at around 6:30 onwards,"Every time i try to order around past 6:30 i end up having a hard time to order ANYWHERE near me. Even if it’s just 35 min. Away. There’s no problem with the weather either. I had to try multiple branches of the same restaurant and still nothing. Tried other restaurants as well and still the same. Even if you change it to a priority delivery. Still nothing. You really have to order much earlier like 4-5 pm to atleast get 1 place to accept your other. Otherwise, you end up looking for a BUNCH of restaurants that can’t find a driver.",Anonymous-ass,,,,
