ios,ph,,10426303501,Sun Oct 01 2023 09:32:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Extremely bad customer service,They have a big company and a huge number of customers but they don’t seem to care about the customer service. This is the only company I know which doesn’t have a live agent to cater to customer complaints. I prolly have a thousand of transactions in grab and when the time came that I have a complaint there is no one to help real-time. You have to wait for 24hours to get an email feedback. The anxiety and stress that you have to go through for trusting a company is insane. I won’t be using this app anymore even though I relied on it a lot.,A.G.Sol,,,,
ios,ph,,10423784743,Sat Sep 30 2023 16:06:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Cancellation Compensation Fee,You get a 50 pesos compensation fee if you cancel your ride. Happened to me when I had to cancel my ride because the roads were flooding already and I had to cancel since no cars will be able to pass through so I had to stay inside nalang tapos ayun may noti na 50 pesos balance ako for cancelling???,EwanKoNaSaEarth,,"Apologies for the trouble. Passengers may be charged a Php50 fee for late cancellations and no-shows. If you were wrongly charged for a cancellation fee, you may file a report here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360001953328. ",Mon Oct 02 2023 03:51:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
