ios,ph,,10412600837,Wed Sep 27 2023 13:45:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Getting worse,"The wait time is never accurate. The GPS is consistently unreliable, leading to frustratingly long detours and wasted time. The cars themselves are sometimes in poor condition, with an unpleasant odor and a distinct lack of cleanliness. To make matters worse, some drivers seemed to possess subpar navigation skills, exacerbating an already infuriating situation in Manila’s notorious traffic. Disgusting. It was so much better with Uber before.",Habibino1984,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Thu Sep 28 2023 23:51:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,10410498004,Tue Sep 26 2023 22:18:06 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Transaction on Hold made it impossible to book,Grab charged me with a transaction on hold for a grabcar booking that no one accepted. NO ONE ACCEPTED. Why can't this be done when you actually have a ride???? Now I can't book until it gets refunded???,Manguito Dior,,"So sorry for this booking experience. 😞 If the booking has been canceled, the amount will be automatically refunded and will be reflected on your account depending on your bank's or e-wallet's policy. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can assist you further with this 🙏️ ",Thu Sep 28 2023 23:51:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
