ios,ph,,10397411231,Sat Sep 23 2023 05:59:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,ON HOLD,"Worst ever update ever!!!!!!!! I dont know why you added ON HOLD method when paying via gcash for food delivery. You should remove that policy cause it just add problem to your workers (because they have to cater all the complaints) and to us who order food. I ordered a food and used my gcash for payment (my gcash is already linked to my grab). I dont have any extra money aside from the money that I used to pay on ordering food from you. And then after minutes of waiting, my order was cancelled because no driver accepted it. So i just thought that I will reorder to another near restaurant. Then i checked my gcash, and i was frustated to see that there is already a deduction from my money (and i dont have any money anymore). It is stated that it is onhold and will be given to you once order is completed but in our case, you dont give it back immediately and all you say is that it is a problem on gcash and not you. Then find a way on how will you fix that. You should change that method, HOLD IT BUT DO NOT GET IT IN A WAY THAT YOU WE WILL WAIT FOR ANOTHER 24 HOURS FOR YOU TO  RETURN IT!!",dhuddbdjdixhdksnbshxjx,,"Hi there! Ang charge po na ito ay para sa pre-authorization at maibabalik naman ito sa account niyo, depende po sa policy ng inyong issuing bank o e-wallet 🙂 For more information, kindly visit this link: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360032609132-Bank-reversal-time-frame-for-pre-authorization-on-hold-amount



Pasensya po sa abala 🙏",Wed Sep 27 2023 01:35:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
