ios,ph,,10389768257,Thu Sep 21 2023 00:32:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Attitude of your grab drivers food/delivery,"Most of your grab drivers, have an attitude towards delivering items/ foods, i had complained it before, about 2 time but it happened to me more than that

We know filipinos are like that, they find ways to benefit themselves, those selfish acts that they inherit. It also has an impact to us customers, we do have things to do, and we do note because you have a note sign on it to deliver it door to door, if the bldg doesnt have an elevator, drivers dont want to deliver it door to door, they would tell us that its your protocol not to go in the building, even though our building allowed it for our own convenience. We do have work, work from home and meetings and we have to excused ourselves just to go down, still find your driver because they are not following instructions until we find what we deliver.

Its in our incovenience, especially drivers that is not educated, no empathy, and deliver it in their own time because obviously, your driver doesnt inform us that they book multiple booking. There would be a time that your company would lose to those drivers like that. Please do assess them more. Filipino today, especially young generations tale for granted what work they are given to them",kaiszy,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Wed Sep 27 2023 01:42:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
