ios,ph,,10304598775,Sun Aug 27 2023 11:58:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Driver Attitude = Safety,"Recently, we have noticed that the attitude of the drivers are becoming increasingly hostile. Threatening even. We had an experience wherein a driver stopped in the middle of the street to berate another driver. We felt unsafe because what if the other driver had a weapon and since we are in the car, we might get involved if anything happened. Mind you, we are in the middle of a busy street/rush hour, we might also get hit by the cars following us too. Also, we have been pinning correctly and the driver would insist on us to cross the street by hitting the horn repeatedly even if we are at the correct pin and lane on the way to the destination. It would also happen that even if we would put in the note specific instructions to get to our pinned point because the map would direct the driver to an incorrect route, the driver would not read it, and would even berate us even after we told him that we would just walk to him instead and even if we were in the right and he did not read the notes. There was also a time where we had a lot of bags, and we are in our pinned point, the driver explicitly moved past us, further away from the pinned point, even though they have seen us carrying heavy stuff. We hope that you can help your drivers have a better attitude. Your service is declining. All these has happened this August of 2023 alone.",meowmeowmeowpenguin,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Sat Sep 02 2023 11:42:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,10304366830,Sun Aug 27 2023 10:26:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,mehh,"Most drivers don't read the notes left. Before, you won't earn points unless you use GrabPay and now, you won't earn points unless you subscribe to their GrabUnlimited plan. I used to love the service, but now- mehh😑",TaxPayer01,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Sat Sep 02 2023 11:42:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
