ios,ph,,10148954973,Mon Jul 17 2023 03:45:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Help Center Agent Ended Chat Before Confirming,"Worst experience ever. My money was held for a total of two months after linking GCash to my payment method and driver cancelled on me. 

I followed up after a month because the app told to wait at most 30 days. Contacted an agent “Mikkie” and sent screenshots for proof not only in app but in gcash transactions. I was told to wait within 2 days for an email confirmation.

I did not receive an email confirmation until now so i contacted support again agent “Maria”

I was replied that they are processing it and they cant do anything about it. They cant give me assurance or transparency. Was given the ticket number after multiple times asking, but was told I cannot email directly for a follow up. I was told to just reply to an email thread that doesn't exist. I was asked to search for the ticket in emails and i sent them proof that I did not receive anything. 

I was agitated and mad that despite repeated questions they still cant answer nor even tell me what department is im charge after saying it’s “out of their department” and control. AFTER WHICH THEY JUST ENDED THE CHAT without even confirming if they were able to answer anything. 

Worst experience of my life, and i still dont have my money.",mrtsukiyo,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Allow us to make it up to you. Please reach out to us through our social media channels so we can assist you and take appropriate actions 🙏️ ,Thu Jul 20 2023 03:34:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
