ios,ph,,10135317193,Thu Jul 13 2023 11:11:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"I don’t if its my country, or Grab itself…","Over the years Grab has been a lone app that delivers item, taxi, and other stuff, but what happens when ageing starts? Law of diminishing returns, of course its not true to everything but with Grab in the Philippines, it is. Maybe they became complacent for not having competition, or maybe they really lack the imagination of how to serve their customers better. The rate has been overwhelming (and I believe really overcharged) to its customers, their waiting time has been increasing since the time I started using this app (so I guess this is one proof of diminishing returns…

This business hasnt been worth it lately. We need a better one.",Jigosan,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Sun Jul 16 2023 06:52:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,10135153965,Thu Jul 13 2023 10:07:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"Makes customers wait then eventually, your orders will be cancelled","Do not let your customers wait for 15-30 mins before you cancel an order. It is inhumane. We are expecting for our deliveries because we already wait that long. Do not waste your customers time. If no riders available, then cancel right away!!!!!! This is not the kind of service we deserve!",-n0ne-,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Sun Jul 16 2023 06:53:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,10134942886,Thu Jul 13 2023 08:39:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Don’t cash in. Do not use gcash also,"They hold your cash whenever a transaction does not finish. It doesn’t matter if you cancelled or the app itself cancels. If you rely on ewallet for your finances. They will hold your money for 24hrs after the cancellation.  As if you do not have sufficient amount minus the held amount, then you cannot order again or book a grab until the < 24hrs until they refund. Magpayaman Muna kayo Bago kayo mag grab",S2niggerguy,,"Hi there! The charge that you're seeing is a pre-authorization charge. This is also being refunded automatically and will reflect on your account depending on your issuing bank's policy. Please contact your issuing bank for assistance 🙂 For more information, you may visit this link here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360032609132-Bank-reversal-time-frame-for-pre-authorization-on-hold-amount

Hope this helps! 💚
",Sun Jul 16 2023 06:54:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
