ios,ph,,10127133356,Tue Jul 11 2023 05:35:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Order Cancellation,"I don’t specifically like how Grab wouldn’t allow us to just cancel our orders when they’re taking too long to be prepared by the merchants. I mean I get that it’s already being prepared so cancelling might let the food go to waste, but this should have some kind of a warning, especially during peak hours, that the preparation may take however long and give users an option to continue or cancel before locking the order in forcing us to starve while we wait.",5555555Yang5555555555555555555,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Fri Jul 14 2023 06:44:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,10123846946,Mon Jul 10 2023 09:08:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,EXPRESS SERVICE BECAME DANGEROUS,"My goods worth 10k were stolen by the rider mid-drop off. Now it seems I can’t do anything about it. 

The rider cancelled the booking mid way and my goods could no longer be recovered because all that Grab could do is call or text the unscrupulous rider. This is very passive!!!

Grab does not have safeguards and proactive stance against erring/thieving riders, who I believe were not properly and psychologically screened.

Its executives in Singapore are oblivious and unconscionable. They do not care!!!!

Do not use this app for booking other than food delivery! You will lose money!

I’m switching back to Lalamove!",Victor Sianghio Jr.,,"Hi Victor! We're sorry to hear about this and we know that it could have been a better experience 😔️ Our dedicated team is currently investigating this matter and will reach out to you as soon as possible. Rest assured, we have processes and policies in place to ensure that corrective actions are fairly implemented.",Fri Jul 14 2023 07:01:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
