ios,ph,,10083122854,Wed Jun 28 2023 23:02:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Everything is great about the app and service BUT the drivers,"Everything else about the app is great, it’s features, easy to navigate interface, the services it offers from food delivery to load etc. 

My only issues are with the drivers themselves. I’m not sure how but you need to make a better system where drivers get stricter penalties for Drivers who refuse the pickup once they find out the destination.

Ilang beses na Ito nangyayare. Just because the destination isn’t some high end place they will turn off their data so the customers will be the one getting frustrated and cancel the trip. Buti nalang almost everyone has a grab app so nag papa-book nalang ako using another device. Ano yun modus? Papatayin yung data pag Ayaw yung destination para customer mag cancel? There should be stricter punishments to Drivers who do this as well as give customers more power over frustrating drivers like these. Nakakainis na ilang beses. At first onti lang ganito. But I noticed this year 2023 Ang chochoosy ng mga drivers.",MarkFromMetroManila,,"So sorry for this booking experience 😔️ We discourage our drivers from canceling without any valid reasons. Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so we can take appropriate actions 🙏️",Fri Jul 07 2023 03:06:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
