ios,ph,,10080951059,Wed Jun 28 2023 09:30:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Disappointing Delivery Experience - Riders are choosy and Lazy,"Rating: ★★☆☆☆

I want to begin by clarifying that this review is not related to the app development or UI/UX of Grab, but rather a feedback regarding their recent delivery services. Lately, I have encountered numerous incidents where Grab initiates order cancellations without valid reasons. This has become an ongoing issue, and I've lost count of the occurrences.

The main reason cited for these cancellations is that the delivery cannot be made directly to my apartment unit. However, our condominium does not have any restrictions on deliveries, and Grab riders are welcome to use the elevator to reach the designated floor. The insistence on meeting outside or within the premises is unnecessary and inconvenient.

Both for personal use and through my company corporate partnership with GrabExpress, I have relied on Grab's services. However, their riders have become increasingly choosy or lazy in performing their job. While I would understand such restrictions during the height of the pandemic, this is not the case in our condominium at present.

I have reported this concern to Grab's customer service team, and while they acknowledge the issue and assure me it shouldn't happen, it continues to occur. This ongoing situation is highly frustrating, and it reflects poorly on the competence and work ethic of their riders.

I genuinely hope that Grab takes immediate action to rectify this problem. Their riders need to display professionalism, competence, and a willingness to fulfill their delivery responsibilities. I believe addressing these issues would greatly improve the overall customer experience.",ijakes7,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations 😞 Please reach out to us via Help Centre or through our Social Media platforms, so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️",Fri Jul 07 2023 03:07:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,10080740852,Wed Jun 28 2023 07:57:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,NEVER try their “Saver” Delivery,"I had the worst experience yet in using the Grab App so far when i tried their “Saver” Delivery option where it stated that the estimated time for your food to arrive would be around 50 minutes but mine took 3 hours + and still my food wasn’t prepared at all so I had no choice but to cancel.

Please don’t try their saver delivery option EVER it’s not worth your time…",UbeWanLubi,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can further assist you with your concern. Thank you 🙏️,Fri Jul 07 2023 03:11:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
