ios,ph,,10074940798,Mon Jun 26 2023 16:25:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Few Options and Merchant Slack,"Grab should enforce its registered merchants to update their online info esp. when an item is unavailable and other similar events. The search is somewhat useless; i searched for “American” and “American Breakfast” but the results are Filipino cuisine. When i tried searching “American” and i was able to select it in Cuisine filter; knowing this, i searched for “Breakfast” and the Cuisine filter is not there. Also, I would suggest an option to remove riders who bike (I wouldn’t want to wait on them when the order is more than 4km and it’s raining). I encountered a couple of times when the rider walks and commutes. On the green Grab bag, customize it to be more versatile esp. handling drinks. I understand you don’t control the content/merchants in the app. It would be nice to add a Diet filter as I repeatedly look for food options but ending not using your app because there is not much variety of merchants. Sometimes, GrabMart is the solution but lately I realized I can just go to the groceries which are a walk away. I tried Grab in Malaysia, that was the best experience I had. Here in the Philippines, it’s definitely lacking. Until i see big changes, my rating remains at 2/5 stars; it might become 1 if i find more bad experiences. Update (June 2023): I wish i can delete stores/shops so I never see them in my list/search; they are not worth it. Made Grab 1/5 stars.",superxol,,We regret hearing about this 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you 🙏️,Sat Jul 01 2023 10:19:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
