ios,ph,,9983726610,Wed May 31 2023 10:50:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Continuous Disappointments and Lack of Support,"I have been a dedicated user of the Grab app, specifically for Grab Food, for several years. However, I must express my deep disappointment with the recent experiences I've had. It seems that missing items have become a recurring issue this year, and it's incredibly frustrating.

In the past, when I reported missing items, I was informed that a refund would be provided through my Grab Pay wallet. While this was an acceptable resolution, it is disheartening to see that the same problem has occurred once again, and this time, the support team has remained unresponsive. This level of customer service is simply unacceptable.

When we pay for our food, we expect to receive the complete order. The repeated incidents of missing items not only compromise the value we pay for, but they also cause great inconvenience.

Regrettably, I have encountered four incomplete orders within just a span of two months. As a loyal user, this is incredibly disappointing and raises doubts about the reliability of the Grab app. I sincerely hope that the Grab team addresses these issues promptly and takes the necessary steps to rectify them.

Despite my previous satisfaction with the app, the recurring missing items and the lack of response from support have left me with no choice but to provide a one-star review. I hope Grab recognizes the importance of addressing these concerns to maintain the trust and loyalty of its customers.",maxxxxxyz,,,,
