ios,ph,,9931644596,Tue May 16 2023 04:56:27 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Here's another suggestion for you,"I understand that there is a protection for drivers and whatnot however, I just hope you improved your cash payment method since not all people as well have e-wallet or online bank cards. You can do the same thing in e-wallets/online banking where once the Order is placed, the customer cannot cancel his/her Order. I just hope you do not neglect the Cash Payment method. I have noticed this for months that we cannot even order any of the stores available since Cash Payment is not acceptable on your end. It's just that I find it really inconvenient that you declined the orders.

