ios,ph,,9887778826,Wed May 03 2023 10:09:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Overall great,"I love the ease of use and the drivers are almost universally excellent. However, the navigation software you provide them (Waze?) is terrible. 

I have had so many drivers take bizarre routes to get to me. Wrong turns in a low traffic area, driving around the block more than than once when there’s a straight path to get here and no traffic, u-turns galore, etc. 

Please fix your navigation software - give the drivers the same path you show on our side so we can adjust or rebook. I’ve wasted 15 minutes this afternoon waiting for a driver less than three blocks away because he’s going in circles and making U-turns.  And this is not the first time or even the second or third. Please fix this soon!",JK in Manila,,So sorry to hear this. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through social media platforms so we can look into this further. Thank you!  🙏️,Wed May 10 2023 07:10:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
