ios,ph,,9849967657,Sat Apr 22 2023 19:05:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Don’t Allow Drivers to Cancel,"Grab has been my go-to app for food deliveries. I really do like it especially the capability to see the location of the drivers real-time. But I’ve noticed that, at least from my location, while the app is searching for a driver, my orders are canceled when two drivers refused to pick up. This is fine with me, but I hate rebooking for the orders three times or more until a driver is found. 

I reached out to the customer support and I was told that the my area is too far. That is fine if they don’t want to do the job despite the fact that hefty delivery fees have already been paid. It’s bad customer service. 

Don’t allow them to cancel. Or, at least, have them penalized for canceling.",timclarke,,,,
