ios,ph,,9779742892,Sun Apr 02 2023 18:07:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Grab Taxi Meter Cheat,"I booked for grab taxi and it gives an estimation of the price for the meter plus the booking fee. So I rode the grab taxi, then before I got down the taxi, I checked the meter to be Php 458, but then when I checked the grab app, I was charged Php 558 + booking fee. It seemed that the driver cheated the meter by adding Php 100, then I emailed the support team, then they just said they apologized for the inconvenience then they just sent me the receipt of my ride which read Php 548 for the meter fare. I felt from my precious rides that this happened often, so I checked to be sure this time. 

I wondered if the tech support team really read what I wrote in the complaint because he just sent me my receipt and did not comment on anythIng regarding the meter being cheated which I wrote to the support team. the reply email said visit the website if you have further inquiries

Next time, hope you require drivers to send a picture of the meter as proof before charging the customers. It makes me feel uneasy to use grabpay because deduction is automatic and also decided by the driver

The other services are good though because the price is already set and there is a good protection for the money unlike in grabtaxi",MarcusSeba,,We're sorry to read about your experience 😞 Kindly allow us to make it up to you.  Please reach out to us through our social media channels so we can look into this further and escalate this to the respective team if necessary 🙏️ ,Wed Apr 05 2023 06:28:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
