ios,ph,,9735329083,Tue Mar 21 2023 03:20:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Lost Faith In This App,I had a great time using the app. But it comes to a point where customer service is more important than anything else. I ordered some sushi from a local shop and the food was honestly poorly made. I told grab to assist me but all they did was flag the shop. I got really sad how the customer service rep talked to me and how they can’t do anything about what happened. I honestly just wanted to feel like they cared about their customers more than making a profit. These shops posted in their app are part of the system for a reason… and I don’t see why they wouldn’t take responsibility for a shop they advertise in their app. Terms and conditions making them free from responsibility? It turned me OFF. So I deleted the application. Be wary guys.,Citar123,,"
