ios,ph,,9712122102,Tue Mar 14 2023 11:44:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,"Respectful Riders, Good service.","I recently ordered food delivery from GrabFood and I was blown away by the exceptional service provided by their rider. Not only did he arrive on time, but he was also incredibly respectful and courteous throughout the entire delivery process.

From the moment he arrived at my doorstep, he greeted me with a warm smile and handed over my food with care. He even took the time to double-check my order to ensure that everything was correct before leaving. (Kudos Kuya Jonathan!)

I have ordered food delivery today from various platforms like Food Panda, but the service provided by this GrabFood rider was truly exceptional. It's refreshing to see that there are still delivery riders out there who understand the importance of providing excellent customer service.

