ios,ph,,9643324719,Wed Feb 22 2023 11:59:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Suggestion,"Grab App is great. 
But may I request for additional help? 
My children are under my account, and they book rides and food under my credit card. 
May I suggest:
If there are more than 1 accounts under the same credit card, the main account holder (the parent), get a copy of all usage of that credit card - rides, food, pabili, etc. Of our dependents/ children. 
At this point, I get a text from the credit card company if my card is used in the Grab App, but not even on all transactions. I guess it chooses the transactions randomly. 
On the other hand, Grab can do this. You can report to the main account everything that has been spent on by the “supplementary accounts”. 

I hope Grab considers this as it will help
Us parents monitor our kids’ spending with Grab.
Thank you very much!",Hb1ac,,"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing this with us! Rest assured, we are continuously working to improve our services for everyone on the platform. Make sure to look out for updates to utilize our app's features! 💚",Fri Feb 24 2023 07:30:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
