ios,ph,,9538029958,Mon Jan 23 2023 09:25:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Abusive Grab drivers,"I’ve been using grab for years for my transportation. It was good at first but I noticed how some Grab drivers abuse their control over the passengers esp the No Show Fee. And the app itself is not showing the precise estimated time of arrival. I had experience once when the app was telling me the estimated time is 2 minutes and it wasn’t even a minute that has been passed when the app suddenly notified me that the driver has arrived, so I immediately chat the driver that I couldn’t find him but he immediately cancelled the booking and I was charged of no show fee. He didn’t even messaged me where he was, he just immediately cancelled. I didnt even see his car and Im already waiting outside. It already happened a coiple of times already and this has brought many passengers at the very disadvantage side.",mmndwgg,,So sorry for this experience 😞 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or through our social media platforms so that we can further assist you with this concern. Thank you 🙏️,Thu Jan 26 2023 00:36:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
