ios,ph,,9399190477,Thu Dec 15 2022 16:29:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Cannot book anything,"In this country where public transpo is very difficult, one can only rely with taxis and apps like this. However, Grab is far from being reliable or useful at all! I was never able to get a driver through this app because their drivers are so picky! I waited for 2 hours and nothing. I thought maybe my app was not updated so I deleted and reinstalled it but still the same result! I tried hailing for a regular taxi and I got one in 30 minutes! I mean, really, I thought you developed this app to make getting taxis easier but I have never really experienced that!!! With your system and your picky drivers, booking a GrabCar is WAAAY more difficult than manually hailing for a taxi. Just a useless app.",hali0o01,,,,
