ios,ph,,9386738879,Mon Dec 12 2022 02:38:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Terrible Drivers and Customer Service,"TERRIBLE EXPERIENCE WITH Grab Express!!

Today I booked the Instant Delivery service which I paid extra because the receiver needs the package immediately. 

A driver was assigned right away after I confirmed the booking. I waited for 30mins then to an hour to almost 2 hours, while also been trying to contact him yet no answer. But I can see his location that he was just in one place on standby. I did not have the option to cancel it so I contacted customer service. But of course, the only resolution was to cancel my booking and try again. But I have already expressed my disappointment to them how this wasn’t the first time, drivers cancel booking very frequently now.

So I booked again, and the second driver automatically cancelled the order.

The THIRD driver finally called me. AND HERE COMES THE MOST UPSETTING PART! 
I overheard the other drivers that canceled on me in the background laughing and how they convinced the new driver to just also cancel my booking. They sounded like they don’t really care for their jobs and MADE THE BOOKING A LAUGHING MATTER! 
So, I told the driver that I already reported those drivers and then that I will wait for him and he did confirm he will come, BUT AFTER 2 mins he CANCELED it also!!  

GUESS WHAT? THEY ARE ALL HAVING A NICE RELAXING TIME at Gaisano Talamban’s parking lot. 

As customer who orders from GrabFood and ride with grab car a lot. They will literally lose one customer today. But to them one customer might not matter, until that customer can spread awareness to others.",Shacha Lad,,,,
