ios,ph,,9316144700,Tue Nov 22 2022 09:44:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Customers still at the mercy of Drivers,"Regardless of membership tier, they claim platinum get priority booking, it does not matter because they still allow drivers to choose to accept or not. So in essence, it doesn’t matter whatever your membership status is, drivers won’t accept your booking if they don’t want to anyway. Also updated this for a recent experience. Kudos for automatically finding a nearer driver but then you still allow that driver to cancel once they complete their first ride. What was the point? I still had to wait thinking I already had a ride, then when they get there they just cancelled on me. 

Rewards catalogue are just secondary when it comes to rewards status, but even that does not offer much these days. 

What’s the point of being technically the only player in the market if you still can’t ensure your customers, who I assume is still a significant source of revenue, can’t get rides because you’re too afraid of your driver partners?",BatmanLoveJollibee,,,,
