ios,ph,,9277567617,Fri Nov 11 2022 10:26:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Double Charging of Delivery Fee,"Already paid P179 for delivery fee for long distance delivery then grab app uses multiple delivery for the rider. So basically, grab received 2 payments for 1 single rider, but the customers. Grab driver will benefit because both recipients are nearby to each other (less fuel consumption). Grab will will also benefit because they’re charging both recipients with full delivery fee. But customers suffer. Longer waiting time but still paying full amount for delivery fee. When in fact, delivery fees are already adjusted based on location. This kind of scheme needs to be adjusted. Taking advantage of customers.",Double Handling,,,,
