ios,ph,,9134894227,Fri Sep 30 2022 01:15:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Today’s Ride with Mang Filamer,"Today’s ride was great. The driver had dropped us at Harbour’s Square, as per our request. We had originally booked a ride going to the Terminal 1 Airport because we had left our car here at Harbour’s Square due to the Coding Policy. Upon talking with Mang Filamer, he had confirmed with us that the window for coding will start at 10AM. With that, we had decided to just go here at Harbour Square and wait here until 10AM so we can just bring our car going to the Terminal 1. I hope Grab will understand. Because sir Filamer Dechosa Josol was very understanding and kind towards us. He has a great personality and even helped us with the luggages. Thank you!",kcjejcnnsnnsnnfnncnsmxjchxhjsa,,,,
