ios,ph,,8976481293,Sun Aug 14 2022 03:27:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,"Once an alternative is available, I’m jumping ship","👍Pros: Enticing promo offers; multiple ways to pay and top up wallet 
👎Cons: Everything else—can’t get message notifications if app isn’t open (which has been an issue since Grab added an in-app chat function); open restaurants will randomly close and you’ll only find out when you submit your order; closed restaurants will randomly open; no way to share a restaurant’s page, so it’s difficult to get everyone’s orders (group order is useless for people who don’t have the grab app); AWFUL customer support",KN0W1T4LL,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations. We'll raise this to the concerned team so we can roll-out further improvements on our app's features moving forward. 🙂

You may also reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms if you need further assistance. Thank you. 🙏",Fri Jan 21 2022 07:26:38 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
