ios,ph,,8846095819,Wed Jul 06 2022 11:26:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Frequent Cancellations and Non-existent Cancellation Notifs,"For developers: Can you please add more functionality for cancelation notifications (for more visibility). Cancellations happen too frequently, and I’d prefer to know it’s cancelled so I can reorder. 

For Grab: Is there a way to address this frequent cancellation issue? Such as giving a priority delivery per cancellation by the driver? 

Full Review: 

As frequent users of Grab, it’s been quite disheartening to see all the cancellations that come after the rollout of the Priority Delivery (+40 php) feature. Before it would rarely or sometimes happen, lately it has been an occurrence that I encounter almost every time I use Grab without the added fee. 

I’ve had multiple instances where I book normally for a restaurant, and it cancels 3 times. Only when I give up and book with Priority Delivery do I actually get a successful delivery. 

 

When a delivery does get cancelled, the notification barely pushes through as well. I need to almost constantly keep my eyes on the application to make sure it pushes through. It’s become frustrating to expect food to arrive, only to realize that it was cancelled (checking notifications, without seeing any regarding the cancellation).",Pat Cu,,,,
