ios,ph,,8717055370,Sat May 28 2022 15:53:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Unreliable taxi service,"Considering the recent oil price hike, you should raise the base rate so drivers won’t feel the need to ditch the automatic meter and set their own ridiculous rates. This is beyond inconvenient not just to passengers but mostly to drivers trying to make a living. You can’t be charging the same amount when there’s been a constant increase in oil price! It’s unfair to the drivers. And it makes it so hard for us passengers to find drivers who are willing to follow the meter’s rate. Grab can do so much better than this!",Sporty 🏀,,"Apologies for this, Sporty. We know that you chose Grab for convenience and something like this is really not helpful. Rest assured that this feedback is highly appreciated for better service. 🙏 Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.",Mon May 30 2022 06:55:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
