ios,ph,,8688390256,Fri May 20 2022 02:13:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Grab taxi fare,"Hi, Im a regular grab taxi user. Why is the booking rate fee increase a lot! Its like only Php20 difference from grab car? Changing Without prior notice. My fare doubled because of the booking fee.",mdaquiz,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations, Mdaquiz. Our booking fee helps our driver-partners better support the increasing demand for transport. Feel free to reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.",Thu May 26 2022 06:52:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,8688169487,Fri May 20 2022 00:29:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Drivers too far,"I am heavily reliant to Grab Car because it’s real convenient for me especially when I go home after long hours of work. So it’s really frustrating when you have to wait for 30 -60 minutes for the driver to arrive because he/she’s too far from your pick up point. What’s more irritating is the incorrect waiting time shown. Then, even after canceling hoping to get another booking nearer you, you end up on the same driver, which should not be the case. Of course you cannot cancel multiple times or else your account will be suspended. This should be changed. Efficiency & speed are 2 of the reasons why I choose Grab but, it’s not delivering these days.",Karlleeee,,"We're really sorry to hear about your booking experience, Carrrrrs. It could get a bit harder to book because of the high demand for rides. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.",Thu May 26 2022 06:28:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
