ios,ph,,8579370337,Mon Apr 18 2022 04:42:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Customer Care FAIL,"I rarely have bad experiences with Grab Food and have been ordering at least once or twice a week for the last 2 years. Last week however,  you did so many customer service fails :
1. Thursday 
- driver said he never accepted the job and this is after the app has been updating of delays for about 2 hours
- contacted customer care and through chat he/she said both driver and restaurant can’t be contacted, then advised that best option is to cancel and reorder 
- just then app updates that food is ready for delivery and driver messages he is ready too 
- But customer care already canceled (Di daw nakita yung status na ready for delivery!) and there is no way to rebook and get the food already ready and through the driver already in store. Need a new order to be prepared which will take another hour. Di pwede contact merchant to give the food already ready. Sorry daw! Kawawa naman yung driver who rushed to the restaurant and the merchant who prepared the food already.

2. Sunday 
- Order taking too long so messaged customer care to cancel. Got an email and app confirmation that request to cancel is confirmed 
- Reordered in another restaurant 
- After  30 minutes got a message from the first restaurant that food is ready for delivery 
- Contacted customer care right away. They will check daw. But before they are able to check (ang tagal!) order arrived na. I received it as I knew not the riders fault and he may be penalized.
- However our food order effectively doubled! Like we really couldn’t finish  that much so ended up giving away food to neighbors 
- So naturally I complained. The next day I get a “sorry here’s P50 GC”",cesn229,,We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you. 🙏,Wed May 04 2022 07:41:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
