ios,ph,,8525258630,Sun Apr 03 2022 01:37:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,pls subsidize your drivers :),"app works fine, but I’m writing a review because the rates for grabcar are unreasonably high. grab has a monopolized the TNVS industry and this is really not great for us app users. Also not great for the drivers. Most that I’ve spoken to said that they haven’t received any subsidies/ayuda for the pandemic, and now that the fuel prices have gone up, riders also haven’t received any fuel subsidies and Grab’s commission rates stay the same :/ which means drivers are less motivated to go on the road. less drivers=more demand, surge prices are too high.",aajc55,,"Our fare would generally depend on the distance between the pick-up and drop off points, as well as the surge and supply/demand during the time of booking. For any concerns, please reach us via our Help Center or Social Media channels.",Tue May 31 2022 06:50:27 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
