ios,ph,,8508989419,Tue Mar 29 2022 16:26:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Add a feature for PET ride,I have a love hate relationship with GRAB as I prefer UBER than this. But since they dominate asia this leaves people No choice but to use it. I like the other services such grab food and grab pabili it’s really helpful however GRAB car are the worst for me. I hope this comes to your attention to add a feature wherein a pet is allowed for a ride or yet make a specific booking that can transit people with pets. Most of the time the grab driver cancels my trip when they find out I have a Pet with me. They are already at my doorstep but they still cancels this. It happens to me multiple times and it takes more an hour or 2 to find a good driver that allows a PET in there. Sometimes I find one but that driver is mad at us. I really hate it when it happens I don’t know if they hate PET or what. I hope this comes to your attention.,Neingutenough,,"We're sorry to hear about your experience. Majority of our operating units accept pets on board. However, we leave it to the driver's discretion if they'll be accepting the request, since some drivers may have allergies or are otherwise uncomfortable with unfamiliar animals. You may check it here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115013252687-My-driver-refused-to-have-pets-on-board. Thank you for understanding.",Wed Jun 01 2022 06:21:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
