ios,ph,,8406004925,Mon Feb 28 2022 16:34:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Waze / Map is not working properly.,"I hope you fix this, because some grab drivers is having trouble with your map. I feel bad with the driver I booked for Grab food tonight, he was in frustration as we talked on the phone. But I will still giving him a 5 star once he arrived here any minute. I also see that your map is not working nor showing on the Grab app. Grab driver is really trying his best to deliver the food ASAP any moment, as he didn’t know the place, he came in the other way (Brgy. Payatas), when my pin Location was in (Brgy. Batasan Hills). I understand the hassle. But please improve your map and navigation. I encountered this 2 times this month. Thankyou!",alpha1008,,We constantly work to improve the accuracy of the location data so we can serve you better. 👍 You may submit your feedback here so our team can review this: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115011824807-Report-a-map-or-location-issue. Thank you!,Fri Mar 04 2022 06:53:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
