ios,ph,,8325515300,Sun Feb 06 2022 13:51:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Quick Respinse from Help Center,"I have been a long time user of the Grab app especially for GrabFood and GrabMart and sometimes the GrabCar. In fact, i have been a Platinum member for a long time now.

I aleady experienced missing items in my order, once wirh the GrabMart and one with GrabFood. I wrote the Grab Help Center thru the app to complain the missing items, and on both occasions, the Grab Help Center promptly made action and refunded on my Grab wallet the cost of the missing items. Ung sa GrabMart ok lang ung missing item kasi hindi naman sya urgently needed so i can just order it again the next time i do my grocery.

Ang medyo hustle eh ung sa GrabFood kasi 3cups of rice were missing so nabitin tuloy kami sa dinner namin. But anyway, i commend the quick response of the customer reps of the Grab Help Center. Keep up the good work. More power to Grab. You are a big help in this pandemic.",Dannylo23,,,,
