ios,ph,,8265274157,Fri Jan 21 2022 10:59:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,grabpay issue,"I couldn’t transfer my funds from my grabpay even though my account was already verified and the recipient was verified too. It’s said that my funds are transferable, still, it couldn’t transfer.",marcyyyy abadeer,,"We regret hearing about this, Marcy. ☹ Funds cashed-in via credit card is non-transferable balance. You can use this for rides, food, deliveries, shopping, and other payments that can be facilitated with your GrabPay Wallet.

