ios,ph,,8264864661,Fri Jan 21 2022 08:07:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,For devs,"Hi! Can there be a small overview of the customer profile specifically to gender? It's so gender-biased the drivers automatically assume the names they read are female (they message with ""ma'am""). Sometimes it's okay, but sometimes it can be a little disrespectful.",\Willow/,,"We are grateful that you took the time out to leave us a 5-Star review. Thank you for this suggestion. We'll raise this to the concerned team so we can roll-out further improvements on our app's feature moving forward. 💚

