ios,ph,,8236041121,Thu Jan 13 2022 15:11:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,unresponsive to reports,"I can still remember the time when I ordered 3 grilled chicken from Jo’s Chicken Inato at Plazuela Iloilo. When I opened the styrofoam which contains the food, I immediately saw a cockroach mixed with rice. I was shocked as I already ate the first grilled chicken without inspecting it. I was saving the other two for lunch and dinner. So after seeing the disgusting roach in the rice, I opened the third styrofoam and there I saw the legs of cockroach in the rice aswell. I reached out to the restaurant but with no response. I tried to report it to Grab Customer Service but until now they have not acted upon it. I am frustrated that grab allows this kind of food to be served it its customers. After this experience, I totally lost faith in grab and decided to never ever use the app again.",PappaCologne,,"Our sincerest apology for the inconvenience that this has caused you, Pappa. We all love food that is prepared fresh that is why we strive to partner with the highest quality restaurants to meet your expectations.

Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.

We are doing our best for our consumers to have a great experience when using the app to enjoy both the food they ordered from our partner merchants and the convenience of delivering it right on their doorstep. 🙏",Wed Jan 26 2022 07:47:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
