ios,ph,,7964662437,Fri Oct 29 2021 02:55:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Deducted amount in my card when the transaction was cancelled by the driver,"This happened quite a lot. The app will say that the amount is on hold and it will be deducted once transaction is complete but my bank already texted me that the amount was deducted. EVERY SINGLE TIME. And whenever the driver cancels, the amount won’t be returned so my card is deducted with the same amount TWICE. This happens a lot and when I asked the support team, they said to wait until a month for the refund since it depends on the bank but it has already been more then 4 months!!! I HAVEN’T RECEIVED ANY REFUND FROM ALL THE UNREASONABLE DEDUCTIONS FROM CANCELLATIONS OF THE DRIVER.",Cebuana Shopper,,,,
ios,ph,,7961681566,Thu Oct 28 2021 06:45:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Can’t use the other payment method to order food,"I don’t know whats the problem when I add to payment my credit card, I submitted already the otp and pay the 50 pesos transaction fee. But I can’t use the credit card payment to order food. I’m Disappointed it’s my 2nd time. Sayang 100 pesos 😒",menang000000,,"Sorry for the trouble, Menang! ☹ Registering a card on the Grab App initiates a pre-authorization charge and this is reversed automatically. You may coordinate with your issuing bank for more information regarding the refund process. 👍

Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.",Sat Oct 30 2021 02:38:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7960597411,Wed Oct 27 2021 22:04:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Grab Food Delivery Review,First time to try your food delivery service and we are happy that the cake was delivered safely and promptly. Thank you to the driver. ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️,Cristine Jen Marie 🌱,,"We are grateful that you took the time out to leave us a 5-Star review! We hope you enjoyed your treats. 🍰

