ios,ph,,7958328103,Wed Oct 27 2021 07:30:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Highly recommended!,Grab has always been dependable when you needed it most. Though I hAve some issues when it comes to their rate specially during peak hours. But most of the grab riders are friendly and customer oriented which is essential to this line of work 👍🏼🙌🏼 Maraming Salamat po! 🙏🏼,Primezskie,,"Yay! Thanks for the awesome review, Primezskie. 💚 We will continue to find ways to serve your essential needs in the safest ways possible. 

If you're still experiencing an issue with rating your GrabFood order on your Grab app, please reach us via our Help Center or Social Media channels. We're happy to help anytime! 🙏 ",Sat Oct 30 2021 03:08:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7958166329,Wed Oct 27 2021 06:07:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Verication,"Waited too long to verified my e-wallets, I already send money to Grab pay but their verification is poor! I am new and I am very disappointed!",jkeyn,,"Oh no, Jkeyn! 😥 The GrabPay wallet is license is licensed and regulated by the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas so we are also very thorough in identifying each of the users before approving their GrabPay wallet verification. We aim to provide a safe and convenient experience to our consumers.

