ios,ph,,7954444600,Tue Oct 26 2021 03:21:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,"Love the app, some suggestions though for Grab Food, hope dev team will notice","Please stop making Grab Riders cater to more than one order at a time, it makes the waiting time longer, its not good for the customers and not good for the possible rating of the rider. 

Kindly mandate all merchants in Grab Food to contact the customers first about ANY CHANGES about the order big or small because it took time to make the order yet they just change it without notice, if they called I could’ve had a chance to add something else instead.",Ray Ray Panda,,"Thanks for sharing your suggestion, Ray Ray! We group orders that are made within the same period so that our delivery-partners can complete more trips and serve as many consumers as we can.

Our team will do our best to sort this out with our partner-restaurants to prevent this from happening again and meet your expectations. 🙂

Rest assured that we continue to offer solutions that works for everyone on the platform.💚 Cheers! ",Sat Oct 30 2021 08:38:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7948746198,Sun Oct 24 2021 12:14:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Horrible App Experience,"The idiots suspended my Grab account for unknown reasons. Said something about irregular activity when I only use one email address and one credit card. App was too hassle to use asking me to take different steps only to tell me in the end my account was suspended. What reason could a customer’s account get suspended ? I’ve been using the app for a long time, never complained to the drivers, never had any issues before, but no. You guys decided to just kick me out. You lost one hell of a valuable customer!",Heldo J,,"We are sorry to know about the current status of your account, Heldo. ☹ Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.
