ios,ph,,7902421433,Mon Oct 11 2021 12:33:06 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Bad Driver and Arrogant Riders,"Terible app. I have to pay double for my grab car because I wasn’t notified that i already paid my ride with grabpay and the driver didn’t even tell me that i have already paid my ride. Not knowing that, i paid another via the drivers gcash acc. I forwarded this concern of mine via their customer service email address and their reply was it’s my fault for not recognizing that i have paid via grab pay. Wow, now it is my fault and they didnt even return the money i paid. I hope the developer will recognize this flaw in their app and I hope my concern will be addressed as well. Also, my mother who has the same app had a terrible experience with this app as well. This happened this night, particularly from grab cebu, A rider who delivered our ordered goods was mad at as for waiting a long time outside our home and for not returning his messages and calls. How did we know if he ever called or texted us when there is no notification received notifying just that. Now I have to deal with the anger of the rider and i have to deal with my own anger as welI because i reciprocated his attitude with mine. I know there is a misunderstanding in this situation but if the company or developer has a great amount of concern to their customers then they must fix this issue and help avoid similar issues as well. I have downloaded this app for my benefit and I didn’t download this app for the purpose of receiving such inconveniences. If they continue to this, then i suggest the developer to stop running the app and close the company.",redarad*,,,,
