ios,ph,,7789658917,Fri Sep 10 2021 02:56:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Commendation,I would like to commend all Grab Riders for their dedication and hard work. Magaan ang buhay ko ngayon dahil sa kanila. We can eat food from our favorite restaurants without even going there! Our riders brings happiness to our home... Also wala ng effort at risk mag grocery because they do it for us... Not minding the risk of getting sick... They deserve a raise and I hope they have sufficient health care benefits na masasandalan nila in case they get sick... Please provide them extra hygene kits like alcohol and disinfectant sprays. And require them to always disinfect themselves and their motorcycles after each deliveries especially their compartments. They’ll never know kung yung ppuntahan nilang bahay ay meron palang may covid. Please ingatan sana sila ng Grab because we need them... Thank you!,yna0913,,,,
