ios,ph,,7691234742,Sat Aug 14 2021 09:23:27 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Food delivery took more than an Hour!,"We ordered thru grab and it took more than 1 and a half hour for our order to arrive. First time ordering on a certain pizza place and since the delivery took more than an hour pizza was cold and saggy. Rider turned off his Data connection and estimated time of delivery changed multiple times. No customer service available on the app. You need to email your concern which approximately replies within 2 days. To be honest, grab has the worst customer service experience compared to other food delivery services. Also, the concern is regarding food so it is expected that there should be a more efficient way to resolve an issue. Lastly requested for a full refund since it ruined our order but they have informed me that full refund is only applicable if we took a photo discarding the order. How would we know about that policy if there is no real time assistance? Grab seriously needs to look into and improve on their customer assistance. Food delivery service concern needs immediate assitance and support to resolve an issue, more so during our current situation that we have a pandemic. Please look into how your competitors provide customer assistance, might learn a thing or two to provide satisfactory customer assistance.",unsatisfied customer 1000,,,,
