ios,ph,,7660417905,Fri Aug 06 2021 05:30:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Be Aware of Cash-in,"I had 5 failed Cash-in attempts in the past 2 months (July, August 2021). 
While the cash-in was stated failed, they still deduct money from your bank. After that, it becomes your own responsibility to chase after the money that’s yours. In my case, my bank even asked me to wait for 50 banking days for them to resolved this disput, because their “policy”. 
I ended up filing complaint to BSP, and got my money a week after. 
Nonetheless, grab will not fix their system for constant failing cash-in service.",Zzzoooo1235,,,,
