ios,ph,,7660084467,Fri Aug 06 2021 03:14:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Grab App User Since Day 1!,"Thank you so much for providing users everything we need 💚 Grabpay | Grabmart | Grabfood (errr.. before it was Grabcar too but aince WFH is a trend now, I rarely use it na) really is the most convenient for me especially now that almost everything are done online. I know the transfers are temporarily free of charge but it is really helpful. No glitches in transfers unlike GCash, nangangain 😒 Quick suggestion, I would like to suggest to please make a way how to track the “pranksters” cause our riders are also humans too. They work hard for their families, even risking their lives during covid, rain or shine they have to go outside and deliver. Also, please have a live chat button available anytime for us to report real time. (Unauthorized transactions, rude drivers etc) Overall, Grab really is a helpful app. Lovin it for years and years now 💚 Thanks!",Unforeseen Bliss,,,,
