ios,ph,,7651711906,Tue Aug 03 2021 21:47:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Uncaring to customer,"Your app does not have a customer support. One of your riders agreed to deliver my product to a customer during a rainy day. It was not delivered at all. I tried contacting your rider directly to know what happened but no response at all, even after two days of calling him. 
I refunded my customer for her payment and considered my item lost in transit.
On the day that the item was not delivered, I tried searching your app for customer support chat or a hotline. To my surprise, there was none. I searched the web for information as to your customer hotline or any link to help me with my concern. I just found an email. I emailed grab about my concern. It took 2 days for your grab personnel to reply with an apology for being unable to contact your rider and asking whether I had resolved my issue. I replied giving the status about my concern, saying I never got to contact your rider as to the whereabouts of my item for delivery. You promised to further contact your rider. It has been 3 weeks since the issue. The issue was not resolved at all at your end. Your customer support is very poor. No heart at all. Don’t boast about being a leading delivery service app when you have such as poor customer support. There are better delivery services app to support small businesses like mine.",kittyktxt,,,,
ios,ph,,7648564571,Tue Aug 03 2021 02:17:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,DO NOT USE GRAB,"I have been charged 3x my original amount but Grab offers NO WAY TO CONTACT THEM FOR CUSTOMER SUPPORT other than their in-app help centre which hasn't responded in any way for 4 days straight. I repeat, DO NOT USE GRAB.",customer4264,,,,
