ios,ph,,7626993374,Wed Jul 28 2021 10:10:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,GRABPAY IN POS TERMINAL,"Hi, I just want to share my experiences with use of my GRABPAY WALLET thru online transactions and in scanning the qr codes in pos terminal was quite good and convenient. However, some of the cashier (with grabpay logo on their post/counter) usually didn’t know that grabpay exist. They don’t know how to accept payment using grabpay and so ignorant of the grabpay payment itself to the point that they jokingly said that grabpay is only accessible in GRAB APP and suggest to order there to use it. I was confused on how they manage to work as a cashier with their full of confidence along with grabpay logo in front of their desk as one of the accepted payment options. Anyways, my point is, I hope that there are improvements on teaching cashiers with acceptable Grabpay options, on how to properly initiate a transaction using Grabpay especially in malls. My overall experience with Grabpay was wonderful, however it is a nightmare when someone look at you as being dumb because they thought I’m ignorant and they can’t distinguish the difference of Grab orders tru app and payments tru GrabPay wallet. Cheers to more years of productivity and rewards!",AMMIlano,,"Thanks for the review, AMMIlano. 🙂 Our team will do our best to sort this out and avoid this from happening again. We know that you chose GrabPay for convenience and a situation like this  is really not helpful.

For any concerns, please reach us via our Help Center or Social Media channels.",Tue Jul 27 2021 10:59:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
