ios,ph,,7612761163,Sat Jul 24 2021 13:25:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Rating option for customers,"This is a service that is very useful especially during this pandemic. In the app the customers can rate, review and even tip the riders and drivers. Can I suggest that they can also rate the customers so that the service providers can have an idea what type of customers they are going to serve, as rated or reviewed by other riders and drivers. I believe this will be a great help to minimize bogus bookings and rude customers as well. This can also be beneficial to those customers that are very easy to transact with. The the riders and drivers will not hesitate to give their services to those customers because they can see the reviews of other riders are positive towards them.",jpeToro,,,,
