ios,ph,,7527618669,Thu Jul 01 2021 16:28:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,CAN BE A LOT BETTER,"- Promo codes too rare - Drivers refuelling during transit - Top up should be available from all drivers - grabfood menu should have pictures per item
UPDATE: 80-90% food menu now have pictures GREAT JOB! - food delivery vouchers can be better.. there are times wed see several but eventually find that only one or nothing is valid/usable. Also, it would be nice if only those usable vouchers will show rather than us going through each voucher before we find one suitable or usable. - Lastly, it would really really be nice and helpful if we see in each restaurant THE DATE WE LAST ORDERED from them and maybe our OWN RATING to them. This will help us remember and avoid those restaurants or food that we didn’t enjoy much or had bad experience with.",MikeeLKM,,"We hear you and we appreciate you for sharing your feedback and experience, Mikee! 🙏We'll raise this to the concerned team so we can roll-out further improvements on the Grab app moving forward. ✨ Your feedback is vital to upholding the quality of our future services. ",Tue Jul 27 2021 10:52:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
