ios,ph,,7512718955,Sun Jun 27 2021 18:15:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Stranger Danger!!!,"Night time, pandemic. No other choice but to book grab even if it’s expensive. After all it was for my own safety. Right? WRONG!

I typed an address in the app. Savemore binan.  and I was in a hurry so I immediately clicked the first suggestion. I was canvassing it earlier and the price was at the same range so I didn’t even think twice in booking it.

The driver arrived early. I got in. We exchanged greetings. It was a calm ride. The driver was quiet and I was too. Just how I wanted it.

After exiting SLEX entering carmona the driver took a different turn than to what I was used to. Immediately check the app and I thought, “huh he was following the route to exactly it is maybe it’s a shortcut computed by the smart app what a revolutionary technology”.

After a couple minutes I realized, something doesn’t feel right. As every minute passes by the road got darker… and darker. Imagine a road with no building in sight, no light posts, no other vehicles. It was pitch BLACK!

Then we reached our destination. 
The driver finally broke the silence, “Sir diretso pa po ba”.
“Kuya nasan po yung save more?”
“Sir di ko nga din po alam. May alam po akong savemore binan pero malayo dito.”

The driver willingly drove me to my home. On the way we got to talking. The app must’ve made an error during that booking. He told me stories of power-tripping passengers who gives 1star for breakfast. He experienced, a passenger booked somewhere dark and then lead him to a robbery. He only got to go home only with his underwear. He too was scared that I might’ve been doing the same thing. We were both terrified with this experience. Luckily, I was with a commendable driver.

I gave 5 stars to the driver. And an additional 350 php which was the fare set by the grab app and he showed me. Imagine how far the drop off set by the app from my supposed drop off. Now I give 1 star to the app. After all I’ve spent 350 php on top of the 800+ I’ve paid from the initial booking. This is the most I’ve spent on a “free” app.",Reneengineer,,"Safety is Grab’s main priority and we’re truly sorry about this experience, Renee. ☹ We are actively improving map and location information. You may provide the booking ID and pin name with complete address. Submit this to our Help Center with the article ""Report a map or location issue"". We hope to receive your feedback so we can take note and help make your next trip home with Grab better. 🙏",Fri Aug 20 2021 03:06:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7511541556,Sun Jun 27 2021 11:43:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Offers a lot of options but….,The app has improved a lot since it’s inception. However till now there is no way to avail of senior and pwd discounts when ordering food. Please have that option for seniors and pwd’s.,Rins1218,,"We are grateful that you took the time out to leave us a 5-Star review, Rins1218. 🙂 For GrabFood, senior Citizens and PWD are now eligible for the discount. This will only apply to the delivery fee and not the entire order. Hope this helps! 🙏

If you have not tried GrabMart yet, you can have everyday essentials delivered to your door instantly, so we want you to try it out! 🙂 Use the promo code TARAGRABMART to enjoy free delivery! ✨ Your family and friends can try it too, T&C apply",Fri Aug 20 2021 02:52:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7510653775,Sun Jun 27 2021 05:55:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,No refund,"I ordered using a P300 gift card, but went down the drain because “No driver available”.  There should be a page in the app for errors and what to do.  Help Center is useless.",Kulasr,,"We regret hearing about this, Kulasr. Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.",Fri Aug 20 2021 02:50:03 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7506874472,Sat Jun 26 2021 05:28:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Amazing Service,"I switched to GRAB for my food and delivery services because i wanted to try an online service who can really deliver quality service.. When i finally tried the food delivery even the pabili with GRAB i was really amazed at how efficient the grab riders are, they are very professional and what i loved the most is the contactless option and they are really great in following instructions especially to busy people like me. However, These past few days of delivery, i am again experincing some annoying deliveries from riders who doesn’t follow instructions and the contactless option i was enjoying is not there anymore. Food riders are not as efficient as those i had encountered before. I am writing this review becausw I have always been a GRAB APP user even abroad with the Grab Car/Taxi services.  I am always amazed by your efficiency, effectiveness and great services.  I don’t want it to change, in fact i want it to level up even more.  But if the new riders will not be monitored with the poor delivery services, then I will be really sad for GRAB.  I hope this review will be considered.

I LOVE YOUR APP and the QUALITY OF YOUR SERVICES … Please maintain it and be vigilant to anyone or anything that would do harm in your system. 

Thank you!",DeiSuLou,,"We really appreciate you taking the time out to share your experience with us, DeiSuLou. We are doing our best for our consumers to have a great experience when using the app to enjoy both the food they ordered from our partner merchants and the convenience of delivering it right on their doorstep. For any concerns, please reach us via our Help Center or Social Media channels.",Fri Aug 20 2021 02:43:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7503506291,Fri Jun 25 2021 08:07:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Does not let me update my correct address,"I tried to update my home address multiple times. But it will not let me update! Every time I wanted to order food when I’m at home, it keeps pinning the neighbours address! I have to use another food delivery app!",Galai Maldita,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations, Galai. We are doing our best for our consumers to have a great experience when using the app to enjoy both the food they ordered from our partner merchants and the convenience of delivering it right on their doorstep. For any concerns, please reach us via our Help Center or Social Media channels. 🙂

",Fri Jul 23 2021 04:33:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7503165959,Fri Jun 25 2021 05:37:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,This app deduct your card automatically without getting a refund,"3 different orders where I got an automatic deduction on my card before a driver could confirm my food order. Three times my orders weren’t processed/confirmed but Grab deducted my card. I tried emailing two times on both separate instances, all I got was an automatic response explaining how paying with card works without any chance of me to respond and continue to explain the problem in the ticket. No live chat, it so hard to find the report option for issues like payments & refunds. Support is unclear and unhelpful, no response.",XIIIVIIG,,"We regret hearing about this. ☹ If the booking was tagged as 'Cancelled', the amount will be automatically refunded and will reflect on your account depending on your bank's policy.

Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.",Fri Jul 23 2021 04:32:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
