ios,ph,,7489795235,Mon Jun 21 2021 14:37:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Small Delivery Fee — i mean WHY??!,"For grab food orders, why is this necessary?
Isn’t the turn-around time for the drivers/restos quicker for small orders? Some drivers are accepting multiple orders so the app should’ve just assign small orders queue system instead of the customers. 🙄 I am happy to give tips to our drivers but puhlease Grab app, don’t be greedy. Very disappointing.",hachuuuls,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations. ☹ Fee is applied to compensate for the time, distance traveled, and effort they spend completing each order. We do this so that delivery-partners will continue to offer their services to consumers, especially during peak hours. 👍

