ios,ph,,7408892717,Mon May 31 2021 07:50:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Hassle Free❤️,"I love the how convenience this app is. Ordering food, book a car, delivery its so easy with this app. My only concern is that I wish you gave more coupon for bulk orders or orders 500 pesos and above. But all in all, I love this app.",j1s2s3s4,,"Thank you for your feedback, J1s2s3s4. 🙏 We are grateful that you took the time out to leave us a 5-Star review. Convenience and reliability are our main priorities for our consumers like you. 💚

