ios,ph,,7400699207,Sat May 29 2021 04:00:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Top up fails but bills you twice,"I tried to top up my grabpay credits with my cc and it says it failed. It asks me if I want to try again but I don’t as I’ve heard the app does this. The app says it failed to bill you but does, causing you to keep trying, causing you to send multiple top up requests. When I check my cc statement though, I was not only billed once but twice! This app’s top up process is a scam. Avoid at all cost.",Jannimals,,Hi! We regret hearing about this. ☹ Please reach out to us via the Help Centre or our social media platforms so that we can review your concern further and take action. Thank you.,Mon May 31 2021 02:53:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
