ios,ph,,7204876086,Sat Apr 10 2021 05:39:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Did not processed my refund,"I love the app. However, I tried to place an order and it got cancelled because the merchant is closed. I waited for 5days and they still haven't released my refund. I contacted their customer support and kept on telling me that it has been processed and to contact my bank. While chatting with an agent, I contacted my bank and the bank asked for the case number of the refund since they can't find the refund that was processed by grab. I asked grab to give me the case number but they weren't able to provide the case number. I asked for a supervisor multiple times but the agent consistently refused to give a supervisor.",Dnsgrg,,,,
