ios,ph,,7193218340,Wed Apr 07 2021 07:51:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,A suggestion that I hope this helps our drivers:,"A wonderful app indeed! Grab has everything I need and the drivers are amazing too!! But I hope you take this seriously for our dear drivers. I’m tired of hearing and crying over these news where the drivers are victimized of “fake” or “prank booking”, or wherein customers “canceled” their booking and drivers are crying because they already bought those things for their drivers. They worked late at night or even stayed late like 1:40 AM just to pick up a customer but got cancelled...

hoping to suggest for this app to not allow the “cancel” button anymore. Once booked, it’s booked. Customers should be extra careful right now when they are about to book or order something. Our drivers deserves respect too, not being treated to be “pranked” with. If this suggestion is too much/won’t help out with the app, please think of something that the hardworking drivers won’t experience this cruel pranks from fake customers. 

I hope you read this message and take actions to it. Thank you so much and have a blessed day!",urcouchpotatooi,,"Thank you for your feedback, urcouchpotatooi. We will continue to serve your essential needs the safest way possible. 💚

GrabFood system automatically disables the cancel option once delivery-partners have placed orders at the restaurant. As we continuously work to further protect our delivery-partners, we appeal to our consumers to use GrabFood responsibly -- be mindful of orders placed and the effort that our delivery-partners put in to deliver your orders. 

We really appreciate you looking out for them. Rest assured, we're continuously doing our best to improve our services for both consumers and partners ✨ Thank you very much for your concern!

Haven't tried GrabMart yet? It’s easier to do groceries thru the Grab app and we want you to try it out! 🙂 Use the promo code TARAGRABMART to enjoy free delivery for a minimum basket of PHP 300! ✨",Wed Jun 09 2021 07:13:06 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,7189866021,Tue Apr 06 2021 10:37:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,--,This is absolutely helpful especially in this time of pandemic,zlxlln,,,,
ios,ph,,7187845304,Mon Apr 05 2021 20:09:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Make your Grab Food app more secured,"There's a lot of instances wherein a prank can be done with your app. Unfortunately, someone gets in trouble because of it. 

Your Grab delivery should not have the COD option because it's letting fake orders from coming in and causing your own Grab drivers to be in big trouble. 

If you can't omit the option for COD, then at least make the order process more secured, such as not letting orders be made if the account is not fully verified by valid Government ID's. In that way, whoever is playing with these apps will be held accountable.",Sam Medriano,,,,
