ios,ph,,7183025385,Sun Apr 04 2021 14:49:04 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,ID Verification,"Hi Grab! The app is very very useful however, I can see that there’s a lot of riders getting scammed each day. They’re a victim of fake bookings especially Grabfood riders. If you can please request a valid ID upon registration and then having it verified, that would be a great help. By doing that you can prevent people from using fake names and addresses. Hoping that you’ll read my review and an action will be taken. Regardless, The app is very useful!",ZxcNicole029,,,,
