ios,ph,,6854310068,Sun Jan 10 2021 19:28:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab food review,"Love the app because it’s convenient to just get a car from ur place specially if you are in a subdivision far from the main road, but Grab food should put a review for the restaurants we get our food from. They always get away with their food being not properly cooked and the drivers are rude. Mostly, Grab put up their prices really high whether it’s the car hailing service, or the food, specially the food. In my old place, they only put the food ten pesos higher than the regular price at the restaurant. Now, i came back to Philippines and there’s a charge for small delivery which is 30 pesos, plus the delivery is really expensive most of the time, if u want the grab to give u discount it should be 500 pesos or higher. Which is totally unfair given sometimes the restaurants are like less than a kilometer away from my place. Also the price for the transportation became really price since they bought Uber. 😕 so unfair.",foyfiyfoyxlhflh,,"We are sorry that we did not meet your expectations. ☹  

We are doing our best for our consumers to have a great experience when using the app, to serve their essential needs, to enjoy both the food they ordered from our partner merchants and the convenience of delivering it right on their doorstep. We strive to partner with the highest quality restaurants to meet your expectations. The small order fee is applied to compensate for the time, distance traveled, and effort our riders spend completing each order. We do this so that delivery-partners will continue to offer their services to consumers, especially during peak hours.

Also, our GrabCar fare would generally depend on the distance between the pick-up and drop off points, as well as the surge and supply/demand during the time of booking. 

We hope this clear things up. For any concerns, please reach us via our Help Center or Social Media channels. ",Tue Jul 27 2021 10:49:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,6852976262,Sun Jan 10 2021 12:28:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,NOT WORTHY!!!,They put so much vouchers that does not work!! So done with this app never again the restaurants menu are not updated realtime and they got mistakes orders all the freakin time!!!,FckGrab,,,,
