ios,ph,,6803265605,Mon Dec 28 2020 14:50:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Horrible Service!!!,"1. They charge you upon ordering/booking even when it hasn't been processed yet. So if the store/app/no driver if found you will still be charged. So when your re book, another payment will be processed on your card. Refund takes forever to come! 

