ios,ph,,6532803953,Wed Oct 14 2020 02:59:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,RENT A CAR,"When renting a car, instead of informing that the drivers are busy and to try it again, put it on a queue instead. It is so frustrating to click got it then schedule a ride again. A window saying “we’re still waiting for an available driver” and then just have an option for cancelling it instead of having the customer click buttons all the time. At least, if we waited for too long, it’s up to us if we wanted to wait for few minutes or just cancel it.",Andbfklanshxks,,,,
ios,ph,,6530172393,Tue Oct 13 2020 09:31:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Great app but absolutely needs some improvements,"Hi! I agree with the other review on adding a save draft feature. Also, I would like to suggest to add an option for us on Grab Food or Grab Delivery for those who has Grab Box/ insulator box. I sometimes book using Grab Delivery since I already bought the food and all I need is someone to pick up the items but most of the time riders doesn’t have the box. This happened to me a lot and I had no choice but to rebook. Kindly provide grab box for your riders for free. Also, recently, I’ve encountered rude riders when I selected the “pabili service”. They often tell me to contact the stores and do the things that they should’ve done. I understand that it saves time but there is a reason why I chose pabili service, coz I can’t contact the store so I need someone to go there and do it for me. But they are a bit rude and doesn’t have patience to do pabili service. I hope you improve on that. Thanks!",pizzamistah,,,,
ios,ph,,6519964321,Sat Oct 10 2020 10:35:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Rewards,Worst Reward System Ever! Missed the old Grab Rewards. There no more use for Grab Rewards. Been a user for 6yrs and this is the probably the worst thing happen to Grab. I love grab so much but this is really disappointing.,mawoonn,,,,
ios,ph,,6517668997,Fri Oct 09 2020 17:40:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Missing App options! Like “FOOD” option,How am I going to use this for ordering food if there is no available “food” option? There are other options missing too! Like the “car” option! It is practically useless! Fix this!,cebu citizen,,,,
ios,ph,,6513677137,Thu Oct 08 2020 14:18:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,"About the ""Passenger Timeout""","I've always love this app, it's very convenient and great. But i had this issue about the ""timeouts"" that I didn't know about, I was gonna book a ride and I had cancel many times because the drivers were too far from me and I was in a hurry, I was trying to find drivers near and the closest to me. But at the third time I cancelled, the app put my account into a temporarily suspension for 24h and for that, I couldn't book a ride. It was devastating, frustrating and stressful, because I freaking had an appointment to go to and had no other choice of transportation but Grab. I wished that the app would have notify me or warned me about the remaining chances of cancellation,that I didn't know about, until now. I mean what if I was in an emergency and desperately needed a ride? I hope you guys work this out and notice this so this wouldn't happen again. And put a solution into this issue.",Lea IGN,,"We're sorry you had to experience this, Lea. Successive cancellation may trigger an account for lockout. Kindly be advised to avoid canceling a booking. 🙂 For any concerns, please reach us via our Help Center or Social Media channels.",Tue Jul 27 2021 10:54:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,6510974837,Wed Oct 07 2020 18:18:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,GrabRewards Points Validity Recent Policy Changes,"Now that cashless transactions are encouraged due to pandemic, I don’t see any reason why usual GrabCar transactions using credit card no longer earn you points given the fact that you are being charged more compared to when using GrabPay. And why did they shorten the time of expiration to 3 months? Customers accumulated these points so it shouldn’t expire as long as they patronize the service. The government should look into this recent change and hopefully apply the rationale on gift certificates.",ChazRamos,,,,
ios,ph,,6509698858,Wed Oct 07 2020 11:07:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Hello.,"Bakit walang grab car option yung app ko? Pang food, delivery and grab pay lang. Whyyy po",Krljy,,,,
ios,ph,,6506082999,Tue Oct 06 2020 10:09:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Charging Issues and Point System,"Heavily using GRAB since June 2020 and all is well except sometimes, taxi drivers don't know how to properly charge. Instead of basing it on metered fare + booking fee, they're basing it on quoted fare + booking fee. I know it can always be disputed but to avoid hassles on the part of the customer, driver, and the GRAB management, better training is, I think, needed for your drivers.
Also, the point system should be developed. Like what I've mentioned, GRAB is my only way of transportation ever since June 2020 and everyday, I spend Php200 to Php250 for it. But my accumulated points is still not more than 30! I hope you can have a better way of giving back to your patrons.",eastseajewel,,,,
ios,ph,,6505495416,Tue Oct 06 2020 05:37:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Grab Food - DELIVERY,"I was just aware now that the deliveries are “grouped” to “make deliveries efficient”. 
I cannot agree more. BUT pls make your customers aware of it. Location-wise etc. or before they book the food delivery. Not all foods are good when in transit for so long. 

Also sometimes the food of the customer who receives their order last can get dislodged, spilled etc while in transit. Hence it can result in angry and aggressive customers. It can also make customers rate the rider very poorly. And no one wants to do that. 

The app informed me I’ll receive my order from 1:35-1:50pm ... then I checked on it and I’ll get by 1:45-2:00pm. Now this is inefficient especially that we also have meetings at home. & have no one to pick it up from the gate becuz I live alone. Don’t give us false hope. :)",Banker_2,,,,
ios,ph,,6499445222,Sun Oct 04 2020 12:35:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Grab food multiple booking 👎🏻,"Use to love grab food because it’s fast and easy. But when u let the multiple bookings for food delivery, the use be 20 min delivery of the same resto became 50min to 1 hour, reasons? They have multiple bookings that came along.",gelaaaaaaaaMo,,,,
