ios,ph,,6065404096,Fri Jun 12 2020 03:47:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,AutoDebited,"Just want to share my experience with this app. I just tried registering my debit card in hopes that it will be a smooth transaction. But it turned out that it is not available in our country yet. Then I checked my balance with my registered account, I was debited with 50 pesos. I know it was not that much but what is that 50 pesos auto debited for? registration fee? but it was said that its not available in the philippines so why my account was debited if that is for registration fee or what? GUYS LESSON LEARNED, JUST USE CASH BASIS FOR DELIVERY. WE DONT KNOW WHAT ELSE THIS APP IS DOING WITH OUR ACCOUNT. EVERY PENNY COUNTS SO BE AWARE OF YOUR TRANSACTIONS. I WAS SO DISAPPOINTED WITH THIS APP! FOODPANDA IS WAY MORE BETTER!!!",Idnwywjsgd,,,,
