ios,ph,,5710107459,Wed Mar 25 2020 08:27:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Feedback regarding Grabfood portion,"Hi Grab,

I’m writing to let your company know that I love the app. I often use it. In fact, it’s my main transportation option to get to everywhere I need to go because it’s always convenient.

Now, this is regarding the grabfood portion of this app. I usually prefer to go out and eat at an actual restaurant, but because of the newly implemented enhanced community quarantine, I’ll have to rely on getting my food delivered to my house. I ordered through grabfood and was successfully assigned a rider to pick up the food I ordered but when he got there, the restaurant was closed. It would help us customers and your riders if you could coordinate with the restaurants to know when they’re open and when they’re closed. 

I know this isn’t impossible as your competitor company shows this in their app. It would save us customers and your riders a lot of time and gas too.

I wish you the best!
Thank you.",joymeedevs_,,,,
