ios,ph,,5634460481,Sun Mar 08 2020 22:31:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Unfair Fare,"I use Grab on a daily basis, and because of this, I've reached Platinum membership. It often takes me 10-30 minutes to book a Grab, so I become late. 

If the system notices you really need to book, it bumps up the fare. For example, you're booking to somewhere about 8.5KM away, it's around 350 in the early morning. Drivers won't accept you, and after about 4-5 attempts, the price goes up to 470+. However, if you change your drop off to somewhere about 9KM away, the fare goes back to its original 350+.",czeskar111,,,,
ios,ph,,5632680482,Sun Mar 08 2020 12:55:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,The convenient ride,"Getting a ride in the most convenient way without much hassle & riding on clean, new cars with respectful, amiable & trusted drivers that will make your travel around the metro safe & secure. Thank you!",harlie capsj,,,,
