ios,ph,,5565800636,Sat Feb 22 2020 14:25:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,No choice,"I downloaded this app because I don’t have a choice since Uber is gone. 
I’m not a very picky person but I need this type of transportation because I have injuries in my knees, almost everyday going to school and going home I used this app, most of the time the driver I’ve encountered is very moody or head strong and when sometimes there’s a difficulty in my location I hear a lot of complaints from them. I hope you screen your drivers really good because your fare is really high even the drive is only 15 minutes away from my home. I know driving anywhere here in Manila is stressful but I learned that it can be lessened when the driver is good and has patience. 
