ios,ph,,5506010440,Sun Feb 09 2020 01:17:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Same taxi system scheme,"Some drivers that are working for grab would refuse to take you when your destination is too far, a center of traffic, or a place without many people who book for grab. They would even request an add up?? Why is that system still allowed in this company. We can’t even rate the driver because the transaction has not pushed through because they would ask us to cancel. After that we will suffer from the cancellation penalty of not being able to book for 24 hrs!! How absurd. Screen your drivers. We do not feel safe anymore.",Grunt961,,,,
