ios,ph,,5489564727,Wed Feb 05 2020 05:15:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Had an issue with multiple orders,"Hi, I just wanted to comment on the multiple orders function. I had ordered from a restaurant but cancelled because I needed to add another item. So I ordered again from the same restaurant with the additional item. However, I did not know that my first order wasn’t cancelled properly, and now I ended up with double orders and paying twice... I wasn’t notified about the first order still existing. 

I’d like to suggest a change to the interface?: Add a pop up confirmation to separate additional orders, because I did not receive one. And also add the additional orders in the sticky “in transit” bar because in my app it was only the latest order, so i didn’t know the first order was also still active. If these already exist, it did not happen in my app ;-;",obscure_tree,,,,
