ios,ph,,5443385925,Fri Jan 24 2020 16:35:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Equalizer,"In the midst of many transportation options in unfamiliar SEA countries where tourist are subject to haggling with drivers who sometimes take advantage—which often makes travel stressful—grab is a breath of fresh air. We toured SEA countries for our honeymoon, and thanks to grab, our commute has been a lot more safe, convenient and reasonable in terms of price.",zxcvbenson,,,,
ios,ph,,5441593054,Fri Jan 24 2020 06:42:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Inconvenient update,"My order shows in the history but when I tap on it it routes me back to pick a restaurant. It makes it impossible for me to contact my rider and to coordinate the pickup. Please fix.

Edit: I’ve booked a car to get to work but the driver wasn’t moving and didn’t reply to my messages. When I called him he said he needed to change his tire. I get it, but why did he accept my booking if he was gonna take a while? 

To top it off, I had to cancel the ride because I needed to get to work immediately, which would have been a detriment to my account when booking in the future.

And THEN Grab decided to interrupt me booking by asking for my picture. I was able to book literally a few minutes before but now I can’t unless I go through a few extra steps? Okay. Overpriced with impeccable timing.",monicalokka,,,,
