ios,ph,,5361896932,Sun Jan 05 2020 00:15:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Too expensive,"It's very convenient but TOO EXPENSIVE. Especially if the place is 7-10 minutes away. Grab wasn't always like this. It's really bot fair to be honest. Also, evwry grab driver seems to just do grabshare and not grabcar. What if we were more than two people? It's not better than those taxi drivers soliciting the meter for more money. Ugh.",danitheimpaler,,"We understand your frustrations, Dani 😞 Please note that the surge is highly due to increased demand and limited drivers in your area. Rest assured we're doing our best to add more drivers on the road 💚 If you have concerns, feel free to reach us via https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/ ",Tue Jan 07 2020 06:17:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
