ios,ph,,5353403588,Fri Jan 03 2020 02:11:20 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Unnecessary updates,"You guys updated the app with this annoying new feature, users can't see where the driver (grab food) is, wether where his or if he is on the requested place already.",Brown_Geralt,,"Hi there!To improve your waiting experience, we have revamped the screens to show the info that matters most. You will see the map when driver is on the way to you for the delivery 💚 But thank you for your feedback! We'll definitely keep that in mind :)",Tue Jan 07 2020 06:21:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5351769297,Thu Jan 02 2020 16:41:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Inconvenient. Bring back uber.,"I cancelled a booking from a specific driver because he wasn’t responding and not moving from his location, it has been 5 mins. I need to go to work. I rebooked and got the same driver and I waited... but still the same. Not moving from his location, i kept contacting but no response.",Feyruh,,Hey Feyruh! We're really sorry for this experience :( Can you let us know more about this so we can take a look? You may refer to this for more information: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115009195067-My-driver-didnt-show-up ,Tue Jan 07 2020 06:23:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5351469839,Thu Jan 02 2020 15:12:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,It was almost GREAT but it MESSED UP,"Hi Development Team and Stake Holders,

I don’t know how to get your attention but hopefully this review does you well. 

I’ll be completely honest, I used to love your app to the event that I use it everyday for transportation and even reach high level of membership and get exclusive perks. It was nice when I’m doing cash transactions, however it’s a completely different story when using cashless transactions. 

Let’s be honest here, we both know that your so called “hassle free” payment brings more hassle to us consumers since it’s very faulty. 

I have transactions that were cancelled which my card charged and never got a refund, not to mention this occurs most of the time I do card transactions. Isn’t it enough that you charge overpriced fares, why do you have to steal money from consumers by providing a faulty payment system. I submitted multiple reports to my card provider and they say that they are waiting on your end. 

Next, your premium wallet. I don’t know what type of document do you need. I provided my Google Payslip, Official Billing Receipts from Subscriptions I had, Official Government IDs. What? Do we need to apply for a Postpaid Plan and get the billing statement by snail mail so we can meet your needs. 

Seriously, you been busy launching new features to the extent that you people been missing out in polishing this app, several bugs are appearing, and they are growing. It’s up to you people if you don’t address this issue and just turn a blind eye. 

Oh yes, not to mention that the most of the high ratings you people receive are from your fellow employees. 

NOW FOR ALL OF YOU FELLOW USERS LIKE ME

even though honestly it’s a nice app, I recommend using cash for your transactions with this app. It’s unstable.",lightningowlofficial,,"Hi there! First of, thank you very much for taking time to provide us with insightful feedback. This will be of great help for us to improve our services and serve you better. As for the type of documentation accepted, you may refer to this link for easier reference: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360023805331 💚 Again, thank you very much! If you need help with anything else, please feel free to reach us through our social media sites or our hotline at 8883-7117.",Tue Jan 07 2020 07:02:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5350756096,Thu Jan 02 2020 11:26:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Lrt incident,After losing the lrt the day itself Grab decided to remove my student discount when i really needed it the most and the expiration date was on December. Also they’re always pricey.,Magi843,,Hey there! We're so sorry this has happened :( Hope you can tell us your registered account details so that we can check. Please message us via https://www.facebook.com/grabph 💚,Tue Jan 07 2020 06:34:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5346869906,Wed Jan 01 2020 13:44:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Year 2020,"I should thank for having this app. But the surges are absurd! Early morning around 3am, there are surges?? Really?? Or you are just trying to get drivers to be in my location. There are many drivers, low passengers but the surges are way high! Sky high!!!!!",DocLouie222,,Hi! Please note that the surge is highly due to limited drivers in your area. that accommodate the service type you prefer.  Rest assured we're doing our best to add more drivers 😊 Thank you for your patience 💚,Tue Jan 07 2020 06:38:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
