ios,ph,,5337460258,Mon Dec 30 2019 06:17:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Worst Drivers,App is fine but your drivers are the worst.,Papoonzy,,Hi Cyndie! We're sorry if you ever had a negative experience with our partner-drivers :( Please tell us more so we can look into it! Feel free to send a report here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/115001244167-Transport,Tue Jan 07 2020 06:43:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5335404375,Sun Dec 29 2019 17:30:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Grab Food disadvantages,"grab food is very convenient although after the transaction you wouldn’t be able to contact the driver if ever you have a missing order for them to fetch it for you. I have a lot of books that have missing orders, five times actually and the only two that I got my missing order  is when the grab driver actually called me so his number was saved on my phone and the second time is when I have to actually go to the store itself to come and fetch it for myself. PLS UPDATE YOUR GRAB FOOD SYSTEM WHERE THE CUSTOMER CAN CONTACT THEIR DRIVER AFTER THE TRANSACTION. we are not obliged to check our orders when we get them because it’s their  job to check it in the store before they bring it to us.",manalkharboutlli,,"We feel you! Unsatisfied cravings are the worst :( But thank you for your feedback. We'll keep this in mind for future updates! Meanwhile, if you ever have a missing order, allow us to help you sort it out. You may learn more here: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360037313111-I-have-a-missing-or-incorrect-order",Tue Jan 07 2020 06:44:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
