ios,ph,,5255344128,Tue Dec 10 2019 10:32:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Terrible update.,I don’t know why I can’t see where the rider is anymore when I use the Grab Food app. Now I can’t decide whether to cancel or proceed cos I’ve no idea how long the rider will take to reach the restaurant! Terrible.,Furikake.toppings,,"Hi Mrs. Allenby! Because of the revamp of the interface, you will only see the map when your food is on its way to you. But no worries! You should still be able to see a time estimate of your rider's progress on its way to the restaurant :) Also, please refrain from cancelling as you might be temporarily unable to book if you cancel too many times :(",Wed Dec 11 2019 03:07:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
