ios,ph,,5248901240,Sun Dec 08 2019 15:43:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,What happened to Grab Hub?,"I would’ve rated it 4 stars if they didn’t get rid of the Grab Hub! Grab Hub has been very useful to process my business ride reimbursements! I can easily select the dates covered and download it on a csv/excel format or pdf format. I can also edit my tags for rides if I missed to tag one as business or personal. Now they can only send you statements for a month’s worth of rides which doesn’t give you the freedom to download anytime or select the dates covered, not to mention you can only edit the tags on the mobile app itself which is a hassle! Please bring back grab hub pls!!!

Now why not 5 stars? That’s for less points earned for every ride now compared to when they first started. Also, the prices are ridiculously high! I wonder how much percentage they get for each ride. If there’s another cheaper alternative, I would’ve chosen that without hesitation even without the additional perks, promos, etc.",MyNickNameIsTaken!!!,,"We hear you, Nick! Don't worry, we're doing our best to provide you with more ways to recover your trip receipts. You may also opt to enroll for a business profile to help you with it :) You can see this for more info: https://www.grab.com/ph/business-blog/business-news/business-profile/ 💚 ]Please also note that our prices are regulated by LTFRB. Lastly, the revamped Rewards matrix will help you earn more points via more means too :) Learn more here: https://www.grab.com/ph/rewards/ Thank you!",Wed Dec 11 2019 03:00:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5247894845,Sun Dec 08 2019 10:34:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,The Diablos Made This App!,"We need to crowdfund a startup with the sole purpose of creating an app that destroys Grab’s overcharging, money hungry, boring business model and app out of the Philippines right about now! So sick of this app!",Carmen281991,,"Hi Carmen, please note that our prices are regulated by LTFRB. We're continuously doing our best to provide better services and improve your overall experience :) Thank you for your patience 💚",Wed Dec 11 2019 02:56:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5246856179,Sun Dec 08 2019 03:59:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,crp,"today i was about to order but then the app keeps on crashing and the home screen can't even load properly!!! and i can't see the menus in the food and it won't let me checkout the food and it keeps on saying ""something is wrong"" i restarted my phone,wifi,everything shts nothing really happened!!!!!!
Fix this please!",henaood,,Hi there! We're so sorry for this slight error :( Please try uninstalling and reinstalling the app. Should be working fine now! Thank you for your patience 💚,Wed Dec 11 2019 02:47:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5246593117,Sun Dec 08 2019 02:29:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Grab must inform passenger in case the fee is already paid thru creditcard.,"I had experienced this incident TWICE.
We requested for grab on our way to Pagibig Fund in Caloocan,  my daughter forgot that she used her charged creditcard when she called for grab but the grab driver just accepted our payment in cash not telling that it was already paid thru creditcard.

Last Friday, I went to Waltermart North Edsa Munoz and booked a grab, i again paid in cash plus tip but the driver did not inform me that it was already paid thru my creditcard. He just accepted my cash payment, when I got home i received a text message from my creditcard “thank you for using your creditcard in grab”...

This is so dissapointing, GRAB DRIVERS must tell their passengers that the grab fee is already PAID thru creditcard! And if the passenger insisted in giving that can be considered as a TIP!!!!

Please inform your GRAB DRIVERS not to ABUSE passengers who forgot that they already paid thru Creditcard and pretend that it is only a TIP Becoz nobody in the philippines will give TIP the same as the Grab fee....",Mrs Pedroso,,"Hi Mrs. Pedroso! We're sorry to hear about this experience :( Please allow us to help you get this sorted out. You may check this link for more details on how to submit your report: https://help.grab.com/passenger/en-ph/360001916608-I-paid-cash-for-a-GrabPay-ride 💚 Moving forward, please always double check your payment method upon booking to avoid delays in future trips. Thank you!",Wed Dec 11 2019 02:42:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
ios,ph,,5244561858,Sat Dec 07 2019 14:52:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Okay,"I really do hope you treat your Grab drivers and delivery guys as good as you treat your customers. Also, still very overpriced.",Haiuoyouuu,,Hi! Rest assured that we treat our partner riders and drivers fairly and that we're continuously improving our programmes for them 💚 Thank you for looking out for our hardworking partners!,Wed Dec 11 2019 02:39:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
