ios,ph,,5220528641,Sun Dec 01 2019 11:19:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,They’ve Gone Worse,"I ordered grab food and they deducted my bank account but the app said it payment is unsuccessful and that the cashless payment is disabled. They then require me to pay again to enable my cashless payment which they did so without my permission. Now I have been charged twice that is worth 18MYR. After a week, similar thing happened on booking a ride, this time is worth 12MYR. And again, I am charged twice to enable my cashless payment.  They’re charging they’re customers due to their own bug. The customers should not bear the burden out of their own bug. This is so annoying.",bars676,,"Hey there, we're sorry for this experience :( We've alerted our partners regarding this. Can you send them a message via https://www.facebook.com/GrabMY/?brand_redir=227603327439951 Thank you for your patience 💚",Wed Dec 04 2019 07:04:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),
