ios,ph,,5068934286,Sat Nov 02 2019 08:58:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Resource-intensive; really slow on older phones,"I wrote a review a while back saying that the app had become badly bloated. The app thankfully improved after that, but unfortunately became even harder to use a few months later. Simply switching from a different app back to Grab causes it to crash. So does waking the screen after locking the phone while Grab is active. The worst part is that restarting Grab unnecessarily takes long. I’ve recently switched to an iPhone 11 and Grab runs fine, but it’s painfully obvious now that it’s no longer optimized to run on older phones. Not everybody uses every single feature Grab offers; please consider releasing a lighter version of the app.",Coolside28,,,,
