ios,ph,,4946600674,Mon Oct 14 2019 14:38:06 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Your grabpay is a scam,"I recently booked a grabcar which cost Php115 and forgot to switch back my payment method to cash. The driver was too far away so I cancelled the ride. When I checked my BDO cash card, I was surprised that the Php115 was deducted.
I talked to your CSR and said the amount will be refunded within 24hrs and it’s been 2 days until now there is no refund. I already told many times that I cancelled my booking and I was not aware that grabpay deducted the money from my cash card. I already e-mailed the screenshot booking ID and the account details of my cash card which I can only provide but you’re still asking for bank statement. I called the bank CSR and told me that I have to pay Php50 for a bank statement of the cash card because it’s only a prepaid account and that is already costing me a lot just to earn my money back. I will never ever use grabpay again, it’s a very bad experience for me. I SUGGEST THAT YOU CHANGE THIS GRABPAY’S WAY OF TRANSACTION. AUTOMATIC DEDUCTION SHOULD BE DONE WHEN THE PASSENGER IS ALREADY ON BOARD, NOT DURING BOOKING A RIDE.",Acid Eyes,,,,
