ios,ph,,4546909072,Wed Jul 31 2019 17:20:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Update on Grab Food Delivery,"One night, i was really hungry but i was too tired to actually go out and order at the nearest fast food which is about 0.3km. I ordered on Grab Food, but one of my orders was out of stock, so the rider and i had to compromise. It was so inconvenient since we couldnt change what was in the order receipt stated in the app. He arrived 30mins more than the estimated time of arrival which is just about 21-23mins of delivery time. I even dozed off while waiting because it was in the wee hours in the morning. It seemed that the driver got lost and the app pinned my location so far from my actual address. He took more than an hour to deliver, which was a lot of trouble for the both of us. Another conflict was that my prior order was worth 261pesos, but since we compromised due to the product’s unavailability, it became 157pesos only. Yet, he wants me to pay 261pesos because that is what the app says. Good thing he was also considerate that we agreed to meet half way. Change this! App developer, please take heed of the lapses. It does not bring convenience, rather conflict.",Argh Jay,,,,
