ios,ph,,4440875089,Thu Jul 11 2019 02:20:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Of good service and glitches,"A regular, almost daily user of Grab, I find it convenient to use. There are some drivers and cars that leave much to be desired but overall I like using Grab Car. I especially like GrabFood which is fast and efficient. Just 3 vital feedback points however—
1.  The message “button” to reply to the driver is too small that when I tap it, the driver’s profile keeps popping up. It takes several attempts before I finally get the message page. 
2. Many times the map shows the car at a standstill. Then after a few minutes the car icon jumps to the pick-up point. 
3. Menu prices of SUNBURST should be updated. 
I hope these glitches can be fixed. Meanwhile, I’ll keep riding and keep ordering. Thank you!",momofmultitudes,,,,
