ios,ph,,4102927313,Sun May 05 2019 07:06:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Suggestion for enhancement,"This is for the GrabCarShare feature...when a customer books a shared car, he is asked how many seats. One driver related to me how some Grabshare users book more seats than what is actual, say they book 2 or more seats even if they are alone, so that the ride becomes exclusive to them. I think this not fair to the drivers because they won’t be able to book other passengers anymore in that trip. If the app can be enhanced to give the drivers a way to confirm the actual seats reserved by a booking passenger, then maybe it becomes fairer for everyone. For your consideration.",ConcernedLang,,,,
