ios,ph,,3914868446,Sat Mar 23 2019 04:45:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,GrabShare Routes,"Difficult to get bookings for GrabCar, and GrabShare is really terrible because most of the rides are off-route. Shouldn’t share rides be along the way with around 2-3km deviation? I get share rides from Makati with initial drop off at Pasay even though my drop-off is Taguig, adding almost an hour to the total ride. I’ve also experienced a ride wherein I’m only 2km away from my drop off (the total distance is 8km) but had to go back around 1km from my pick-up point for another rider. There is seriously
 a problem with the algorithm by which grab matches its share rides. I’m ok with share rides considering the passenger-kilometer ratio and lower fares, of course, but sometimes it becomes more of a hassle than using mass transportation. I’m pretty sure even your grab drivers/partners are annoyed with this system where the fuel and time spent is just equal to (or greater than) two separate rides but for a lower rate.",yashizubara,,,,
