ios,ph,,3851335539,Thu Mar 07 2019 02:34:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Update Listing of Establishment,"Hi Grab Team.

Can you change the name of Habubus Food Place into Habibi’s Diner?  

Habubus has been out of business since March 2018 and my resto Habibi’s Diner has taken over since then. 

It is registered with the Municipal Office  of Marikina City and a legitimate establishment with required government offices and your Grab map is not even showing it. Location is GF Commercial Unit 7
Barcelona Tower, Marquinton Residences, Cirma Street, Sumulong Highway, Sto. Niño, Marikina City.

It is confusing customers who hail Grab cars from the Habibi’s Diner resto and your drivers we use to deliver our meals. They cannot locate it on the Grab map.

Please update your map and records. Quick action please.
Thanks!

Victoria Chua
Proprietor, Habibi’s Diner",Voinky,,,,
