ios,ph,,3776924275,Sat Feb 16 2019 15:14:15 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Change the charging manner for prepaid/denit cards,"I use a prepaid/debit card for Grab. Please change the charging manner from booking to when a Grab driver accepts the booking. Many times I am not able to get Grabcar & have to resort to upgrading to Premium BUT I can't because my card has already been deducted during booking. AND if I end up not using Grab, my funds still take days to be returned. PLEASE change the charging that when a Grab driver ACCEPTS the booking, not during booking or while waiting for a Grab driver to accept the booking. It is very INCONVENIENT to have to rush to put additional funds into my card just to upgrade my ride ( because there is no Grabcar available).",JPE2005,,,,
