ios,ph,,3679351841,Tue Jan 22 2019 00:03:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Literally the worst transport,"Ive been using this app for quite awhile but it never matched up to UBER (rip), i have my reasons, 1 uber drivers are so much nicer and often accepts bookings no matter how near or far the location may be because it is their jon to do so, grab drivers, however DECLINE! They decline a booking if they see the location and dont like it, most booking take 30mins-1h uhm?? Hello?? People have somewhere to be! Drivers are also often RUDE, i’ve had a couple of rides wherein the driver is mad or isnt in a good mood or just mean. I came from a football game once and i had asked to be picked up from the venue, My Pin was slightly off but it was the closest one grab had from where i am, so i asked the driver if he can kindly pick me up from where i was from which was like 20 meters south of where my pin was, and he literally said “thats not my problem” so i said oh okay i’ll walk to you, Literally after 3 mins the driver sent me another message “Hello, can you please hurry” so i started running (mind you i was from the field and this field is huge since its where multiple football games are held, so i was about 100m away from the road) and when i got in the car he told me to not lean back on the seats cause i was sweaty and the seat might get dirty?? Honestly this app doesnt even deserves stars. We all just want uber back, Worst transport ever!!!",cuishy1234,,,,
ios,ph,,3669038512,Sat Jan 19 2019 12:45:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,OVRRPRICED,This company is overcharging commuters especially during the holidays and are obviously advantage of the fact that uber already withdrew operations here in the Philippines and they are monopolozing the business. They should be regulated by the LTFRB. Fare from airport to QC of 600php? That is like an regular worker's 8hour pay for the whole day already. They should be more considerate.,lulunana,,,,
