ios,ph,,3547295315,Wed Dec 19 2018 06:10:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Been a Grab fan before,"I liked the service of Grab before but now it’s starting to get crappy. For a week, I wasn’t able to book Grab properly. The waiting time for a ride is 45-1 hr and 30 mins before you get booked. It made me late for a couple of times in my appointments.

I have loved it before but they have a crappy service. I don’t know if it’s because they try to hog all the customers in Manila but it’s not working because they don’t enough drivers to accommodate the demand and population in the area. Also, because of this prices have risen at its max every time of the day.

Fortunately, ANGKAS was there to save my life especially when I can’t even book a ride home at 11PM.",eve the sophisticated,,,,
