ios,ph,,3500736351,Thu Dec 06 2018 17:30:50 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,THE WORST!!!!,"I’ve been using grab for months after the Uber was disbanded and I have experienced different situations while using this cab hailing system. Some drivers would accept your booking immediately but would take you more than 10 minutes to wait for the grab to arrive despite prompting a 2-minute waiting time. Also, I hope the management of grab will screen its drivers. There are drivers who are accommodating and friendly however there are plenty of ill-mannered drivers in your company. It defeats the purpose of having a safe ride towards your destination since the whole car ride is uncomfortable and based on my experience, I felt unsafe. Like it made me feel that it would be better to jump out of the car rather than continuing the ride. MORE IMPORTANTLY PLEASE FIX YOUR MAP SYSTEM!!!! I have pinned the right and exact destination but your map would indicate a different name of the place. Drivers sometimes are wary and would cancel my booking once I point out about the mistake on your map system. Please do something about it. Be better. I was supposed to be your avid costumer but after my recent ride, I don’t know. Please don’t just think of how much income the company gets, do consider the welfare of your consumer and the kind of service you’re providing. Thank you.",not so happy passenger,,,,
