ios,ph,,3427214766,Sat Nov 17 2018 07:44:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Overpriced. There should be a student rate.,"As a student, the service is overpriced and there's isn't a guarantee that a grab driver will accept your booking especially in rush hours and in rural places. Of course when I was in a hurry to go somewhere, I had to book and wait for a driver. Then the driver asks if you want to go to a faster route; you say yes because again, you ARE in a hurry. The original price was too much already then the driver asks you for additional charges for tollgate fees. That's way too much money for a student. I suggest for Grab to have a student rate; say 20% to 30% discounts. Verify real students by including a feature in your app for uploading student identification which drivers can verify upon pickup.",NOELLETANJU,,,,
