ios,ph,,3018819664,Sun Aug 05 2018 02:21:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Overpriced and no relevant promos,"Ever since Uber has left, Grab prices have soared. They may deny it but it’s very very evident. There are no relevant promos either. It’s always Grab Express promos. Who the heck needs delivery that often?? We want regular promos because that’s what we need. It’s been months since I was able to see a notification about a ride promo. I don’t feel the difference between being a regular customer to a Gold and Platinum ones. There’s no freakin difference. You can’t book anyone when you need it the most even though you’re a Platinum customer, which defeats the purpose of being Platinum. Access to best promos? Best Grab Express promos that is. Promos that you never use. We use grab for riding to places. Not for deliveries!! Please improve your service. I also found out from one of the drivers that Grab has stopped giving out incentives to drivers. Is it because drivers won’t have anywhere else to turn to? Way to go for the greed Grab.",JCNaf,,,,
