ios,ph,,2969904530,Thu Jul 26 2018 03:37:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,it’s been a year,"when it comes to your cancers, they have the slowest support. I’ve been having issues with double pay, and going cashless because apparently, one of my payments were declined on my card. as I try to resolve this last year, they kept asking me to wait patiently— after that call was made they told me that my grab pay would be used after a month, so I waited for an update but still, nothing. I don’t even get why they use reference numbers. they’re not doing anything. and then last night I tried the top up, but saw that I won’t be able to use it. I’ve been complaining and complaining but nothings has been resolved, if my top up can’t be used today, I hope you refund the non refundable. it’s been a year still no update. cancelling drivers are also a problem.",I wont be patient no more,,,,
