ios,ph,,2920331320,Tue Jul 17 2018 02:45:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"Unreliable, overpriced and slow","Here in the Philippines, it's practically impossible to book a ride. It'll take you at least 30 mins, most probably more, to book a ride. You'll probably spend more time trying to book than the actual trip. The price is also outrageous, easily twice, three times or even more the price of a grab ride compared to a taxi. It was good at the beginning when Uber was their competition, but now it's just plain ridiculous how terrible the service is. The full screen banner whenever you open the app is also annoying, it's the only app where you'll pay a lot but still get the most obnoxious advertisement everytime.",RayDC09,,,,
