ios,ph,,2792772426,Fri Jun 29 2018 03:30:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,What once was efficient and fast is now SLOW and a hassle,"I used to book a grab a lot. There were lots of drivers, and the fare was not that expensive. Now, the fare is SUPER EXPENSIVE! After they bought Uber out they decided to raise the price and lessen the number of drivers! You have to book at least 30 mins in advance before your driver arrives, and super super mahal na siya!! The mall near my house is about 10-15 mins away, but grab decides to charge me 200 pesos for the short trip!! Anong kalokohan to? I wish Uber was still available, super hassle na ng grab, and overcharge you unlike before. 👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻",Asldibs,,,,
