ios,ph,,2776032227,Tue Jun 26 2018 18:27:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Driver Too Far Away,"I am always being assigned to a driver too far away from my location. I had to cancel because it is too much effort for the driver. You might want to improve on that part. I have never had so much cancells. Just recently when Uber was gone. This is seriously stressful because I had to wait for the driver.. and when the driver arrives, the driver would comment ‘your place is too far’, ‘i travelled far from here’. I am always being blamed for living inside a subdivision. And since I had so much cancel’s, I am now having difficulty booking because I am least prioritized.",iamkatieey,,,,
ios,ph,,2771310342,Tue Jun 26 2018 04:52:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Tip must have Points,"Tip given to driver must have points too.
