ios,ph,,2444070876,Fri Apr 20 2018 06:52:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Price and cancelling drivers,"For most places, it must be convenient for some to book grab.. but its not the same case for some like us. The price is crazy! I mean, to compare with uber, grab is double the price than my usual rides. If not for the price, the drivers would most to all of the time cancel our bookings. Another is that, it can be really tough for others when drivers wouldn't book them just because they can see the destination. Hence why we used to love uber when their services was still available, because everyone was given a fair shot with rides. It was up to the consumer if they were gonna take the higher fare if the demand is high and there was not enough supply.  Unlike with your app, it was just like taking a cab where the drivers are the ones to choose their passengers. What's the difference then?",deejhei24,,,,
