ios,ph,,2416660848,Fri Apr 13 2018 08:24:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Unreliable and not customer friendly,"Since the system allows for drivers to choose the rides they want to take, customers like myself are stuck in our current locations spending 15-30 minutes continuously pressing the book button in hopes that someone would accept us and get us to our destination. Not only did they hike up prices after their competition was gone, but they have done nothing to address the past problems of consumers leaving everyone at the mercy of traffic and personal decisions.",Bella0196,,,,
