ios,ph,,2047724560,Mon Jan 01 2018 18:17:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Good but can be better,"Of course will mostly compare to Uber.

Am a Platinum Member, all because i’ve been using it a lot (over Uber).

I like the fixed price, regardless of traffic or duration of the ride

I like the Membership points accumulation, Rewards and Promos.  Been using this a lot

I like the messaging app

I like that you are “entitled” to 1 companion for GrabShare reducing the number of GrabShare passenger to book. Unlike Uber, seats gets maxed out and it feels at times you are in an unmarked UV Express van or the likes

Cons:
Unable to get cars even if there is a lot of cars very very close to pickup point. Is it because driver has option to choose whether to accept and maybe don’t like where the destination is? Grab drivers are “choosy”  Unlike UBer, trips are automatically assigned to “nearest” driver.

Pricing:  Before, i don’t agree with my friends saying Grab has higher price but now, even when i use rewards, Grab does have higher price on about most trips.

If higher pricing, at least give us more promo codes again.  I dont see a lot of these anymore

When using promo codes or rewards, finding a ride becomes much harder.  This is proven because my friends try booking at the same time with me (i am platinum member with “prioritized” booking) yet my friends are able to book faster even same pickup and drop off destination. Again because drivers are “choosy”

Sometimes, when App is searching, there may be a need to cancel before being assigned a Driver. Please add Cancel button when app is searching for a ride. This will reduce the cancellation of rides (affecting both passengers and drivers)

Put back (Flash)option with a filter option to choose which type of rides you want to include in the Flash or quick search.  This was a feature that i really like before, when you’re in a rush, you will go for any type of ride. With the quick search feature, app will allow to search multiple types of rides instead of searching separately, one type of ride at a time. Saves a lot of time and effort for customers.

- some good to have but may not be necessary. - Option to change Payment option mid ride
-option to change destination mid ride (you can add disclaimer button upon changing that this is reason to have fixed pricing change” 

-maybe more explanation or faq on pricing.  Eve with existing documentation, still unable to get exact information on how some stuff works
Example..  i am just not familiar. GrabTaxi. Does the amount shown already includes the booking fee? 

What about Toll Fee? Drivers always ask for Toll Fee from me for trips that uses Toll Fee.  But where does it show on the Receipt?

Thanks",jaxofEden,,,,
