ios,ph,,1959943916,Thu Nov 30 2017 14:35:28 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Suggestion,"Suggestion for an app update:

Scenario: After arriving at my destination, I reviewed the driver and click the ""Submit"" button. Since it sometimes lags, I ended up clicking it a few more times. When it disappears, it is replaced by the booking page. Since the pick up and drop off location is sometimes already filled in and the ""Book"" button is coincidentally on the same  area of the ""Submit"" button, I ended up booking an unintended ride, which I have to cancel.

I hope you guys can help me. Perhaps, change the place of the buttons? Or make it only optional to fill in the location automatically. Thanks!",A Credible Anonymous User,,,,
