ios,ph,,1748324861,Fri Aug 25 2017 14:15:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,The app that makes history,"Warning: dramatic comment ahead. This app along with Uber quickly became part of the Filipino urban culture. It changed the way Filipinos commute as it set the standard of customer service public and private transport groups should deliver by the government who is very elusive of the customer rights we deserve but are being neglected because of corruption. I am no longer scared that on a rainy day I have to wait 3 to 4 hours for a taxi to accept the direction I have to go to or to ask me to pay double. I don't need to be hesitant if the driver has road rage that I may need to leave the cab immediately and find another means to go to work or to that important meeting. I don't need to book a friend's car a week ahead to pick up my relatives going home from the Philippines to avoid the price that airport taxis charge our very own heroes, the balikbayans. Sure the government is working now to improve our public transport services, but only after private competition gets in the way. This is good business, something that challenges the current system to do better.",kuyagabi,,,,
