ios,ph,,1735208450,Sun Aug 20 2017 03:27:03 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Just OK,"The experience hasn't all been a bed-of-roses, so to speak.  I get rejected by Grab Car drivers MOST of the time that it usually takes me around 20 to 30 minutes to book.  I'm on sales so I use this a lot.  It's such a hassle to have to try and try and try booking but I have no other choice.  I even got charged for a booking the DRIVER CANCELLED and have had no response from Grab Support up to now.  I rates you 3 stars still because once you're on, you're welcomed by mostly courteous drivers (most of the time).",meg298507,,,,
ios,ph,,1734578034,Sat Aug 19 2017 15:02:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,The app is great but..,"I only use Grab when an Uber is not available. What I don't like about Grab is they can see the destination so they choose passengers. In Uber they accept all incoming requests regardless of location. In conclusion, Grab is okay if there's no Uber. No choice actually.",Ellise J,,,,
