ios,ph,,1729384442,Tue Aug 15 2017 23:56:51 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Additional Fare,Grab is good for short distanced travel most of the time. I encountered a grab driver at Naia airport asking for a fare x2 of what was calculated. Unbelievable! We use grab to get a fix rate but some drivers decline base on their preference. Unfair.,lovinyouhon,,,,
