ios,ph,,1717214231,Mon Aug 07 2017 14:04:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,iLoveGrab,"I've been using grab for most of my travel and it's really helped me a lot. No need to buy car yet. I can go anywhere cheaply.  No car to maintain and the best part is I can sleep in the passenger seat without worrying my safety. Drivers are well aware of road traffic and safety signs, courteous, and does not ask for additional service charges. One thing though that I'd like this App to have is the option for passengers to add ""tips"" (either by % or amount selection) when using credit cards or grabpay. There are exceptional drivers who deserve tips. Thanks Grab and may God bless us all..!! #LabLabGrab ❤️❤️❤️",tteragram,,,,
ios,ph,,1716764443,Mon Aug 07 2017 07:28:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Promos are more and easier to use!,"With the number of available grab cars, the speed of service and the numerous promos, it's the only ride sharing app I use.",Jennifer Arzadon,,,,
