ios,ph,,1667195255,Mon Jul 03 2017 11:06:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Not a friendly user app,"You don't deserve any rating at all. You don't give exactly the reason for deactivating an account. You just keep on saying you have breached your app's terms and policy. Anyways, there's still Uber and they are way cheaper than yours. 😊",Alexis Mallorca,,,,
ios,ph,,1666842398,Mon Jul 03 2017 04:52:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Same as regular taxi in the Philippines,"In the Philippines, regular taxi drivers do not follow the meter and always wants you to pay extra when they think your destination is too far.

Grab drivers are the same and worse, sometimes, even though there are 50+ drivers around your location, you won't be able to book any because they'd see your destination is too far or traffic is too heavy going there, plus, if they accidentally confirm your booking, they would cancel it immediately without any hesitation.

Also, when your Grab driver passes through a road with a toll fee, you would have to pay for it yourself, with cash, tolls are not included in the fares price.

Needless to say I do not like Grab and I hope their marketshare in the Philippines would lessen and lessen overtime.",paulobreva,,,,
ios,ph,,1666816284,Mon Jul 03 2017 04:21:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,GRABCROOK,"On top of the hidden fees their drivers are free to raise your fare without notifying you in the first place, and they get to do it after your ride!!! Don't do it!!! This Grab app is crap. Stick with Uber.",OctoPau,,,,
