ios,ph,,1607725131,Sun May 07 2017 15:39:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,THIEVES! Not safe. Not reliable!,"Yes they are GRAB. Because they GRAB items you left inside the Grabcar. I have been raising a complaint for weeks and no one has come back to me! Unlike Uber they get back to you in just minutes, they proactively contact you if you left something and it'll reach you! But hell this company for not even coming back, they don't care how people are feeling when they are bothered of a lost or left item. They are even worst than a restaurant when you left something and contact them and say, 'Yes ma'am we have it and you can get it at.. or here.' But you guys, you NEVER bother to come back!!! Not just once but MANY TIMES!!! Always! I will make sure and wont stop writing negative things about you!!! You are thieves!!! I will spread this appalling experience!",KerrDashian,,,,
ios,ph,,1607677498,Sun May 07 2017 14:29:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Awesome,"Every time that I need to go on a certain place which I didn't know, Grab app is there to give me an answer. I always utilize this tool for whatever places I should be and so far the drivers whom I encountered are courteous and kind. If I will be on a regular cab they might ask me additional payment on top of the metered or I will engage with rude and unprofessional taxi drivers. Thank you Grab for keeping us safe and sound on our destination.",Calvin Parado,,,,
