ios,ph,,1603188239,Tue May 02 2017 14:13:23 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,I love it but...,I love this app and I have been using it for some time now. But it has become so expensive. Today when I booked a taxi to my place. The meter fare was 75 pesos. But I eventually paid 150php for my fare. Grabe naman! I didn't know its now plus 50 for booking excluding the 25 pesos on top of the meter. Its a great app but its now too much. I think additional charges should introduced gradually. Plus 10 pesos first then on and on. Not a huge amount. Anyway its a great app 😊😊😊thank you!!!,Noshie❤️,,,,
