ios,ph,,1587745347,Thu Apr 13 2017 11:57:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Safe and reliable transportation.,"Most drivers I've tried are very professional. 

GrabCars are mostly okay -fresh cars and AC works great. 

GrabTaxis are so so. In Manila, they're reliable enough. In Baguio, it takes forever to get a ride. Choosy yata ng mga drivers sa Baguio -sad. 

With GrabCar(6 seater) sometimes you get good cars, sometimes you get AUVs that are just a tad too small especially if you're from/getting to the airport with plenty of luggage. 

Overall, I'm glad that there's this kind of service. Kudos Grab! Grateful and satisfied customer here. 😃",KaybeeDeOcampo,,,,
