ios,ph,,1573798285,Mon Mar 27 2017 10:25:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,My points got deducted,"Grab, in general, is a very good app.  I usually have no problem or whatsoever everytime I use it.  However, I encountered one disappointing experience when I tried to use their Rewards system.  I wanted to redeem the P100 off reward and would have gotten that except that the driver who accepted my ride suddenly called to say that he's already too far from my location and would prefer that I cancel the ride from my end.  Since I was already in a hurry, I just agreed and then chose 'Driver requested that I cancel' from the cancellation reason option.  I felt really bad after finding out that the points I used to redeem the P100 off got deducted when it was not my fault that the driver doesn't want to service me anymore.  When I sent a message to the support team, I got zero reply.  Hope an action can be done with this.",ACN23,,,,
