ios,ph,,1500240273,Mon Dec 12 2016 01:01:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Use Uber instead,"Grab started out good but over time, lost its care for customers - both technologically and service-wise.

Airport pick-up service was not manned, not operational. Used my own app to book, got cancelled by multiple drivers. To add, those cancellations did not appear in my view. Used Uber once and voila, got picked up in around 2 minutes.

Prices are also inflated most of the time. It would be alright to pay a higher fare as long as service is excellent. In Grab's case, your app and your drivers are abysmally incompetent and worthless.

People, DO NOT USE THIS APP. Use Uber instead.",Donat27,,,,
