ios,ph,,1402973466,Thu Jun 30 2016 13:43:35 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,"If i could only give zero to a negative star rating, i would","The 3rd time my driver cancelled/asked to cancel my booking out of 4 bookings since yesterday night. This time, i waited for this driver for around 15-20 minutes and when he finally came to the pick up location, he didn't even wait for even 2 minutes for me. I was searching for this car of his until i found out that he cancelled the booking when i looked in to the app. He didn't even put me in to consideration by texting/calling me to say that he will cancel. This app really is disgusting. This is the 2nd time or 3rd time i rated you negatively. I despise you grab car. By the way the plate number of the driver was YU5701 in case you will act on this even though i know that you wouldn't. I always send mail to grab and they don't answer. They really just don't care to their client. It's just your money they want. GRAB CAR DOES NOT CARE FOR THEIR CLIENT.",lexieness,,,,
