ios,ph,,1396411454,Sat Jun 18 2016 11:32:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Good App,"This is a good App however there are things to make it better, here are my suggestions.

1. If the driver accepted the booking and for some reason they want to cancel it, the passenger should also know their reason for cancellation though I know they would be penalized whenever they cancel a booking.

2. There should be a half star rating, meaning .5, because it is not all the time drivers are perfect 5 but not also 4, so a .5 is a must!

3. Better map navigation, location etc. for drivers as this would make their profession a notch easier for them.

