ios,ph,,1345455796,Thu Mar 10 2016 01:40:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Excellent Options,"I appreciate the initiatives by grab in providing several options for professionals to their daily commute. Grabbike was a revelation to the market. The service has definitely alleviated our traffic-stress to and fro work. Thank you, Grab!",Kammioks,,,,
ios,ph,,1344761984,Tue Mar 08 2016 14:25:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,App issues,"Firstly, i think the interface of the new update is too ""long"" or ""big"" for the size of my iphone 4s's screen? It's very inconvenient especially because it's hard to click some of the buttons at the bottom part e.g. Rate, etc.

Secondly, there was once when i ""cancelled"" a booking but the driver still called my phone a couple of mins after i did so i'm not sure if the problem is with the driver or with the app. This is very inconvenient for both the client and the driver. Please fix that.

Please fix the aforementioned issues because once Uber reaches CDO then bye.",notfazerdaze,,,,
ios,ph,,1344192778,Mon Mar 07 2016 11:12:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Great way to go around the metro safely.,"I have been using Grab for just less than a month and I must say that every ride is a nice experience. Drivers are courteous. They give change although I prefer to round off the fares already. Overall, it gives me the security to even travel in the wee hours knowing I'm safe while on the go. Thank you!",Tryzane,,,,
ios,ph,,1344161379,Mon Mar 07 2016 09:39:15 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Unreliable! I'm switching to Uber!,"It's not reliable and I'm switching to Uber where car drivers aren't picky. The only time GrabTaxi (private car) is reliable is IF the destination is near. 

New user interface is terrible. The old one is simpler and better;  it shows the list of drivers nearby, plate num and how far they are. Now it just shows the name of the driver, which is irrelevant to the bidding stage. Although, it's the drivers who are bidding--but from customers p.o.v. we'd like to see how far the available drivers are. 

It wont allow me to book my 2nd destination while in transit, which is my favorite feature in the old version.

I couldnt book a new one without rating the trip. It's like their forcing the customers to give a rating. 

Why do app developers do that? They always downgrade their app. It's like a trend! And grabtaxi is one of those. 

Let's switch to Uber guys :)",Snoopaddict,,,,
ios,ph,,1343847453,Sun Mar 06 2016 17:36:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,In Transit,"Suggestion for app improvement: Driver should not have an option to select ""Your Driver Has Arrived"" when they are far away from the pick up location. Booked a ride with Grab recently and my driver never showed up so I was surprised why I was ""In Transit"" mode when he was 11mins away from my location. I called him and asked him why he was headed in the opposite direction and he said he picked up another passenger on the road. I couldn't book another ride as my mode was still ""In Transit"" so had to walk and look for another cab. Also please add an Emergency button while ""In Transit"" mode to ensure the safety of passengers.",maimai0805,,,,
ios,ph,,1342936398,Sat Mar 05 2016 06:00:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Helpful and Convenient,"Grab has offered a safe and convenient way for commuters to get around. I've had my fair share of rude and unreasonable taxi drivers. Needs improvement in locating passengers and drivers. 

