ios,ph,,1327081780,Wed Feb 03 2016 11:42:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Drivers don't book,"I'm using Grab in Manila and Davao City. I don't use it that much because riding regular taxis in Davao isn't much of a hassle and I usually have friends to drive me in Manila. BUT whenever I do NEED to use it (ex. no car, It's raining, etc), DRIVERS DON'T BOOK! Around 8 out of 10 uses, I end up not getting Grab taxi because no one wants to take my trip. One driver in Manila even told me that he usually tries to accept passengers who say they'll give a big tip in the notes. Then he asked for a tip from me! WOW how convenient indeed is Grab taxi. Drivers are extremely choosy in booking and ask for tips on top of the booking fee!!!",Melissamichael101,,,,
