ios,ph,,1256595696,Sat Sep 12 2015 17:39:12 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,The Saver,"On a Saturday, my family and I went out to shop in SM Megamall. Unfortunately, its parking queue was so long that we chose to leave the car in Shangri-La. We decided to go home around early evening after a tiring yet fun day. It was raining so hard that we had no idea how to go to the car. Luckily, my officemates introduced me to GrabTaxi and this solved our dilemma. I instantly downloaded the app, registered my phone, and then booked a ride. The process was so fast that my parents were really amazed. Kudos to the GrabTaxi team!",Xtinedolina,,,,
