ios,ph,,1256533666,Sat Sep 12 2015 14:57:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Wonderful Experience,"I only waited for about five minutes before I got in the car and got home in no time from F1 Hotel Manila. The drive was smooth, and the driver knows where to go without using Waze. The car was pretty new and smells good (without the faint smell of the air freshener). I gave it four stars because the driver needs to be proactive in introducing himself when he rings his customer to project confidence and assure his customers safety. Nonetheless, the whole experience was wonderful!😊",Apple Cruda,,,,
