ios,ph,,1253064673,Fri Sep 04 2015 16:41:33 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Totally Definitely Absolutely Grabbed,"I consider GrabCar and GrabPremium rides an affordable luxury in this fast-paced multi-tasking high-tech age.
Even though I have personal cars that I can drive myself, I oftentimes choose Grab for a multitude of reasons. To describe a few:
1. When I need to go to one point while I need to stay connected through my gadgets 
2. When I'm too lazy to take the car of out of the garage
3. When car is coded
4. It's more practical considering the spike of gas rates these days

A real deal!",Lexi_MD,,,,
