ios,ph,,1200566702,Thu May 21 2015 14:22:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Convenient solution for everyday commuters...,"This app has brought me a lot of convenience as a regular commuter. It spares me a great deal of time from the agony of queueing in Taxi Stands after malling. With GT on my fingertips, I never have to worry about how long I have to spend my time in the mall esp. during peak hours where all people are about to go home & there are no taxis arriving in the taxi stands...Oh! TYL for this great relief...❤️💙💚💛",Creyra,,,,
ios,ph,,1200227087,Wed May 20 2015 21:43:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,So far so good. So very good.,"I've used this app maybe five times and each time I've gotten excellent service. Takes away a lot of concerns for someone needing a cab even in the wee hours of the morning. And no driver has tried to ""cheat"" me by taking a longer route or failing to provide the proper change. I don't think I've just been lucky. I think I've had the average good drivers and not the exceptional crooks!!",JB Baylon,,,,
