ios,ph,,1195283459,Sun May 10 2015 14:24:29 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Drivers can cancel your booking on the spot,"Some drivers cancel your booking on the spot especially when they can get passengers while they're on way to pick you up. Really unfair. And now most of them don't even bother to accommodate you anymore. I've been trying to book a taxi for almost two hours every time i try to. It's still the drivers option whether to accommodate a customer or not. There should be somewhat a rule that a customer can only be refused 5 times maximum by your drivers so that each and every one of us will be accommodated, thus providing your customers better service and convenience. Which is the main purpose of having this application in the first place.",dianicejane,,,,
