ios,ph,,1190064548,Thu Apr 30 2015 05:08:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Tipping seems mandatory,"""35-60 drivers nearby"".. So what?! Doesn't mean you'll get a cab instantly. I get rejected 99% of the time. I finally realized why after I read on the internet that I must input a tip. I MUST prepay a tip on top of a booking fee plus metered fare? I'll tip AFTER excellent service, NOT BEFORE my cab even arrives. ""Kontrata"" of taxi drivers through the use of this app.",Angie S. M.,,,,
