ios,ph,,1188768945,Mon Apr 27 2015 10:42:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Use it daily,I use it on daily basis and find GrabTaxi very convenient and reliable. I also like the cash payment option versus credit card only in Uber. All in all very satisfied. If only the fee would be lower then GrabTaxi will be much more competitive. One function I think you need to learn from  EasyTaxi is the possibly to relocate the caller position on the map to a better match of the actual position. GPS and map data are not always accurate.,AndyVN,,,,
