ios,ph,,1187672234,Sat Apr 25 2015 07:03:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Useless,"I have tried to book a taxi for 20 minutes and no one responded. It's raining hard and I needed to book to make sure there's one available just outside my house. 

Grabtaxi is not serving its purpose to easily have a cab available. It even gives you a HARD time trying to book. It's really useless!",nashymayuela,,,,
ios,ph,,1187538119,Sat Apr 25 2015 00:35:24 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Still Unreliable,"GPS needs work with locating passengers, its so far off location which is a huge problem bec passenger cannot manually input actual location. So no choice but to call driver, not good if ur on different cell network. Even if app locates several drivers in the area, passenger needs about 30 minutes lead time for at least one driver to respond & even that is not a guaranty that he will not cancel in the end bec location is inaccurate. There is no assurance that the app will identify nearest driver, its still dependent on drivers accepting passenger request and no recourse if no driver responds.  Severely needs improvement considering there is an add-on premium over flag rate.",SharInCebu,,,,
ios,ph,,1187341561,Fri Apr 24 2015 14:35:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,First time and it was great!,It was my first time using a taxi going home to Cavite and it was awesome! Driver was very accomodating and he made me feel at ease and safe going home. I was home from Makati to Cavite in less than an hour and a half. Kudos Grab-a-taxi!,Ilycc021,,,,
