ios,ph,,1180327095,Thu Apr 09 2015 17:19:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Win-win for taxi drivers & commuters,"Big thumps up for making the lives of commuters easier! I always feel safe when in a GrabTaxi. So far, all the drivers I've booked were very friendly & courteous. Since I am amazed with this latest development in taxi commuting, I always talk to/interview drivers regarding their side of the experience. I am pleased to know that GrabTaxi is not only convenient for commuters but also a very big plus for taxi drivers! It's like they've had an ""increase in salary"".  Thank you GrabTaxi for helping our taxi drivers & uplifting their life status financially with your incentives! Keep it up! Everybody happy!! 👍^_^",mabhhel,,,,
