ios,ph,,1164565466,Sat Mar 07 2015 07:38:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),5,Registered grab a taxi driver driving a different vehicle,"I regularly use grab a taxi/car going to and from work because its very convenient and safe. But there was one time when the taxi that arrived has a different plate number than what was reflected in my cellphone. The driver went on explaining to me that he was legitimate, showing me his ID's and all, and that he was just driving a different taxi that day because the registered one was on ""coding"" that day.  His excuse is reasonable but i hope your management will look into this matter-drivers switching vehicles. I firmly believe that the plate number that reflects in the app should be the one to pick up the passenger for security purposes-no excuses. Thank you.",Qrig,,,,
