ios,ph,,1130844832,Fri Jan 16 2015 13:07:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),2,Unbelievable!!!!!,"A lot of issues with this app. First it is so impossible to get a taxi even if it is just a 5 mins drive away from my place to my work place, so inconvenient. Second, most of the taxi drivers here in malaysia have no sense of urgency and so un professional. Let's say they confirmed that they are already on their way and gave you a 5mins time frame. They would arrive 10mins or worst 20mins. Is this the kind of business you are running? My god. A total waste of our time plus the hassle of waiting for a taxi is so excruciating.",Moltex1987,,,,
