ios,ph,,1125882170,Wed Jan 07 2015 03:53:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Drivers focus on the app not driving,The app is ok but there should be a provision that drivers not be offered another passenger if they have a passenger on board. Drivers are more focus on looking for other passengers even if there is still  someone on board their taxi and has a tendency of getting into an accident. The app should exclude offering new passengers to drivers who currently has a passenger on board. Confirmation from the passenger's app should be sent first that they have been successfully dropped off before they can be included in the pool of available drivers so as not to distract them in driving.,JJAWOLF 24,,,,
ios,ph,,1124083575,Sat Jan 03 2015 18:50:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,great app but needs improvement..,"i've literally been so dependent on this app that everywhere i go i just book a taxi here. it is so easy to do.. however, i think there should be an option that when the taxi arrives, the customer can press, taxi is here or something so it changes window and leads it to a navigation system. it is useful for clients who are not familiar with an area so they know that they are not being cheated on the fare by having taken a longer route by their drivers.. maybe something like waze app.",Janegarci12234,,,,
