ios,ph,,1114228835,Tue Dec 16 2014 15:11:06 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Great help. Nice drivers,"Last december 10,2014 me, my cousin and a friend arrived from our trip in singapore at naia terminal 3 at around 11:45pm. It was my first time in manila and i was already thinking the worst case scenario in terms of getting a taxi at the airport. Grab taxi was a great help we were able to get a cab less than a minute and he is nice. The only problem we encountered was getting in the taxi... When our grab taxi arrive he was scolded by the airport police na sobrang bastos. Kaya ang suggestion ko is sana the airport and malls can provide a grab taxi lane para wla ng hassel.",Epryl,,,,
