ios,ph,,1103008768,Tue Nov 25 2014 16:05:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),3,Always unavailable or none at all,"What I don't like about Grabtaxi's Grabcar is that they are most of the time unavailable at places in the south (Alabang, Las Piñas, Sucat, and Bicutan) and in the north (places after you pass by LRT 1 Roosevelt station). I hate it whenever I wish I could have taken an ordinary cab or drive myself instead due to the unavailability of their Grabcars. As much as possible, I'm using their service to relax from a stressful day at work on my way home. I have also experience two Sunday that it actually took me almost an hour to book myself a car. I e-mailed them about it, but I haven't received any reply. I believe Grabtaxi doesn't have surge on their private cars. I know they have enough cars for people who are in need. Please do something about this.",Chrystina Denise,,,,
