ios,ph,,1099869097,Thu Nov 20 2014 05:57:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,CHEATING DRIVERS,"The app itself works. It doesn't crash and it's easy to use. The drivers however are horrible. They don't use their maps and have to be guided on the phone with directions. They NEVER carry change. On board, most drivers insist on playing their loud crappy taxi music (shouldn't there be a premium?) and their manner and driving style is the same as your stinky taxi. As for the promos, they accept bookings even when I haven't boarded then call and give me hell, yelling, forcing me to cancel cause they got booked by a non-promo. If you're sticking with GRABCAR cause you don't have credit history for uber, open a metrobank savings account. Their debit cards are by MasterCard thus can be used in place of a credit card. Unless grabcar deals with their drivers or you don't mind paying twice the taxi fare for the same experience, use uber instead.",#whyiUBER,,,,
