ios,ph,,1077332902,Wed Oct 08 2014 23:49:21 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),4,Feedback,"GrabTaxi is a win-win formula for passengers, taxi drivers and the initiators of the system.
Last night though, the taxi that came and responded to my request did not bear the same taxi number as that was registered in the system. When I asked, the driver said that he is using another taxi because of the color coding scheme of LTO. THIS SHOULD NOT BE ALLOWED. This defeats the very intention of using taxis that are registered in the system and are therefore, traceable. Also, the meter of the said taxi seems defective. The final reading was Php 30 more than the normal reading for the same route.
I hope Grab will take the necessary action on this matter.",renego77,,,,
