ios,ph,,841725805,Wed Jul 24 2013 00:44:43 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time),1,Frustrated,I tried this app and was excited to use it. I was about to book a cab before 6am so I can be picked up by 7am. There was a prompt saying that there was no taxi nearby and I wanted to call the operator to help. I called the operator and asked to be picked up by 7am.. She said she will text me to confirm. 7am I received an confirmation that a taxi is nearby to pick me up. I was happy because I thought I found an app that is really useful. 7:30am i received a text that the driver couldnt locate me because the gps is showing a different location. I called the driver to tell him I can text him my exact address since the he is still within the area..I called him after I texted him to confirm if he knows the address so I can guide him..he said he received the text and he will be on his way. 7:45am i called him again to ask where he is..he said he is near..8am no cab until 8:15am.. The driver was not answering my call and text.. Really frustrated and disappointed..,mksg.88,,,,
